://api.github.com/users/zecki1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/commits/80540047f4e1eeb387689655e01eb80511d76b06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:39:27Z","email":"zecki1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Zecki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:39:27Z","email":"zecki1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Zecki"},"message":"feat(orbit): publica o workspace e ativa a CI do repo\n\nO repo nao tinha package.json — a CI passava por guard (todos os jobs\npulados) e nao havia nada para deployar. Agora ha um app Angular 22\nstandalone/OnPush que descreve a arquitetura planejada e diz abertamente o\nque ainda nao existe, em vez de simular entrega.\n\n- src/app: shell da pagina (remotos, comandos Nx do dia a dia, aviso de\n  escopo), index.html com title/description/og coerentes e styles com\n  contraste verificado\n- 4 specs Vitest + 6 specs Playwright, incluindo a11y via axe e ausencia de\n  scroll horizontal no mobile\n- lighthouserc.json (4 categorias) e vercel.json com rewrites para /index.html\n- eslint.config.js + target de lint no angular.json\n- .gitignore passa a ignorar coverage, test-results, playwright-report,\n  .lighthouseci e .angular\n- ci.yaml: lighthouse-ci-action@v2 (Lighthouse 5.5.0, 2019) trocado por\n  @lhci/cli 0.14.0, o mesmo dos outros repos\n\nVerificado: lint limpo, build 209.71 kB, 4/4 unit, 6/6 e2e, Lighthouse\naprovando nas 4 categorias.","tree":{"sha":"9b57b09a5ab8473c6591975f4bcc6fb50297cce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/git/trees/9b57b09a5ab8473c6591975f4bcc6fb50297cce1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/git/commits/80540047f4e1eeb387689655e01eb80511d76b06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72816270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.