DQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/commit/72f41eb76e40b646db7bb60214f944d8530a7133","node_id":"C_kwDOUlvMDtoAKDcyZjQxZWI3NmU0MGI2NDZkYjdiYjYwMjE0Zjk0NGQ4NTMwYTcxMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/commit/0d5db37118531869b95b2d84691a3c9402af5dac","sha":"0d5db37118531869b95b2d84691a3c9402af5dac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/commits/0d5db37118531869b95b2d84691a3c9402af5dac"}],"sha":"72f41eb76e40b646db7bb60214f944d8530a7133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/commits/72f41eb76e40b646db7bb60214f944d8530a7133"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72816270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zecki1","id":72816270,"login":"zecki1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODE2Mjcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zecki1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/commits/0d5db37118531869b95b2d84691a3c9402af5dac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:43:48Z","email":"72816270+zecki1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ezequiel Regino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:43:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): bot humano para de falhar sem lockfile + .gitignore de secrets (#9) (#11) (#12)\n\n* fix(ci): bot humano so roda quando ha app e lockfile no repo\n\nO job navegar chamava actions/setup-node com cache: npm antes de qualquer\nverificacao. Nos repositorios em que o app Angular ainda nao foi commitado\nem develop/main nao existe package-lock.json, e o setup-node aborta com\n''Dependencies lock file is not found''. O job falhava a cada execucao do\ncron (a cada 4h) em 7 dos 9 repos do roadmap, gerando os emails de falha.\n\nAgora um job verificar-projeto faz o gate (mesmo padrao ja usado em ci.yaml\ne bot-testes.yaml) e apenas chama de lock e lock tambem. Com o app presente,\no cache volta a funcionar e o tempo de execucao cai.\n\n* chore(segredos): reforca .gitignore contra artefatos de ambiente\n\nO padrao de secrets ja cobria .env, mas faltavam os artefatos que carregam\ncredencial de verdade e que nascem junto com o uso das ferramentas:\n\n- src/environments/ambiente.local.ts: modulo gerado por\n  scripts/gerar-ambiente.mjs com as chaves do .env injetadas\n- .vercel: metadados do projeto e token da CLI da Vercel\n- supabase/.temp: link local do Supabase CLI\n- bundle-analysis/ e out.txt: saidas de analise\n\nNada disso estava versionado hoje; a mudegao e preventiva, para o momento\nem que o scaffold de cada app e o link com o Supabase compartilhado\ncomecarem a produzir esses arquivos na arvore de trabalho.","tree":{"sha":"c7217b5f79cf7dde0c10d0ee068f2170d1b3d972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/git/trees/c7217b5f79cf7dde0c10d0ee068f2170d1b3d972"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zecki1/nx-orbit-microfrontends/git/commits/0d5db37118531869b95b2d84691a3c9402af5dac","verification":{"payload":"tree c7217b5f79cf7dde0c10d0ee068f2170d1b3d972\nparent d55e3f3b0985b71ee9174db8b98f2b3298c9f07d\nauthor Ezequiel Regino <72816270+zecki1@users.noreply.github.com> 1790588628 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790588628 -0300\n\nfix(ci): bot humano para de falhar sem lockfile + .gitignore de secrets (#9) (#11) (#12)\n\n* fix(ci): bot humano so roda quando ha app e lockfile no repo\n\nO job navegar chamava actions/setup-node com cache: npm antes de qualquer\nverificacao. Nos repositorios em que o app Angular ainda nao foi commitado\nem develop/main nao existe package-lock.json, e o setup-node aborta com\n''Dependencies lock file is not found''. O job falhava a cada execucao do\ncron (a cada 4h) em 7 dos 9 repos do roadmap, gerando os emails de falha.\n\nAgora um job verificar-projeto faz o gate (mesmo padrao ja usado em ci.yaml\ne bot-testes.yaml) e apenas chama de lock e lock tambem. Com o app presente,\no cache volta a funcionar e o tempo de execucao cai.\n\n* chore(segredos): reforca .gitignore contra artefatos de ambiente\n\nO padrao de secrets ja cobria .env, mas faltavam os artefatos que carregam\ncredencial de verdade e que nascem junto com o uso das ferramentas:\n\n- src/environments/ambiente.local.ts: modulo gerado por\n  scripts/gerar-ambiente.mjs com as chaves do .env injetadas\n- .vercel: metadados do projeto e token da CLI da Vercel\n- supabase/.temp: link local do Supabase CLI\n- bundle-analysis/ e out.txt: saidas de analise\n\nNada disso estava versionado hoje; a mudegao e preventiva, para o momento\nem que o scaffold de cada app e o link com o Supabase compartilhado\ncomecarem a produzir esses arquivos na arvore de trabalho.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqujbUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAH0gQAF5EHEZzAeg6xxg2AqIHvCtO