vacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dathaynha","id":41243024,"login":"dathaynha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjQzMDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/commits/f2e2f27b5ead324995cf6127d806ee8d312d3a51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:18:07Z","email":"dathaynha@gmail.com","name":"dathq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:18:07Z","email":"dathaynha@gmail.com","name":"dathq"},"message":"Mirror the enforcement layer\n\nAdds `pre-commit-guard.sh` and the `suggesting-hooks` skill, and moves shared\nsettings into `settings.json` where committed settings belong.\n\nThe guard rejects attribution trailers and blocks a commit with a real `.env`\nstaged. Its first version was too broad and blocked the commit documenting it,\nwhich is the more useful half of the story: a hook that cannot distinguish an\ninvocation from a sentence about one will be routed around rather than fixed.","tree":{"sha":"c92a8dfb06aa61cfbbcab655015888ada56768de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/git/trees/c92a8dfb06aa61cfbbcab655015888ada56768de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/git/commits/f2e2f27b5ead324995cf6127d806ee8d312d3a51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41243024?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dathaynha","id":41243024,"login":"dathaynha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjQzMDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dathaynha/datha-platform/commit/f2e2f27b5ead324995cf6127d806ee8d312d3a51","node_id":"C_kwDOUl7hxtoAKGYyZTJmMjdiNWVhZDMyNDk5NWNmNjEyN2Q4MDZlZThkMzEyZDNhNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dathaynha/datha-platform/commit/15470b85c02691f3bbb23aab177f63f3bd759877","sha":"15470b85c02691f3bbb23aab177f63f3bd759877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/commits/15470b85c02691f3bbb23aab177f63f3bd759877"}],"sha":"f2e2f27b5ead324995cf6127d806ee8d312d3a51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/commits/f2e2f27b5ead324995cf6127d806ee8d312d3a51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41243024?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dathaynha","id":41243024,"login":"dathaynha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjQzMDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/commits/15470b85c02691f3bbb23aab177f63f3bd759877/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:08:38Z","email":"dathaynha@gmail.com","name":"dathq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:08:38Z","email":"dathaynha@gmail.com","name":"dathq"},"message":"Refresh the mirror — 23 September 2026\n\nRe-exported from the current state of the sixteen repositories. The change since\nthe last snapshot is entirely in `.claude/`, which gained an enforcement layer:\n\n- `.env` denied at the tool level, with `.env.example` deliberately untouched\n- a `PostToolUse` hook keeping scripted edits prettier-clean, because no test\n  suite can see formatting and the PR linter fails on it\n- the ADO auth rule now names the workarounds that are forbidden rather than\n  only stating the principle\n- critical defects get fixed and pushed rather than queued behind a verb\n\nThe README now points at the rules and hooks directly. Those rules carry the\nincident behind each one, which is the part worth reading.\n\n`settings.local.json` is force-added: a global ignore excludes it by default,\nbut it holds no secrets and the hook registration is meaningless without it.","tree":{"sha":"0f0ca13103eaae647a32a3755e81169d621cfcae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/git/trees/0f0ca13103eaae647a32a3755e81169d621cfcae"}