ha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjQzMDI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dathaynha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/commits/776cbd81da02fd4b0c41e5a85bd35130c716bb02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T16:38:43Z","email":"dathaynha@gmail.com","name":"dathq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T16:38:43Z","email":"dathaynha@gmail.com","name":"dathq"},"message":"Initial commit — read-only mirror of the datha platform\n\nSixteen microservices and microfrontends combined into one repository so the\nplatform can be read in one place. Upstream they are sixteen independent Azure\nDevOps repositories, each with its own pipeline, branch policies and history —\nthat separation is the architecture, not an accident of hosting, so nothing here\nis deployed from here.\n\nOnly git-tracked files were copied, which is what keeps `.env` files, build\noutput and dependencies out by construction rather than by a list someone has to\nmaintain. The frontends'' `environment.dev.ts` is excluded on top of that, since\nit carries real OAuth client ids.\n\nIncludes `_local/` reduced to the Docker Compose stack that runs the\ninfrastructure locally, and the architecture docs under `.claude/docs/`.","tree":{"sha":"eed0ce98c1e3339924f31dec2d33535e5b0bd5e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/git/trees/eed0ce98c1e3339924f31dec2d33535e5b0bd5e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dathaynha/datha-platform/git/commits/776cbd81da02fd4b0c41e5a85bd35130c716bb02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un