rs/realcoderzgulshan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/commits/eb232e2ffaacc94ebc17ecfe27cbe6c1379f6489/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:19:20Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:19:20Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"message":"Add Claude Code project context and a data fingerprint check\n\n- CLAUDE.md (loaded every session): what the app is, commands, folder\n  map, product rules, shared building blocks to reuse, performance\n  rules, definition of done, git/deploy rules and gotchas.\n- .claude/rules/ (loaded with the files they cover): domain-data, ui,\n  testing-qa, people-media and native-build.\n- npm run data:fingerprint hashes the built demo data after import and\n  after every getPage, so domain refactors can show they change nothing.\n- README and ARCHITECTURE point to both; personal Claude files\n  (CLAUDE.local.md, .claude/settings.local.json) are gitignored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca2febfbbccf66c12b26b5e4b5fec2003846ee37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/trees/ca2febfbbccf66c12b26b5e4b5fec2003846ee37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/commits/eb232e2ffaacc94ebc17ecfe27cbe6c1379f6489","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98951683?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/followi