om/users/realcoderzgulshan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/commits/ec47eada0dcd43c9bb9db717445e64659d78af45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:49:42Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:49:42Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"message":"Move QA script boilerplate into scripts/lib/qa.cjs and fix stale checks\n\n- All 24 verify scripts use scripts/lib/qa.cjs (browser launch, seeded\n  workspace, sign-in, routes, dialogs, overflow and error checks,\n  screenshots); password sign-in no longer waits for a code step that\n  never appears, so those checks run 2-3x faster.\n- scripts/lib/static-server.cjs serves preview, verify-pages and\n  verify-refresh; scripts/lib/ffmpeg.cjs is the prepare-* runner.\n- Stale checks updated to the current UI: two login slides, People &\n  Access directory, person chips, paged gate rows, capitalised card labels;\n  verify-demo-media rewritten; unscoped \"Open ...\" selectors now target\n  the records table.\n- Every verify script has a test:* entry; base URLs go through baseUrl().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daa28ce6a611249298e8bb8b799c0f5fb9cf35f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/trees/daa28ce6a611249298e8bb8b799c0f5fb9cf35f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/commits/ec47eada0dcd43c9bb9db717445e64659d78af45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"co