github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/realcoderzgulshan","id":98951683,"login":"realcoderzgulshan","node_id":"U_kgDOBeXiAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/commits/d32c360221cccb18f73f69261e296b2dd41a1d62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:49:33Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:49:33Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"message":"Share duplicated components and helpers, load industries lazily and speed up rendering\n\nShared code:\n- src/domain/common: one FNV-1a hash (was 8 copies), text, time, validation,\n  CSV reading/writing and the bulk-upload reader behind the learner,\n  surveillance-user and class uploads; the demo name pools in one place.\n- contracts/sessionRecords.ts and contracts/pageBuilders.ts for the records the\n  setup forms build and the pages the product extensions add.\n- Setup dialogs share useSetupScope and SetupDialogParts; the three CSV uploads\n  are one CsvBulkUpload; forms use shared/ui/Form.tsx and useFormState.\n- Shared Chip/ChipSelect, SegmentedControl, TabBar, Pager, IconButton variants,\n  media viewer parts; residence and sources setup logic moved to src/domain.\n- WorkspaceScreen split into header, chrome, dialogs, metric detail and setup\n  actions (1621 -> 882 lines); SetupTabs split into components/setup.\n\nPerformance:\n- Industries are built on first read (data/corpora.cjs); derived industries\n  are memoised and built with their source. Start-up data load ~3.1 s -> ~0.2 s\n  in Node, with byte-identical data.\n- Hidden stacked screens freeze (react-freeze); theme memoised, toast in its\n  own context, search and Records keep their own input state.\n- Media Explorer summaries short-circuit; login slides ship as JPEG (~88%\n  smaller) and the wordmark is 1040 px wide.\n\nFixes:\n- A stray {\" \"} inside the icon Svg would crash on iOS/Android.\n- Residence records added under one campus now also show under\n  \"Across campuses\"; picking a scope clears the scope error.\n- Select no longer switches flex/flexShrink (React console error on resize).\n\nAlso includes the initials avatars, warden avatars, Vizenta Admin class\nattendance and column picker work that was not committed yet. Tests load the\nTS hooks themselves; tests/helpers.cjs holds the shared loaders and walker.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e67ba62fe32e81f9e4dc7867402f009633496acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/trees/e67ba62fe32e81f9e4dc7867402f009633496acc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/commits/d32c360221cccb18f73f69261e296b2dd41a1d62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98951683?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/realcoderzgulshan","id":98951683,"login":"realcoderzgulshan","node_id":"U_kgDOBeXiAw","organizations_url":"https://api.g