/commits/8670bc5efdf43fb63bc44ac13d4f18994887481e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:11:58Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T10:11:58Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"message":"Match class session attendance to the legacy data points\n\nFollowing skillatracker-ui-demo''s Attendanceview.jsx, the session attendance\ndetail now shows email, type (Auto or Manual), first and last image captured\ntime, duration, image and recording per learner, with a Mark attendance\naction (confirmed toggle, kept for the session), a session date picker for\nthe previous class days, a View images gallery, a consolidated term report\nand the legacy CSV columns. Captures never run past the 09:45 snapshot, and\nrecordings use the identified demo clip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3194c1ec75d404214f025e68080f7b6af170a796","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/trees/3194c1ec75d404214f025e68080f7b6af170a796"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/commits/8670bc5efdf43fb63bc44ac13d4f18994887481e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98951683?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/realcoderzgulshan","id":98951683,"login":"realcoderzgulshan","node_id":"U_kgDOBeXiAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/received_eve