,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/commits/48655d6fde9c877eecbd8f8b356cfdebfe9c6459/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T07:24:52Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T07:24:52Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"message":"Stop derived demo rows repeating entities; compact manufacturing data\n\n- Derived rows no longer duplicate an entity from their page (a campus on\n  Campus readiness, a gate, vendor, camera or zone). A first-column value is\n  unique unless it is a severity word or the authored rows repeat it; names\n  authored once per plant stay unique per scope; category rows are capped.\n- IDs ending in a year-like number (DSP-2038) now vary; only standalone\n  years are kept.\n- Write manufacturing.json compact like scripts/import-contracts.cjs does\n  (14.8 MB -> 4.7 MB, same content). The web dev bundle drops from 26 MB to\n  16 MB, so local reloads are fast again.\n- Regression test: no derived row repeats a page''s entity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"663fd7ca2a73ba2bf0ea31debc4c2a7bbb6cb312","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/trees/663fd7ca2a73ba2bf0ea31debc4c2a7bbb6cb312"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/commits/48655d6fde9c877eecbd8f8b356cfdebfe9c6459","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98951683?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/user