_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realcoderzgulshan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/commits/484262d44fa622270e6e931e401be88b33dcceb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:52:48Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:52:48Z","email":"gulshan.kumar@realcoderz.in","name":"Gulshan Kumar"},"message":"Fill demo tables with realistic data, per-person HD captures and aligned tables\n\n- Derive 24-30 consistent rows per operational table on first open\n  (demoVolume.ts): people, IDs, room/lane numbers, counts, event times and\n  scopes change together across cells, detail and setup forms; seeded, so\n  reloads and deep links are stable. Catalogs, structural lists and linked\n  education setup pages stay as authored.\n- Replace Corporate''s generic placeholder rows with 1,242 authored rows across\n  105 tabs (corporateDemo.ts, corporate/rows-*.json), scoped per persona.\n- Clean placeholder contacts (example.com, 98765 phones, 192.0.2.x), retail\n  wording copied from Education and record IDs leaking into detail eyebrows.\n- HD demo footage and gender-matched per-person capture stills with UI-drawn\n  detection boxes; compact 640px stills in record detail.\n- Align table cells with trailing actions, uppercase headers, tidy mobile\n  record cards.\n- Priority ordering of product families and focus queue (priority.ts).\n- Tests: demo-volume, detection-demo, priority; scripts/verify-table-alignment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27df983ec7966df1348