6-09-25T14:38:43Z","email":"pratiksha.mishra@realcoderz.in","name":"pratiksha"},"message":"Add Education v2 console features for class, lab, gate and setup\n\n- Class & Lab Attendance follows the Education v2 reference layout\n  (sidebar, header, toolbar, table/cards, record detail), responsive\n  for web, iOS and Android.\n- Class and lab setup: add form, CSV bulk upload, row menu with\n  Learners, Edit and Delete for Dean, Coordinator and Customer Admin.\n- Learners: add, bulk upload, edit and delete; Customer Admin gets a\n  Learners tab.\n- Cameras: create, edit and delete on Class & Lab Sources and Gate\n  Cameras; Gate uses the reference layout.\n- Surveillance Users page for Vizenta Admin and Customer Admin.\n- Gate: User Attendance (with manual marking) and In/Out tabs for\n  Customer Admin, Warden and Vizenta Admin.\n- Warden product: wardens / sub admins, hostels and leave management.\n- Sources & Setup: Setup, Camera Setup, Shift, Camera Criteria,\n  Surveillance Dashboard, Surveillance Attendance and Video Analytics.\n\nPages not in the reference contracts are added in\nsrc/domain/contracts/extensions.ts. No backend is connected: changes\nare kept for the session.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"222199c5e11f68079a4cc9d0eb1992c502904a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/trees/222199c5e11f68079a4cc9d0eb1992c502904a61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gulshan0709/Protoype/git/commits/2da7c2cd72147c37ab6a819c61573d630bf474b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99498382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksha-0101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksha-0101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksha-0101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.co