thub.com","name":"Godfrey Best"},"message":"Reduce page info overload with progressive disclosure\n\n- Remove the scrolling ticker marquee; fold its one-liners into the\n  Last-hour reference as static chips\n- Drop the film-grain overlay and red background gradient; de-stick the\n  quick-nav so only the topbar remains sticky\n- Fold section 02''s concept map, worked code pair, and translations grid;\n  fold the system-design intro grid and hero how-to steps\n- Trim hero to two CTAs and remove the redundant stat strip\n- Calm card voice: sentence-case ink titles, non-italic footers, solid\n  subtle borders, hide section notes on narrow screens\n- Add Expand all / Collapse all / Focus mode page tools, with a\n  scrollable link row and two-row wrap on narrow screens","tree":{"sha":"5659f9c4b64f869cba46aa22f6a3d2f43671c95e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gcbest/prep/git/trees/5659f9c4b64f869cba46aa22f6a3d2f43671c95e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gcbest/prep/git/commits/d7706442f08b25e553d684093c2c31c4147c779c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12885349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gcbest","id":12885349,"login":"gcbest","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODg1MzQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcbest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"