l":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f8235195d24e18049f8851edd6cae1db46938be5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:53:57Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:53:57Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat(frontend): redesign the candidate resume upload UI\n\nReplaced the plain \"A resume is on file (PDF).\" text + raw browser file\ninput (which renders as unstyled \"Choose file / No file chosen\" text,\ninconsistent with everything else in the app) with:\n- A file-status card when a resume exists: document icon, \"Resume on\n  file\" label, and \"View resume\" / \"Replace\" buttons.\n- A dashed empty-state drop-zone when none exists yet: upload icon, \"No\n  resume uploaded yet\", and a prominent primary \"Upload resume\" button.\n- The native <input type=\"file\"> is now visually hidden and triggered via\n  the styled buttons (fileInputRef.current?.click()), so there''s no\n  unstyled browser-default control on the page at all.\n- Added a \"PDF only, up to 5MB\" hint up front instead of only finding out\n  the constraint after a rejected upload.\n\nVerified: frontend build clean, all 21 Vitest tests still passing,\nrebuilt Docker and confirmed live in a browser -- the empty state renders\ncorrectly for a candidate with no resume, and uploading a real PDF (via\nthe API, then reloading) switches it to the file-card state with working\nView/Replace buttons.","tree":{"sha":"a900ec11edbe52c72cb6aa689ebadca359e91a02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/a900ec11edbe52c72cb6aa689ebadca359e91a02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/f8235195d24e18049f8851edd6cae1db46938be5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/f8235195d24e18049f8851edd6cae1db46938be5","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKGY4MjM1MTk1ZDI0ZTE4MDQ5Zjg4NTFlZGQ2Y2FlMWRiNDY5MzhiZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/f950c2f08d6edca5437dff278f439795122a99f5","sha":"f950c2f08d6edca5437dff278f439795122a99f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f950c2f08d6edca5437dff278f439795122a99f5"}],"sha":"f8235195d24e18049f8851edd6cae1db46938be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f8235195d24e18049f8851edd6cae1db46938be5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f950c2f08d6edca5437dff278f439795122a99f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:44:15Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:44:15Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"fix: max-salary semantics, applicant filter parity, job card + logo polish\n\n- Fixed the salary filter''s actual meaning: HR wants candidates within\n  budget (expected_salary <= X), not a floor. Renamed min_salary ->\n  max_salary end-to-end (candidate_service, both routers, both frontend\n  pages) and flipped the comparison from >= to <=.\n- Applicants page (per job) now has the same filters as the candidate\n  directory -- skills (case-insensitive substring), location, minimum\n  experience, and maximum expected salary -- alongside its existing\n  search/status filters. Backend: list_job_applicants joins\n  CandidateProfile to support this, mirroring the existing pattern in\n  candidate_service.search_candidates.\n- Redesigned the My Jobs card''s action row: three cramped inline text\n  links (View applicants | Edit | Deactivate) became icon + label buttons\n  (EyeIcon/PencilIcon/PowerIcon) with real visual hierarchy -- View\n  applicants as the primary action, Edit/Deactivate as secondary -- behind\n  a border-top divider instead of running straight into the header.\n- Replaced the bare \"J\" letter brand mark with a briefcase icon on a\n  gradient badge (new shared BrandMark component, used in both the nav\n  header and the login/register pages), since a plain letter read as an\n  unfinished placeholder rather than a logo.\n\nVerified: backend 79/79 pytest (added a filter-combination test for the\nnew applicant filters, flipped the salary test''s expectations to match\nmax semantics), frontend build clean and all 21 Vitest tests still\npassing (MyJobsPage''s Deactivate/Activate button assertions still resolve\ncorrectly with icons added). Rebuilt the Docker stack and walked it live:\nconfirmed max_salary correctly excludes higher-earning candidates on both\nthe directory and applicants pages, and visually confirmed the new logo\nand job-card design render as intended.","tree":{"sha":"bb28551c8244890b962082f30cb42921e2fbd095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/bb28551c8244890b962082f30cb42921e2fbd095"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/f950c2f08d6edca5437dff278f439795122a99f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co