.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:28:32Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"fix(seed): use the assignment brief''s exact test credentials\n\nThe primary HR and Candidate demo accounts were hr1@jobportal.dev and\ncandidate1@jobportal.dev (password Password123!), not the admin@test.com /\nAdmin@1234 and user@test.com / User@1234 given as the example in the\nassignment brief -- so logging in with those exact credentials correctly\n401''d (they were never seeded, not a bug). Renamed those two accounts to\nmatch the brief exactly; the rest of the seeded roster (hr2, candidate2-6)\nkeeps the jobportal.dev / Password123! pattern. Added a small per-email\npassword override in seed.py rather than a second password constant,\nsince only these two accounts need non-default credentials.\n\nVerified against a fresh `docker compose down -v && up --build`: both\nadmin@test.com/Admin@1234 and user@test.com/User@1234 log in successfully\nvia curl and in a real browser against the production build, backend\n78/78 tests still passing. README''s credentials table and every\n`hr1@jobportal.dev` / `candidate1@jobportal.dev` reference in the feature\nwalkthrough updated to match.","tree":{"sha":"b43adcc73bc6cf40d2db9a47b99e5c122c9c132c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/b43adcc73bc6cf40d2db9a47b99e5c122c9c132c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/502b3be3acaf714c8767689e7578b1ad47c1bc2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/