://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/7d668c6cfaed26eebaad27e6978d06494b0039dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:21:12Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:21:12Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"docs: update README for directory filters, resume viewer, bulk-email beta\n\nReflects this session''s feature additions: HR''s candidate directory\nfilters (skills as case-insensitive substring, min experience, min\nexpected salary), the beta bulk-email stub explicitly called out as\nsending nothing, in-app resume viewing for both roles (not just\ndownload), and expected_salary added to the candidate profile. Backend\ntest count updated (75 -> 78).","tree":{"sha":"7d887e1d100273f2ad3c19319666d13d412788b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/7d887e1d100273f2ad3c19319666d13d412788b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/7d668c6cfaed26eebaad27e6978d06494b0039dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/7d668c6cfaed26eebaad27e6978d06494b0039dc","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKDdkNjY4YzZjZmFlZDI2ZWViYWFkMjdlNjk3OGQwNjQ5NGIwMDM5ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/76581f3b0b9b6e5974ff8deb56578e1ab68e8420","sha":"76581f3b0b9b6e5974ff8deb56578e1ab68e8420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/76581f3b0b9b6e5974ff8deb56578e1ab68e8420"}],"sha":"7d668c6cfaed26eebaad27e6978d06494b0039dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/7d668c6cfaed26eebaad27e6978d06494b0039dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/76581f3b0b9b6e5974ff8deb56578e1ab68e8420/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:20:20Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:20:20Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat(frontend): full visual redesign on Tailwind\n\nKept Tailwind (already integrated, no reason to switch to Bootstrap) but\ndid a real design pass rather than one-off tweaks:\n\n- index.css: Inter font, a `brand` color scale defined once via Tailwind\n  v4''s @theme (indigo, replacing ad-hoc `blue-*` everywhere so the whole\n  product recolors from one place), a shared focus-ring style.\n- New shared components: Button (variant/size, plus a buttonClasses()\n  export for react-router Links styled as buttons), StatCard and icons.tsx\n  (hand-rolled inline SVGs, no icon library dependency -- consistent with\n  the existing hand-rolled charts), AuthCard (shared shell for Login/\n  Register, replacing duplicated wrapper markup).\n- Rebuilt Layout with a sticky header, a brand mark, a user-initial avatar\n  badge, and a real mobile nav (hamburger -> slide-down panel) -- the old\n  nav was a flat link row with no small-screen handling at all.\n- Refined every other shared component (FormField, StatusBadge with a\n  status dot, ErrorBanner with an icon, EmptyState, Spinner, Pagination,\n  ConfirmDialog, BulkEmailDialog, ResumeViewerDialog) and propagated the\n  same card/spacing/radius/shadow conventions (rounded-xl, shadow-sm,\n  hover:shadow-md) across every page in both role areas.\n- Deduplicated the two dashboards'' identical inline StatCard into the one\n  shared component.\n\nVerified: full rebuild + typecheck clean, all 21 frontend tests still\npassing (none of them assert on styling, so this was a pure visual change\nwith no behavior change), and walked every major page live in a browser\nagainst the real Docker stack (both roles, desktop and mobile viewport,\nincluding the hamburger nav) plus the production nginx-served build at\nlocalhost:3001 to confirm the built output matches. Backend 78/78 still\npassing (untouched by this commit).","tree":{"sha":"6826f7453aacd07d3b9bbab1920a14ce36de18b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/6826f7453aacd07d3b9bbab1920a14ce36de18b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/76581f3b0b9b6e5974ff8deb56578e1ab68e8420","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/76581f3b0b9b6e5974ff8deb56578e1ab68e8420","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKDc2NTgxZjNiMGI5YjZlNTk3NGZmOGRlYjU2NTc4ZTFhYjY4ZTg0MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/66ef547f1d711cf7d78a9b27537e615aa1138c7d","sha":"66ef547f1d711cf7d78a9b27537e615aa1138c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/66ef547f1d711cf7d78a9b27537e615aa1138c7d"}],"sha":"76581f3b0b9b6e5974ff8deb56578e1ab68e8420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/76581f3b0b9b6e5974ff8deb56578e1ab68e8420"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/66ef547f1d711cf7d78a9b27537e615aa1138c7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:03:28Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:03:28Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat: in-app resume viewer, substring skills filter, seed backfill\n\n- ResumeViewerDialog: fetches a resume via the authenticated API call and\n  renders it in an iframe inside a modal, with a separate Download button.\n  Wired into the candidate''s own Profile page, HR''s Candidate Detail page,\n  and HR''s Applicants page (each previously only offered a direct\n  download, no in-app preview).\n- Fixed the skills filter on both the candidate directory and job search:\n  `ARRAY.any(skill)` requires an exact, case-sensitive match against one\n  array element, so searching \"script\" never matched a candidate with\n  skill \"TypeScript\" and \"python\" never matched \"Python\". Switched to\n  `array_to_string(...).ilike(...)` for a case-insensitive substring\n  (\"includes\") match, which is what was actually wanted.\n- seed.py now sets phone and expected_salary for the 6 demo candidates\n  (previously only headline/skills/experience/location were seeded, so\n  every demo profile had a NULL expected_salary -- nothing for the new\n  salary filter to match against). Since seeding is intentionally\n  idempotent, this only takes effect on a fresh `docker compose down -v`.\n\nVerified against the rebuilt, freshly-reseeded Docker stack: pytest 78/78\n(added explicit case-insensitive substring-match tests for both filters),\nseeded candidates now return phone/expected_salary from the API, and the\nresume viewer''s auth plumbing confirmed correct end-to-end in a browser --\nvia `fetch()` on the resulting blob URL, confirmed the exact valid PDF\nbytes (right length, right %PDF header) are delivered for both the\ncandidate''s own resume and HR viewing a candidate''s resume. Note: the PDF\nrenders as a blank box in this automated browser''s iframe despite the\ncorrect bytes arriving -- looks like a PDF-plugin limitation of that\nspecific automated Chromium instance, not a bug in the fetch/blob-URL\ncode, but worth a quick check in a real desktop browser to confirm.","tree":{"sha":"bcb6022d6526b5fd8ba2fcd8feca348d59acef9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/bcb6022d6526b5fd8ba2fcd8feca348d59acef9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/66ef547f1d711cf7d78a9b27537e615aa1138c7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/66ef547f1d711cf7d78a9b27537e615aa1138c7d","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKDY2ZWY1NDdmMWQ3MTFjZjdkNzhhOWIyNzUzN2U2MTVhYTExMzhjN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/366c7982dbb677fc10423b8a3d7af59d6eab4aff","sha":"366c7982dbb677fc10423b8a3d7af59d6eab4aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/366c7982dbb677fc10423b8a3d7af59d6eab4aff"}],"sha":"66ef547f1d711cf7d78a9b27537e615aa1138c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/66ef547f1d711cf7d78a9b27537e615aa1138c7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/366c7982dbb677fc10423b8a3d7af59d6eab4aff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T00:46:59Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T00:46:59Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat: add candidate directory filters and a beta bulk-email action\n\n- New candidate_profiles.expected_salary column (migration\n  35b74f41925d) so a \"minimum salary\" filter has something to match\n  against; exposed on the candidate''s own profile page so it''s actually\n  settable, and on CandidateProfileOut/UpdateRequest.\n- HR''s Candidate Directory now filters by minimum experience, minimum\n  expected salary, and skills (min_experience_years and skills filtering\n  already existed on the backend service, just weren''t exposed in the\n  UI yet) alongside the existing name/location search, all composing\n  with AND semantics.\n- Candidate cards get a selection checkbox; selecting one or more shows\n  a \"N selected -> Email selected\" bar that opens BulkEmailDialog.\n- BulkEmailDialog is an intentional beta stub per spec: subject/message\n  form, client-side required-field validation, and on submit just shows\n  \"N candidates will receive the email shortly\" -- no email provider is\n  wired up, and nothing is persisted or sent to the backend. Distinct\n  from the existing real in-app messaging feature (send_bulk /\n  Message model), which still works as before.\n\nVerified end-to-end in a browser against the rebuilt Docker stack: set a\ncandidate''s expected salary and confirmed the directory''s salary filter\ncorrectly includes/excludes them at different thresholds, confirmed\nskills and experience filters compose correctly (AND) with each other,\nand ran the bulk-email flow (empty-field validation, then a real send\nshowing the \"will receive the email shortly\" confirmation, then close\npreserving the selection).\n\nBackend: 76 -> 77 pytest tests (new: directory filtering by experience\nand salary; expected_salary round-trips through profile update).","tree":{"sha":"4f05dc2cfa6a9b290bf93137f4f6aac7023c67bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/4f05dc2cfa6a9b290bf93137f4f6aac7023c67bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/366c7982dbb677fc10423b8a3d7af59d6eab4aff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/366c7982dbb677fc10423b8a3d7af59d6eab4aff","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKDM2NmM3OTgyZGJiNjc3ZmMxMDQyM2I4YTNkN2FmNTlkNmVhYjRhZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/80d2dabcd4b96e3438049e1cb78ece723a021524","sha":"80d2dabcd4b96e3438049e1cb78ece723a021524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/80d2dabcd4b96e3438049e1cb78ece723a021524"}],"sha":"366c7982dbb677fc10423b8a3d7af59d6eab4aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/366c7982dbb677fc10423b8a3d7af59d6eab4aff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/80d2dabcd4b96e3438049e1cb78ece723a021524/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:52:28Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:52:28Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"docs: write comprehensive README\n\nOverview, architecture (diagram + the browser/Docker-network gotcha the\nwhole frontend-build setup is built around), tech stack, how to run,\nports, test credentials (with what''s true about each seeded account,\nverified against seed.py and actual Docker output), a feature walkthrough\nper role including a \"go try the cross-tenant 403 yourself\" callout,\nrunning tests (both suites, with exact verified commands), security notes,\nand known limitations split into what was deliberately closed for this\nbuild (rate limiting, frontend tests) versus what''s left open by design\n(refresh tokens, password reset, etc.), each with a one-line reason.\n\nEvery concrete claim in this doc (test counts, seeded account contents,\nports) was checked against the actual running stack, not written from\nmemory of the plan.","tree":{"sha":"a7c10d2d1155eb5760dadccf3da9b5a285f5a9b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/a7c10d2d1155eb5760dadccf3da9b5a285f5a9b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/80d2dabcd4b96e3438049e1cb78ece723a021524","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/80d2dabcd4b96e3438049e1cb78ece723a021524","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKDgwZDJkYWJjZDRiOTZlMzQzODA0OWUxY2I3OGVjZTcyM2EwMjE1MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/55ce55ee0daefe236d10c347a68c9b618b01292a","sha":"55ce55ee0daefe236d10c347a68c9b618b01292a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/55ce55ee0daefe236d10c347a68c9b618b01292a"}],"sha":"80d2dabcd4b96e3438049e1cb78ece723a021524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/80d2dabcd4b96e3438049e1cb78ece723a021524"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/55ce55ee0daefe236d10c347a68c9b618b01292a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:49:59Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:49:59Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"chore(docker): add idempotent seed script and verify the full compose stack\n\n- app/seed.py: 2 HR accounts, 6 candidates with varied skills/experience/\n  location, 8 jobs (mix of active/inactive, across both HR accounts,\n  varied type/range), 7 applications spanning all three statuses, 3\n  messages (so dashboards, search/filter, and the inbox all have real\n  data on first load). Idempotent via a marker-record check.\n- entrypoint.sh: runs the seed after migrations, gated by SEED_DEMO_DATA.\n\nInstalled Docker (via Colima) in this environment specifically to verify\nthe actual deliverable end-to-end, not just its application code:\n- `docker compose up --build` from a completely clean state (down -v,\n  .env recreated from .env.example only, matching exactly what the\n  assessor will do) brings up db/backend/frontend, all reporting healthy.\n- Migrations run, seed data is created, and a seeded account\n  (hr1@jobportal.dev) logs in successfully through the real container\n  network (browser -> nginx:3001 -> FastAPI:8001 -> Postgres:5434).\n- Opened the built frontend in a real browser at localhost:3001, logged\n  in, and confirmed the HR dashboard reflects the seeded data exactly\n  (4 jobs, 3 active, 5 applicants, 2 shortlisted, correct status\n  breakdown and trend chart).\n- Stopped and restarted the stack (no -v): data persisted via the pgdata\n  volume, and the seed correctly no-ops on the second boot (\"already\n  present, skipping\").","tree":{"sha":"97e141cfd2566b56b8e9cfa4a5d3dec3c1e56f83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/97e141cfd2566b56b8e9cfa4a5d3dec3c1e56f83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/55ce55ee0daefe236d10c347a68c9b618b01292a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":