avatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/5f685d9fdf9799755deef7feeeea490adf635dcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:43:18Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:43:18Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"test(frontend): add Vitest + React Testing Library suite\n\nCloses the one frontend-testing gap flagged in scope: the reference app\nships with none. API modules mocked at the module boundary (vi.mock), not\nthe network layer, keeping tests fast and focused on component behavior.\n\n- AuthContext: no-token startup, /auth/me rehydration, login, logout.\n- ProtectedRoute: unauthenticated redirect, role-mismatch redirect to the\n  user''s own home, correct-role render, and a loading state that renders\n  neither (so it can''t race PublicRoute''s redirect -- see the App.tsx bug\n  fixed in an earlier commit).\n- LoginPage: server error surfaced, client-side required-field check,\n  redirect on success.\n- RegisterPage: password-length, confirm-password-match, and HR-requires-\n  company-name validation all block the API call; correct payload sent\n  and redirect happens on success.\n- JobSearchPage (candidate) and MyJobsPage (HR): loading -> data/empty\n  states, and a real interaction each (debounced search re-queries with\n  the right params; deactivating a job calls the API and flips the badge).\n\nAlso fixed a real test-environment gap found while writing these: React 19\nneeds `IS_REACT_ACT_ENVIRONMENT = true` set explicitly, or async state\nupdates driven by userEvent produce a spurious \"not configured to support\nact()\" warning even though the update is correctly wrapped.\n\nVerified: `npx vitest run` -- 6 files, 21 tests, all passing, no warnings.","tree":{"sha":"10176922ea668da87487c1dd3ae502469d6522be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/10176922ea668da87487c1dd3ae502469d6522be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/5f685d9fdf9799755deef7feeeea490adf635dcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/5f685d9fdf9799755deef7feeeea490adf635dcc","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKDVmNjg1ZDlmZGY5Nzk5NzU1ZGVlZjdmZWVlZWE0OTBhZGY2MzVkY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/ebbf8e53a73f43fb2e7dfef83cd66127532cc482","sha":"ebbf8e53a73f43fb2e7dfef83cd66127532cc482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/ebbf8e53a73f43fb2e7dfef83cd66127532cc482"}],"sha":"5f685d9fdf9799755deef7feeeea490adf635dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/5f685d9fdf9799755deef7feeeea490adf635dcc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/ebbf8e53a73f43fb2e7dfef83cd66127532cc482/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:40:17Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:40:17Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat(frontend): add hr-facing pages\n\n- api/hr.ts, api/client.ts: downloadBlob() helper for protected file\n  downloads (see bug note below).\n- components: JobForm (shared by create/edit, mirrors the backend''s\n  min<=max cross-field validation), StarRating, ConfirmDialog (bulk-action\n  confirmation), charts/StatusBreakdownChart + TrendLineChart (hand-rolled\n  SVG, no chart library, matching the candidate-side pattern).\n- pages/hr: Dashboard (stat cards + status breakdown + 14-day trend),\n  MyJobsPage (activate/deactivate), CreateJobPage, EditJobPage,\n  ApplicantsPage (search/status filters, per-row and multi-select bulk\n  status change with confirmation, ATS star rating, resume download),\n  CandidateDirectoryPage (search/filter), CandidateDetailPage (profile +\n  resume download + send-message form), HRProfilePage.\n- Wired all eight routes into App.tsx under ProtectedRoute allowedRole=\"HR\".\n\nCaught and fixed a real bug while writing ApplicantsPage/CandidateDetailPage\n(before it ever shipped): resume download was originally a plain\n`<a href=\"/api/v1/candidates/{id}/resume\">`, but that endpoint requires a\nBearer token and a browser navigation sends no Authorization header --\nit would have 401''d every time. Replaced with an authenticated axios\nrequest plus a Blob-URL download helper.\n\nVerified live in a browser end-to-end against the real backend (seeded via\nthe API): posted a job (redirects straight to its Applicants page), saw a\ncandidate''s application appear with a correctly-computed 5-star ATS rating,\nselected it and bulk-shortlisted with the confirm dialog, opened the\ncandidate''s directory profile and sent them a message (confirmed persisted\nin Postgres), uploaded a resume for that candidate via the API and\nconfirmed the HR-side \"Download resume\" button now returns a real 200 (not\nthe 401 the original bug would have produced), toggled a job\nactive/inactive from My Jobs, and edited the HR profile.","tree":{"sha":"464301a085b6109a5bdde1c355c4b150715a937d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/464301a085b6109a5bdde1c355c4b150715a937d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/ebbf8e53a73f43fb2e7dfef83cd66127532cc482","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/ebbf8e53a73f43fb2e7dfef83cd66127532cc482","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKGViYmY4ZTUzYTczZjQzZmIyZTdkZmVmODNjZDY2MTI3NTMyY2M0ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/e1aa679721a36dd25bfb9ef3a670911b723fa8c2","sha":"e1aa679721a36dd25bfb9ef3a670911b723fa8c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/e1aa679721a36dd25bfb9ef3a670911b723fa8c2"}],"sha":"ebbf8e53a73f43fb2e7dfef83cd66127532cc482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/ebbf8e53a73f43fb2e7dfef83cd66127532cc482"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/e1aa679721a36dd25bfb9ef3a670911b723fa8c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:34:12Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:34:12Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat(frontend): add candidate-facing pages\n\n- api/{jobs,applications,candidates,messages}.ts: one module per backend\n  resource, mirroring the router structure.\n- components: Layout (role-aware nav + logout), Spinner, EmptyState,\n  Pagination, StatusBadge -- shared across candidate and (later) HR pages.\n- pages/candidate: Dashboard (stat cards), JobSearchPage (debounced\n  search/location/employment-type filters), JobDetailsPage (formatted\n  salary/experience ranges, apply form), MyApplicationsPage (status\n  filter), InboxPage (click-to-mark-read), ProfilePage (profile fields +\n  resume upload).\n- Wired all six routes into App.tsx under ProtectedRoute allowedRole=\n  \"CANDIDATE\".\n\nVerified live in a browser end-to-end against the real backend (seeded via\nthe API, not mocked): registered a candidate, viewed the dashboard, searched\nand filtered jobs, opened a job and submitted an application with a cover\nnote, saw it appear in My Applications with the correct status badge, edited\nthe profile (headline/location/experience/skills) and confirmed it\npersisted, and received + read an HR-sent message in the inbox (unread\nbadge and highlight clear on click, dashboard unread count updates).","tree":{"sha":"4acc7c52199c9a00f24a5264ec32c22d90051af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/4acc7c52199c9a00f24a5264ec32c22d90051af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/e1aa679721a36dd25bfb9ef3a670911b723fa8c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/e1aa679721a36dd25bfb9ef3a670911b723fa8c2","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKGUxYWE2Nzk3MjFhMzZkZDI1YmZiOWVmM2E2NzA5MTFiNzIzZmE4YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/a9da6854fbf79ae1b7c0e41827b279769fc478fc","sha":"a9da6854fbf79ae1b7c0e41827b279769fc478fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/a9da6854fbf79ae1b7c0e41827b279769fc478fc"}],"sha":"e1aa679721a36dd25bfb9ef3a670911b723fa8c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/e1aa679721a36dd25bfb9ef3a670911b723fa8c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/a9da6854fbf79ae1b7c0e41827b279769fc478fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:29:29Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:29:29Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat(frontend): add api client, auth context, and protected routing\n\n- api/client.ts: shared axios instance, auth-header request interceptor,\n  a 401 response interceptor wired to auth logout, and paramsSerializer\n  set to repeated-key form (FastAPI''s expected array query-param format,\n  not axios''s default bracket form).\n- context/AuthContext.tsx: JWT in localStorage, rehydrates via /auth/me\n  on mount, exposes login/register/logout.\n- routes/ProtectedRoute.tsx (role-gated) and PublicRoute.tsx (keeps an\n  authenticated user off /login and /register).\n- pages/public: LoginPage, RegisterPage (client-side validation --\n  required fields, password length, confirm-password match, company name\n  required for HR -- plus mapping of any server-side field errors).\n\nVerified live in a browser against the real backend (not just a type-check):\nregistered an HR account end-to-end, confirmed the row landed correctly in\nPostgres, tested a wrong-password login (error banner renders), then a\ncorrect login.\n\nFound and fixed a real bug during that testing: the catch-all route\nunconditionally redirected to /login, and PublicRoute redirects an\nauthenticated user on /login back to their home path -- since /hr/dashboard\nand /candidate/dashboard don''t exist yet (added in the next two commits),\nthat pairing produced an infinite redirect loop (\"Maximum update depth\nexceeded\"). Fixed by making \"/\" redirect based on auth state and the\ncatch-all render a plain not-found page instead of redirecting, so an\nunmatched URL can never bounce against PublicRoute''s own redirect.","tree":{"sha":"b5c708c3712e1647f4af60a11196ddbb9ca68fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/b5c708c3712e1647f4af60a11196ddbb9ca68fec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/a9da6854fbf79ae1b7c0e41827b279769fc478fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/a9da6854fbf79ae1b7c0e41827b279769fc478fc","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKGE5ZGE2ODU0ZmJmNzlhZTFiN2MwZTQxODI3YjI3OTc2OWZjNDc4ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/f34622fe0cb0d18d275c3eda22695d32f0d4a20f","sha":"f34622fe0cb0d18d275c3eda22695d32f0d4a20f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f34622fe0cb0d18d275c3eda22695d32f0d4a20f"}],"sha":"a9da6854fbf79ae1b7c0e41827b279769fc478fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/a9da6854fbf79ae1b7c0e41827b279769fc478fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f34622fe0cb0d18d275c3eda22695d32f0d4a20f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:24:40Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:24:40Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"test(backend): add pytest suite with real-Postgres savepoint isolation\n\n- conftest.py: derives a separate \"<db>_test\" database from DATABASE_URL,\n  creates it if missing, builds the schema once per session via\n  Base.metadata.create_all/drop_all, and isolates each test in its own\n  transaction using SQLAlchemy 2.0 savepoints (join_transaction_mode=\n  \"create_savepoint\") so a test''s own db.commit() calls work normally\n  while the whole thing rolls back afterward. Real Postgres, not SQLite,\n  because ARRAY+GIN columns aren''t supported there. Resets the slowapi\n  limiter before every test so rate-limit state never leaks between tests.\n- factories.py: plain builder functions (create_hr/create_candidate/\n  create_job/create_application/create_message) instead of hitting the\n  auth endpoints for setup -- keeps ~99% of tests independent of the auth\n  rate limits, which are exercised directly and deliberately only in\n  test_auth.py and test_rate_limit.py.\n- 12 test files, 75 tests: health, auth (incl. inactive-user login\n  rejection), rate limiting (asserts 429 at the real configured threshold),\n  jobs (incl. cross-tenant 403 on edit/status/applicant-list, invalid\n  range rejection, duplicate-application 409, inactive-job 404, ATS-sorted\n  applicant listing), applications (ownership checks both directions,\n  bulk-status excluding non-owned ids), candidates (directory access\n  control, profile update/dedup), resume (valid upload, wrong content-type,\n  spoofed Content-Type with bad magic bytes, oversized, cross-candidate\n  403), hr_profile, dashboard (stat aggregation, HR-scoped isolation), and\n  ats (pure unit tests of the scoring heuristic).\n\nVerified: full suite passes twice in a row against local Postgres 15 with\nno leaked state between runs, confirming the savepoint rollback actually\nisolates each test.","tree":{"sha":"f2b5546764c068cbcff72325591fdbb8f834f2da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/f2b5546764c068cbcff72325591fdbb8f834f2da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/f34622fe0cb0d18d275c3eda22695d32f0d4a20f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/f34622fe0cb0d18d275c3eda22695d32f0d4a20f","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKGYzNDYyMmZlMGNiMGQxOGQyNzVjM2VkYTIyNjk1ZDMyZjBkNGEyMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/45e719fa5e5956d91ff351f0b67360f3e3f4c48b","sha":"45e719fa5e5956d91ff351f0b67360f3e3f4c48b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/45e719fa5e5956d91ff351f0b67360f3e3f4c48b"}],"sha":"f34622fe0cb0d18d275c3eda22695d32f0d4a20f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f34622fe0cb0d18d275c3eda22695d32f0d4a20f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/45e719fa5e5956d91ff351f0b67360f3e3f4c48b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:18:59Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:18:59Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat: add candidate profiles, resume upload, hr profile, dashboards, messaging\n\n- core/storage.py: resume upload validated three independent ways --\n  declared Content-Type, a 5MB size cap, and PDF magic-byte sniffing on the\n  actual bytes -- since a client-declared MIME type alone can''t be trusted\n  for a security-relevant upload gate.\n- candidates.py: own profile CRUD, resume upload/download, HR-only\n  candidate directory with search/filter, HR-only (or self) resume\n  download with an explicit ownership check.\n- hr.py: own HR profile CRUD, own job listing, dashboard stats.\n- messages.py: HR bulk send (invalid/non-candidate recipient ids silently\n  dropped), candidate inbox, unread count, mark-read scoped to the\n  recipient.\n- dashboard_service.py: HR stats (job/application counts, 14-day\n  applications trend) and candidate stats (application counts, unread\n  messages).\n\nVerified end-to-end against local Postgres: profile CRUD for both roles,\nskill-list trimming/dedup, valid resume upload + download, three separate\nrejections (wrong content-type, spoofed Content-Type with bad magic bytes,\noversized file), HR-only directory access (candidate blocked 403),\ncross-candidate resume/message access blocked 403, and dashboard stats.\n\nFound and fixed a real bug during verification: the dashboard''s 14-day\ntrend grouped applications by `func.date(applied_at)`, which truncates in\nthe DB session''s configured timezone (this machine''s local Postgres runs\nas Asia/Kolkata) rather than UTC, so a same-day application could land in\nthe wrong bucket or fall out of the window. Fixed by truncating via\n`func.timezone(\"UTC\", applied_at)` before taking the date, independent of\nthe session''s timezone setting.","tree":{"sha":"771d8033466d3267b72a5f19b23110cab9473004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/771d8033466d3267b72a5f19b23110cab9473004"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/45e719fa5e5956d91ff351f0b67360f3e3f4c48b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/45e719fa5e5956d91ff351f0b67360f3e3f4c48b","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKDQ1ZTcxOWZhNWU1OTU2ZDkxZmYzNTFmMGI2NzM2MGYzZTNmNGM0OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/59aa75a12d739df4bcf123e1e4e900d1a6a0f765","sha":"59aa75a12d739df4bcf123e1e4e900d1a6a0f765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/59aa75a12d739df4bcf123e1e4e900d1a6a0f765"}],"sha":"45e719fa5e5956d91ff351f0b67360f3e3f4c48b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/45e719fa5e5956d91ff351f0b67360f3e3f4c48b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/59aa75a12d739df4bcf123e1e4e900d1a6a0f765/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:15:09Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:15:09Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat(applications): add candidate-facing views, status changes, bulk update\n\n- GET /applications/me: candidate''s own applications enriched with job/\n  company context (CandidateApplicationOut), filterable by status/job.\n- GET /applications/{id}: viewable by the owning candidate OR the owning\n  HR, checked explicitly rather than by role alone.\n- PATCH /applications/{id}/status, PATCH /applications/bulk-status: HR\n  only, scoped to jobs that HR owns. The bulk endpoint silently drops any\n  requested id belonging to another HR''s job rather than 403ing the whole\n  batch -- avoids turning a mixed-ownership request into an oracle for\n  guessing other HRs'' application ids.\n\nVerified end-to-end: candidate sees both of their applications with correct\njob context, a second candidate is blocked (403) from viewing the first\ncandidate''s application, a non-owning HR is blocked from viewing/updating\nan application tied to another HR''s job, and a bulk-status call mixing an\nowned and a non-owned application id updates only the owned one.","tree":{"sha":"217744441aa732d48f1104c984617b48c0e42644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/217744441aa732d48f1104c984617b48c0e42644"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/59aa75a12d739df4bcf123e1e4e900d1a6a0f765","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/59aa75a12d739df4bcf123e1e4e900d1a6a0f765","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKDU5YWE3NWExMmQ3MzlkZjRiY2YxMjNlMWU0ZTkwMGQxYTZhMGY3NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/f1482c356a470d2539427f6f3ef70696eb8543dc","sha":"f1482c356a470d2539427f6f3ef70696eb8543dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f1482c356a470d2539427f6f3ef70696eb8543dc"}],"sha":"59aa75a12d739df4bcf123e1e4e900d1a6a0f765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/59aa75a12d739df4bcf123e1e4e900d1a6a0f765"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f1482c356a470d2539427f6f3ef70696eb8543dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:13:50Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:13:50Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat(jobs): add job CRUD, search/filter, and applicant listing\n\n- schemas/job.py: create/update/status/apply request schemas with\n  cross-field validation (max >= min for experience and salary ranges,\n  matching the DB''s own constraints) and skill deduping.\n- schemas/pagination.py: generic PageParams/PaginatedResponse used across\n  all list endpoints.\n- schemas/application.py: ApplicationOut plus ApplicantOut (adds a\n  candidate-profile summary for HR''s screening view) -- introduced here\n  since job-scoped applicant listing needs it; extended in the applications\n  commit with the request schemas for status changes.\n- services/job_service.py: CRUD, public search/filter (ILIKE + skill/\n  experience/location filters), get_owned_job() ownership helper (reused\n  by update/status/list-applicants so HR can only touch their own jobs\n  regardless of the role check), apply-to-job (404 on missing/inactive job,\n  409 on duplicate via the DB UniqueConstraint), and applicant listing\n  sorted by the computed ATS rating.\n\nVerified end-to-end against local Postgres: job CRUD, candidate blocked\nfrom posting (403), invalid experience/salary ranges rejected (422),\npublic search only returns active jobs, cross-tenant edit/status/applicant\n-list all correctly 403 for a second HR account, duplicate application\ncorrectly 409s, and applying to a deactivated job 404s.","tree":{"sha":"2cead3d299cf4e52f2cf793de3c743e7b8c65757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/2cead3d299cf4e52f2cf793de3c743e7b8c65757"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/f1482c356a470d2539427f6f3ef70696eb8543dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/f1482c356a470d2539427f6f3ef70696eb8543dc","node_id":"C_kwDOUmPTGNoAKGYxNDgyYzM1NmE0NzBkMjUzOTQyN2Y2ZjNlZjcwNjk2ZWI4NTQzZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commit/66f188fec75a278320bb7e0d647f6cd3a18da231","sha":"66f188fec75a278320bb7e0d647f6cd3a18da231","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/66f188fec75a278320bb7e0d647f6cd3a18da231"}],"sha":"f1482c356a470d2539427f6f3ef70696eb8543dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/f1482c356a470d2539427f6f3ef70696eb8543dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/astro-heree","id":105852549,"login":"astro-heree","node_id":"U_kgDOBk8uhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/commits/66f188fec75a278320bb7e0d647f6cd3a18da231/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:11:27Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:11:27Z","email":"aman.kumar.astro@gmail.com","name":"aman-astro"},"message":"feat(auth): add JWT auth, password hashing, role/ownership deps, and rate limiting\n\n- core/security.py: bcrypt hashing, PyJWT HS256 access tokens.\n- core/deps.py: get_current_user / get_current_user_optional / require_role\n  dependency factory. Ownership checks are intentionally NOT here -- they\n  belong in each resource''s service layer, checked independently of role.\n- core/exceptions.py + core/error_handlers.py: typed AppError hierarchy plus\n  global handlers (including reshaped 422s and slowapi''s RateLimitExceeded)\n  all rendering the same {\"error\": {code, message, fields?}} envelope.\n- core/rate_limit.py: slowapi in-memory limiter on POST /auth/login (5/min)\n  and /auth/register (3/min), both env-configurable.\n- routers/auth.py + services/auth_service.py: register (role-specific\n  profile row created in the same transaction), login, /auth/me.\n\nVerified end-to-end via FastAPI TestClient against local Postgres: register\n(HR + candidate), validation error shape, duplicate-email 409, wrong-password\n401, /auth/me with and without a token, and rate-limit 429 after exceeding\nthe login threshold -- all return the consistent error envelope.\n\nNote: email-validator rejects the \"test\" TLD as a reserved/special-use\ndomain (RFC 2606), so demo/seed accounts use \"@jobportal.dev\", not \".test\".","tree":{"sha":"09cc69e632dbc6b9d37c18c66469511439001f93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/trees/09cc69e632dbc6b9d37c18c66469511439001f93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astro-heree/Job-Portal/git/commits/66f188fec75a278320bb7e0d647f6cd3a18da231","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105852549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/astro-heree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":