n  DTO + service proxy with a longer 20s timeout; fail-silent empty result).\n- Front: DesyncQuestionnaire reordered (website first), auto-analyze pre-fills\n  only EMPTY fields (never clobbers edits), tag chips (add/remove), product/who/\n  outreach demoted to optional; required = company + website + >=1 customer.\n- Fail-silent + non-blocking: a failed/slow scrape shows nothing and the user\n  fills the few required fields manually; workspace creation is never blocked.\n- Existing users who already completed the questionnaire are unaffected (the\n  gate skips them entirely).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0bc99797181c59c0bac8321e1d7b97e33060979c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/0bc99797181c59c0bac8321e1d7b97e33060979c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/a0d4a9f29b8eae96c9766512e1f6ca04a8a7e6d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use