-code guards threw \"Google apis auth is not\nenabled\" unless Gmail or Calendar was enabled, blocking the route when only\nCONTACTS_PROVIDER_GOOGLE_ENABLED is on. Add the contacts flag to both gates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7ede053a91f2484d70c5b1c7fc06b6c6181c27f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/f7ede053a91f2484d70c5b1c7fc06b6c6181c27f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/141c34f75d331f4dcf94e9b9162bcc86572d9642","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/141c34f75d331f4dcf94e9b9162bcc86572d9642","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKDE0MWMzNGY3NWQzMzFmNGRjZjk0ZTliOTE2MmJjYzg2NTcyZDk2NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/174de5a17fb9b484495d3c1509ad32bfdc0767e5","sha":"174de5a17fb9b484495d3c1509ad32bfdc0767e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/174de5a17fb9b484495d3c1509ad32bfdc0767e5"}],"sha":"141c34f75d331f4dcf94e9b9162bcc86572d9642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/141c34f75d331f4dcf94e9b9162bcc86572d9642"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/174de5a17fb9b484495d3c1509ad32bfdc0767e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:05:40Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:05:40Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"feat(google-contacts): Import-from-Google button + client-config flag\n\nFrontend: an always-visible \"Import from Google\" section on Settings →\nAccounts (gated by the new isGoogleContactsEnabled client-config flag). If\nGoogle isn''t connected it starts the contacts-only OAuth consent and returns\nto the page; once connected it runs the importGoogleContacts mutation and\ntoasts how many new people were created.\n\nAlso plumbs CONTACTS_PROVIDER_GOOGLE_ENABLED through to the frontend as\nisGoogleContactsEnabled (client-config service + entity, FE type + jotai atom\n+ useClientConfig).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87207e0b63ed97fb7b7a53451f15de270b62ca07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/87207e0b63ed97fb7b7a53451f15de270b62ca07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/174de5a17fb9b484495d3c1509ad32bfdc0767e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/174de5a17fb9b484495d3c1509ad32bfdc0767e5","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKDE3NGRlNWExN2ZiOWI0ODQ0OTVkM2MxNTA5YWQzMmJmZGMwNzY3ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/5c099aea61e030ab4551d1f884e4c4570a123c57","sha":"5c099aea61e030ab4551d1f884e4c4570a123c57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/5c099aea61e030ab4551d1f884e4c4570a123c57"}],"sha":"174de5a17fb9b484495d3c1509ad32bfdc0767e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/174de5a17fb9b484495d3c1509ad32bfdc0767e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/5c099aea61e030ab4551d1f884e4c4570a123c57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:54:12Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T00:54:12Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"feat(google-contacts): contacts-only Google connect + People API import\n\nAdds a CASA-free import-people-from-Google path: the google-apis OAuth\nconnect can now request the two SENSITIVE contacts scopes\n(contacts.readonly + contacts.other.readonly) gated by a new\nCONTACTS_PROVIDER_GOOGLE_ENABLED flag, with the connect availability gate\nrelaxed to allow a contacts-only connection (no Gmail/Calendar required).\n\nNew core module google-contacts exposes an importGoogleContacts mutation\nthat pulls the user''s saved contacts + \"other contacts\" (people they''ve\nemailed, auto-collected by Google) via the People API and creates them as\nPeople through Twenty''s own dedupe-aware CreateCompanyAndPersonService.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ead0752d14fd8900f1bfdd56bfb202c94c02a847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/ead0752d14fd8900f1bfdd56bfb202c94c02a847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/5c099aea61e030ab4551d1f884e4c4570a123c57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/5c099aea61e030ab4551d1f884e4c4570a123c57","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKDVjMDk5YWVhNjFlMDMwYWI0NTUxZDFmODg0ZTRjNDU3MGExMjNjNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/7bf51172d0aac13ffc46d214ec7f43f183743b32","sha":"7bf51172d0aac13ffc46d214ec7f43f183743b32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/7bf51172d0aac13ffc46d214ec7f43f183743b32"}],"sha":"5c099aea61e030ab4551d1f884e4c4570a123c57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/5c099aea61e030ab4551d1f884e4c4570a123c57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/7bf51172d0aac13ffc46d214ec7f43f183743b32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:31:17Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:31:17Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"feat(auth): lift instance workspace cap + allow up to 3 workspaces per user\n\n- Raise MAX_WORKSPACES_WITHOUT_ENTERPRISE_KEY 5 -> 1_000_000: the upstream\n  instance-wide cap blocked ALL new workspace creation on prod once we had a few\n  customers (each customer = a workspace). Self-hosted fork, no practical cap.\n- Add MAX_WORKSPACES_PER_USER = 3, applied to the create guard\n  (signUpOnNewWorkspace) and both Clerk invite-accept guards, so a user may\n  own/join up to 3 workspaces (was effectively 1). Also unblocks the\n  \"user with their own workspace can''t accept an invite\" case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa5ddf63280f0c833be8ad90b9849a4959261b20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/aa5ddf63280f0c833be8ad90b9849a4959261b20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/7bf51172d0aac13ffc46d214ec7f43f183743b32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/7bf51172d0aac13ffc46d214ec7f43f183743b32","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKDdiZjUxMTcyZDBhYWMxM2ZmYzQ2ZDIxNGVjN2Y0M2YxODM3NDNiMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/b30a6f3c3604fd77d3e6cda12162eb719eb0cac6","sha":"b30a6f3c3604fd77d3e6cda12162eb719eb0cac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/b30a6f3c3604fd77d3e6cda12162eb719eb0cac6"}],"sha":"7bf51172d0aac13ffc46d214ec7f43f183743b32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/7bf51172d0aac13ffc46d214ec7f43f183743b32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/b30a6f3c3604fd77d3e6cda12162eb719eb0cac6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T19:34:30Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T19:34:30Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"fix(user): skip orphaned workspace members instead of throwing on login\n\nThe plural `workspaceMembers` resolver runs on every GetCurrentUser (login) and\niterates ALL of the workspace''s members, throwing \"UserEntity workspace not\nfound\" if any member lacks a live core userWorkspace. One orphaned member row\ntherefore bricked login for the ENTIRE workspace. flatMap-skip the orphan (and\nthe no-roles case) so a single bad member row can''t take the workspace down.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"447059fd8ca5e4ef88b21be95feabdf4ba07c4e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/447059fd8ca5e4ef88b21be95feabdf4ba07c4e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/b30a6f3c3604fd77d3e6cda12162eb719eb0cac6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/b30a6f3c3604fd77d3e6cda12162eb719eb0cac6","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKGIzMGE2ZjNjMzYwNGZkNzdkM2U2Y2RhMTIxNjJlYjcxOWViMGNhYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/894c947fbdbacd43650af7e1ff7f8a1f9fdb46cf","sha":"894c947fbdbacd43650af7e1ff7f8a1f9fdb46cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/894c947fbdbacd43650af7e1ff7f8a1f9fdb46cf"}],"sha":"b30a6f3c3604fd77d3e6cda12162eb719eb0cac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/b30a6f3c3604fd77d3e6cda12162eb719eb0cac6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/894c947fbdbacd43650af7e1ff7f8a1f9fdb46cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:51:34Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:51:34Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"fix(auth): one-workspace guard counts only finished workspaces\n\nThe one-workspace-per-user guard in signUpOnNewWorkspace counted ANY user_workspace\nrow (countUserWorkspaces). But a workspace is created as PENDING_CREATION and only\nbecomes ACTIVE/CREATED after onboarding/activation — so an abandoned or failed\nonboarding left a half-provisioned workspace whose row PERMANENTLY blocked the user\nfrom ever creating one (\"You already belong to a workspace\"), which is what an\nexisting lead-gen customer hit on first CRM sign-in. Count only finished\n(ACTIVE/CREATED) workspaces via countActiveUserWorkspaces so a stuck half-created\nworkspace can never self-block, and give the guard a userFriendlyMessage.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5754f18ec3fa1df292cca546318b2c3902fa38a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/5754f18ec3fa1df292cca546318b2c3902fa38a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/894c947fbdbacd43650af7e1ff7f8a1f9fdb46cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":