ix(billing): show AI/leads usage for Admin & internal accounts too\n\nThe AI-usage line was guarded by !isInternal && planLevel !== ''Admin'', but the\nleads line has no such guard — so Admin/internal accounts saw leads usage but\nnot AI. Gate both the sidebar bars and the Plan & Billing AI line on quota > 0\nonly (Trial/Referral still hide — no AI budget). Admin rows carry real figures\n(e.g. $26.61 of $100.00), so they now display.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a2b3a7d08da91c59af1f903783059ca2ec4292a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/4a2b3a7d08da91c59af1f903783059ca2ec4292a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/4b2c7a1903043bec200690a55ae89a1809c6a3f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/4b2c7a1903043bec200690a55ae89a1809c6a3