I $ allowance spent this cycle. The CRM\ncopilot already meters per run via the backend /ai/record path, so this exposes\nthe existing ai_cost_cents / ai_cost_quota_cents on subscription_usage through\nmySubscription (DTO + resolver service map + query) and renders it. Trial/Referral\n(AI quota 0) and internal/Admin hide the AI/leads bars.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cc0e58e2170195eb517dd0734ce8d8b7f0a6c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/5cc0e58e2170195eb517dd0734ce8d8b7f0a6c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/620fe27773db8205778c7833c46935d48de7e9c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/620fe27773db8205778c7833c46935d48de7e9c7","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKDYyMGZlMjc3NzNkYjgyMDU3NzhjNzgzM2M0NjkzNWQ0OGRlN2U5Yzc","parents":