hub.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/90d181e1fd393757daffc48a1625c5bbbfd0c980/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:20:18Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:20:18Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"feat(ai): per-user AI spend cap via the private twenty-backend\n\nLayer a per-user AI budget onto Twenty''s native copilot, metered against\nthe shared lead-gen subscription_usage row (ONE budget across the CRM\ncopilot and the lead-gen platform). New DesyncAiBudgetService calls the\nprivate twenty-backend: /ai/check before each message (fail closed) and\n/ai/record after (best-effort), using the signed-in user''s email/clerkId\nresolved from userWorkspaceId. Config via process.env (TWENTY_BACKEND_URL\n+ TWENTY_BACKEND_SERVICE_TOKEN); no-op when unset. Blocks surface as a\nfriendly AiException(AI_SPEND_LIMIT_REACHED).","tree":{"sha":"694fdd56a73bbcfbc1f155d6bc40bb7c22df9938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/694fdd56a73bbcfbc1f155d6bc40bb7c22df9938"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/90d181e1fd393757daffc48a1625c5bbbfd0c980","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","