":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/93c49963c94233f5b59b5a68fa4b4c9a0e7508ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:52:11Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:52:11Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"revert(ai): use Twenty''s native CRM copilot, drop the custom chat panel\n\nThe custom DesyncAiChatPanel was a bare text completion with no CRM\naccess — it could not read or create records. Twenty ships a native AI\ncopilot + agents + MCP already wired into the CRM (record read/write via\nnative-tool-binder), so use that instead.\n\n- restore SidePanelAskAiPage to render the native AiChatTab\n- remove DesyncAiChatPanel and the crmAiBaseUrl client-config plumbing\n- native AI is enabled by ANTHROPIC_API_KEY on the server (set on the dev\n  service); with only Anthropic configured every model tier auto-resolves\n  to Claude (Sonnet 5 everyday, Opus 5 for the smart tier).\n\nThe metered /internal/ai/complete gateway (monorepo) stays for the\nlead-gen platform''s own search agent.","tree":{"sha":"4ece1f39459ec1d22ce012559b3730c9bdfd78f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/4ece1f39459ec1d22ce012559b3730c9bdfd78f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/93c49963c94233f5b59b5a68fa4b4c9a0e7508ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-De