thub.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/4c1462ac7a67ff562f3fce64f4ca4c3763560687","sha":"4c1462ac7a67ff562f3fce64f4ca4c3763560687","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/4c1462ac7a67ff562f3fce64f4ca4c3763560687"}],"sha":"c126a063a39a6db0d1b6e37a813febd7fd5b4dff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/c126a063a39a6db0d1b6e37a813febd7fd5b4dff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/4c1462ac7a67ff562f3fce64f4ca4c3763560687/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:11:54Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:11:54Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"fix(ai): deliver CRM AI gateway URL via /client-config, not window._env_\n\nThe deployed image never runs inject-runtime-env.sh (the entrypoint\ndoesn''t call it) and sets no REACT_APP_SERVER_BASE_URL, so window._env_\nis empty at runtime and the frontend falls back to window.location.origin\n(the multi-workspace same-origin design). Reading CRM_AI_BASE_URL from\nwindow._env_ therefore always yielded \"\" -> the panel showed \"not\nconfigured\".\n\nMove it onto Twenty''s server-driven client config, the same path Clerk\nconfig already uses:\n- server: client-config.service reads process.env.CRM_AI_BASE_URL (a\n  fork-added var, like ENTITLEMENT_DATABASE_URL) and returns it as\n  ClientConfig.crmAiBaseUrl (@Field on the entity, so REST + GraphQL\n  both carry it).\n- front: crmAiBaseUrlState atom, populated in useClientConfig; the panel\n  reads it and passes it to the chat.\n- revert the src/config + inject-runtime-env.sh window._env_ changes.\n\nDeploy: set CRM_AI_BASE_URL (NOT REACT_APP_*) on the Twenty service.","tree":{"sha":"c7e9c02261b9112597ec4cac30c276912d264af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/c7e9c02261b9112597ec4cac30c276912d264af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/4c1462ac7a67ff562f3fce64f4ca4c3763560687","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-De