ault), sign-in page logo, and\n  sidebar workspace-switcher logo -> Desync D-mark. The default workspace logo\n  is inlined as a data URI so it bypasses getImageAbsoluteURI''s /files prefix\n  and is origin-independent (survives the eventual managed deploy).\n- Browser tab title / og / twitter -> \"Desync CRM\"; theme-color -> teal;\n  pre-hydration background -> parchment (no white flash on load).\n- PWA manifest name + theme/background colors.\n- Sign-in title is generic (\"Welcome\") instead of leaking the workspace/owner\n  name on the logged-out screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ec4205801cfffcba9fba9d488fb29dffa80831f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/4ec4205801cfffcba9fba9d488fb29dffa80831f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/1fcf4c84418950c94809869f75a7baf77c2f10a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync",