nc"},"message":"feat(theme): Desync brand palette (teal accent + parchment neutrals)\n\nRepaint Twenty''s design-token ramps in the Desync brand system, then\nregenerate all theme artifacts. Layout, spacing, fonts and radii are\nunchanged - colors only.\n\n- Accent ramp (blue -> Desync cathedral teal): brand step #0E3D41 light /\n  lifted #6FB8B2 dark. Drives buttons, links, focus rings, selected states.\n- Neutral ramp (-> parchment/slate): warm parchment surfaces at the light end\n  (#F7F4EE ground, limestone, rule) cooling to slate text (#283238); dark mode\n  uses the templar-dark greens (#0E1A17 / #172420) lifting to ink #E9F0EB.\n- Semantic info / illustration / snackbar blues swapped to teal.\n- Regenerated theme-{light,dark}.css, Theme{Light,Dark,Common}.ts and the gray\n  scales via `nx run twenty-ui:generateTokens`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7ec4f3a427092fede228137cdb6c2428d3c6ae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/a7ec4f3a427092fede228137cdb6c2428d3c6ae7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/92f1250ffa7d3154a95950b7f46ae80870083028","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/92f1250ffa7d3154a95950b7f46ae80870083028","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKDkyZjEyNTBmZmE3ZDMxNTRhOTU5NTBiN2Y0NmFlODA4NzAwODMwMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/7734c092373f0be6b2d264faa48164376c2d2077","sha":"7734c092373f0be6b2d264faa48164376c2d2077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/7734c092373f0be6b2d264faa48164376c2d2077"}],"sha":"92f1250ffa7d3154a95950b7f46ae80870083028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/92f1250ffa7d3154a95950b7f46ae80870083028"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jackson-Desync","id":176439956,"login":"Jackson-Desync","node_id":"U_kgDOCoRClA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/7734c092373f0be6b2d264faa48164376c2d2077/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T22:44:05Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T22:44:05Z","email":"jackson@desync.ai","name":"Jackson-Desync"},"message":"feat(auth): Clerk authentication for self-hosted Twenty\n\nReplace Twenty''s email/SSO sign-in with a Clerk token-exchange flow so a\nself-hosted instance authenticates against a Clerk instance:\n\n- Frontend embeds Clerk <SignIn/>; on sign-in it exchanges the Clerk session\n  token for a Twenty session cookie (getAuthTokensFromClerkToken mutation).\n  Clerk is the only sign-in surface when enabled (email/Google/SSO gated off).\n- Backend ClerkAuthService verifies the Clerk JWT (@clerk/backend) and\n  find-or-provisions the Twenty user + workspace (new clerkId column, email\n  fallback), ensuring a workspace membership even for pre-existing Clerk users.\n- clerkId column added via a 2.41 fast instance command (migrations are frozen\n  on this tag); it runs on server boot.\n- Full sign-out across both identity layers, plus a sidebar logout button.\n- @clerk/backend and @clerk/clerk-react pinned to exact versions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad0bca5bc428b684f6b0f344ceee2f4ece31ec17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/ad0bca5bc428b684f6b0f344ceee2f4ece31ec17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/7734c092373f0be6b2d264faa48164376c2d2077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176439956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jackson-Desync/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/