enty-desync/commit/91f18c1fa6d08c9df5591cb54abd49e5241722c8","sha":"91f18c1fa6d08c9df5591cb54abd49e5241722c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/91f18c1fa6d08c9df5591cb54abd49e5241722c8"}],"sha":"1ac815b13e449ca5386ca768115b6ef5bf85db38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/1ac815b13e449ca5386ca768115b6ef5bf85db38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71827178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/91f18c1fa6d08c9df5591cb54abd49e5241722c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:29:10Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:29:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Migrate buttons to Base UI (#25888)\n\nBuilds Button and ButtonGroup on Base UI with consistent variants,\ncolors, sizes, and native element support.\n\nAdds shared MainButton and LightButton presets in\n`twenty-ui/components`, migrates their consumers, and keeps routing and\npage layout in `twenty-front`.\n\nUpdates component documentation and React/Preact examples.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions <github-actions@twenty.com>","tree":{"sha":"da1e1ce45c20d6d4e7d139a691eab9c538e8435a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/da1e1ce45c20d6d4e7d139a691eab9c538e8435a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/91f18c1fa6d08c9df5591cb54abd49e5241722c8","verification":{"payload":"tree da1e1ce45c20d6d4e7d139a691eab9c538e8435a\nparent 4b0dbc34749aba1c5fb44b890d0e903cfd44aa57\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1789568950 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789568950 +0000\n\nMigrate buttons to Base UI (#25888)\n\nBuilds Button and ButtonGroup on Base UI with consistent variants,\ncolors, sizes, and native element support.\n\nAdds shared MainButton and LightButton presets in\n`twenty-ui/components`, migrates their consumers, and keeps routing and\npage layout in `twenty-front`.\n\nUpdates component documentation and React/Preact examples.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions <github-actions@twenty.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqqfGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK4sQAHu4Klx4o2xCerLVzw2UxSmk\nE6YHF5IEgbCfgnd1CkfZFASUWS5XiXwOVCjfmP6ue9b7hCF6Cbi/Zy7ry2j5J97O\nI9Dy0rzp9/BSuz4seTHl+Wb5P9n9wVamlUwT3U87p2Ti2ugIPXj8TFK4HeNiMVwU\ngF72uOPvQiGKeIoN6THcDF6HNZY7TnG0oNK8XMeuFEbd4igkKqJ3wnyQ+mRAvUZG\n6FmY8Y+Aug2MfebuKLXo4aI4tqoQGJvg7GyE/MedMasX7V6LyTLa19bigpFMipUr\n0hUxhuwL9fqJQXb3NHKd3c6M+fjmVQ19aoiuAX2Ns+XfByPEueJW8IehQe2z1o1m\nqnd/DUIbwcn4/SU0uSNo2PkuDkjzmXSRWr9E8R5Lro2tC0YqRUEZrtPLaxCivoz3\nzaXJtXo3gETEZjCzQou3lkqkm1+TtZOBAgj/WDaiigYDBW0adClE/cpq99O6sx0k\n0iW9Pn/B1P0PuJMKn6aIeT71LXwLcyYxrhUX/wPj193leWLLVkQfzEgotGg4t+ur\nhdXREmHOrp6NMNJfAXWWyd7f+hhsjy+Es/JgYr8VRrdLMHJFH6qbB/VuyuekurxL\nbVUK8wUzIC7USYXmnVGiAk4uNoJAB9DB8Q8sjEw2CFfRSuumsqWKAUG0rLdgrSXu\nzuK2RvXjH+BCjPhS+hNh\n=RSpX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T22:58:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/91f18c1fa6d08c9df5591cb54abd49e5241722c8","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKDkxZjE4YzFmYTZkMDhjOWRmNTU5MWNiNTRhYmQ0OWU1MjQxNzIyYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/4b0dbc34749aba1c5fb44b890d0e903cfd44aa57","sha":"4b0dbc34749aba1c5fb44b890d0e903cfd44aa57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/4b0dbc34749aba1c5fb44b890d0e903cfd44aa57"}],"sha":"91f18c1fa6d08c9df5591cb54abd49e5241722c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/91f18c1fa6d08c9df5591cb54abd49e5241722c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29927851?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/martmull","id":29927851,"login":"martmull","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTI3ODUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/4b0dbc34749aba1c5fb44b890d0e903cfd44aa57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:24:35Z","email":"martmull@hotmail.fr","name":"martmull"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:24:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Keep default domain deep links through sign-in and workspace selection (#26073)\n\n## Problem\n\nOn the default domain (`app.twenty.com`) the root router only serves the\nauth routes. Every other path fell through the wildcard to `<Navigate\nto={AppPath.SignInUp} replace />`, which dropped the pathname, the\nsearch params and the hash before the user had a chance to authenticate.\n\nSo an app sharing link like\n`app.twenty.com/settings/applications/available/<id>` landed on\n`/welcome` and, after sign-in and workspace selection, on the workspace\nhome page instead of the app page. The same happened to `/dpa` and to\nthe marketplace install link\n`app.twenty.com/?returnToPath=/settings/applications/available/<id>`,\nwhose `returnToPath` was stripped by the redirect before\n`InitializeQueryParamStateEffect` could read it.\n\n## Before\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a549533-87be-4927-9231-8295fe582446\n\n\n\n## After\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14672f0d-dfe8-42ee-ad28-cec90d47ee00\n\n\n\n## Fix\n\nThe wildcard now renders `RootDeepLinkRedirect` (a generalization of the\nformer `RootAuthorizeRedirect`, which did this for `/authorize` only).\nIt redirects to the sign-in page while keeping the requested path as\n`returnToPath`:\n\n- no path, one mechanism for all of them: `/authorize` no longer needs\nits own route\n- an existing `returnToPath` search param is reused as is instead of\nbeing nested into a new one\n- the deep link''s own search params and hash ride along inside\n`returnToPath`, other search params are preserved on the sign-in URL\n- paths that are not valid return targets (`/`, auth and onboarding\npaths, unsafe values) add no `returnToPath`, as before\n\nFrom there the existing plumbing takes over: `returnToPath` is stored by\n`InitializeQueryParamStateEffect`, forwarded to the workspace subdomain\nby `redirectToWorkspaceDomain` (through workspace selection,\ncredentials, OAuth and SSO alike), and consumed by\n`usePageChangeEffectNavigateLocation` once the user is authenticated on\ntheir workspace.\n\n## Test\n\n`RootDeepLinkRedirect.test.tsx` covers the deep link, the search params\nand hash, the non-nesting of an existing `returnToPath`, the\n`/authorize` case, the index path, auth paths and unsafe values.\n\n```\nnpx jest packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/components/__tests__/RootDeepLinkRedirect.test.tsx --config=packages/twenty-front/jest.config.mjs\n```\n\nRan green along with `usePageChangeEffectNavigateLocation`,\n`DomainShell`, `useAuth` and `SignInUpSsoExchangeTokenEffect` (315\ntests). Typecheck error count on `twenty-front` is unchanged (78, all\npre-existing and unrelated), oxlint and oxfmt are clean on the changed\nfiles.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_019qTMW1eH4iDJVwV7qea6q7)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26073?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"b4482258950f84de03e6a919f055c69e6079b52e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/b4482258950f84de03e6a919f055c69e6079b52e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/4b0dbc34749aba1c5fb44b890d0e903cfd44aa57","verification":{"payload":"tree b4482258950f84de03e6a919f055c69e6079b52e\nparent 17ab0e3e569992ecaaa82f6297ba9889a2a8ccfb\nauthor martmull <martmull@hotmail.fr> 1789568675 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789568675 +0000\n\nKeep default domain deep links through sign-in and workspace selection (#26073)\n\n## Problem\n\nOn the default domain (`app.twenty.com`) the root router only serves the\nauth routes. Every other path fell through the wildcard to `<Navigate\nto={AppPath.SignInUp} replace />`, which dropped the pathname, the\nsearch params and the hash before the user had a chance to authenticate.\n\nSo an app sharing link like\n`app.twenty.com/settings/applications/available/<id>` landed on\n`/welcome` and, after sign-in and workspace selection, on the workspace\nhome page instead of the app page. The same happened to `/dpa` and to\nthe marketplace install link\n`app.twenty.com/?returnToPath=/settings/applications/available/<id>`,\nwhose `returnToPath` was stripped by the redirect before\n`InitializeQueryParamStateEffect` could read it.\n\n## Before\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a549533-87be-4927-9231-8295fe582446\n\n\n\n## After\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14672f0d-dfe8-42ee-ad28-cec90d47ee00\n\n\n\n## Fix\n\nThe wildcard now renders `RootDeepLinkRedirect` (a generalization of the\nformer `RootAuthorizeRedirect`, which did this for `/authorize` only).\nIt redirects to the sign-in page while keeping the requested path as\n`returnToPath`:\n\n- no path, one mechanism for all of them: `/authorize` no longer needs\nits own route\n- an existing `returnToPath` search param is reused as is instead of\nbeing nested into a new one\n- the deep link''s own search params and hash ride along inside\n`returnToPath`, other search params are preserved on the sign-in URL\n- paths that are not valid return targets (`/`, auth and onboarding\npaths, unsafe values) add no `returnToPath`, as before\n\nFrom there the existing plumbing takes over: `returnToPath` is stored by\n`InitializeQueryParamStateEffect`, forwarded to the workspace subdomain\nby `redirectToWorkspaceDomain` (through workspace selection,\ncredentials, OAuth and SSO alike), and consumed by\n`usePageChangeEffectNavigateLocation` once the user is authenticated on\ntheir workspace.\n\n## Test\n\n`RootDeepLinkRedirect.test.tsx` covers the deep link, the search params\nand hash, the non-nesting of an existing `returnToPath`, the\n`/authorize` case, the index path, auth paths and unsafe values.\n\n```\nnpx jest packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/components/__tests__/RootDeepLinkRedirect.test.tsx --config=packages/twenty-front/jest.config.mjs\n```\n\nRan green along with `usePageChangeEffectNavigateLocation`,\n`DomainShell`, `useAuth` and `SignInUpSsoExchangeTokenEffect` (315\ntests). Typecheck error count on `twenty-front` is unchanged (78, all\npre-existing and unrelated), oxlint and oxfmt are clean on the changed\nfiles.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_019qTMW1eH4iDJVwV7qea6q7)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26073?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"