ons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"32e4725ae7aa89f60be61851adc504da0cf1ec18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/32e4725ae7aa89f60be61851adc504da0cf1ec18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/81546a67866b2a4b4e6289cf4cae31e12f56c670","verification":{"payload":"tree 32e4725ae7aa89f60be61851adc504da0cf1ec18\nparent b99496205a23a3a880a68a7d8080f73af4b002fc\nauthor neo773 <62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com> 1789564474 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789564474 +0000\n\nHonor exclude group emails on shared mailboxes (#26060)\n\nForwarded mail to a shared mailbox now skips group and bulk senders\n(team@, noreply@, List-Unsubscribe...) when Exclude group emails is on,\nusing the same rule as polled mailboxes. Toggling it on a shared mailbox\nno longer leaves a group emails cleanup flag that nothing processes.\nPairs with #26059, which exposes the switch.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26060?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqpZKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwr8QACNTPVweob0eeZnObSJIsu0l\nKmKpESqSYMUTScQ12FYuzOGGn9Ut/+Kic/KgLBi22BCfxbCY6X6raMvxQN58XJo9\ndq/9wmlaULo1sQ1yxttSYrxsr6/MOonfUR0YmadmDHBtbKSoip298axh