tatus focused with a blue border while preserving the original\ninteraction tests.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26069?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"170eee4fa8a5d11704457c4f8cf9fcf215cdb348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/170eee4fa8a5d11704457c4f8cf9fcf215cdb348"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/6d98456d58459917639b34b4ea17fd669cfd198b","verification":{"payload":"tree 170eee4fa8a5d11704457c4f8cf9fcf215cdb348\nparent 1e9afea6c0d0c9b9a0ae64afe4b19f2f90bc2347\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1789563997 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789563997 +0000\n\nDisable play functions in UI documentation examples (#26069)\n\nUse stories without play functions for the Tag, Status, and Text\ndocumentation examples. This prevents automatic clicks from leaving Tag\nand Status focused with a blue border while preserving the original\ninteraction tests.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26069?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-l