:{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:25:46Z","email":"62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com","name":"neo773"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:25:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show contact auto-creation and sync options on shared mailboxes (#26059)\n\nShared mailboxes already honor contact auto-creation and the exclude\noptions on import, but their settings page never showed them. The page\nnow reuses the channel details panel, with the exclude switches grouped\nin an Options card below Contact auto-creation (same layout on personal\nmailboxes). Visibility stays hidden for shared mailboxes.\n\n![Shared mailbox\nsettings](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a544c0a6-03a6-49cd-8761-44e53d4c99e8)","tree":{"sha":"2307716fe08e2490f3c3b5708fa64e1d166c4eff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/2307716fe08e2490f3c3b5708fa64e1d166c4eff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/0805587b89f04f9708b85e02171c150958f6baf3","verification":{"payload":"tree 2307716fe08e2490f3c3b5708fa64e1d166c4eff\nparent 85d8434d23b91d4815f37e0bd19b6ebc01edf408\nauthor neo773 <62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com> 1789561546 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789561546 +0000\n\nShow contact auto-creation and sync options on shared mailboxes (#26059)\n\nShared mailboxes already honor contact auto-creation and the exclude\noptions on import, but their settings page never showed them. The page\nnow reuses the channel details panel, with the exclude switches grouped\nin an Options card below Contact auto-creation (same layout on personal\nmailboxes). Visibility stays hidden for shared mailboxes.\n\n![Shared mailbox\nsettings](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a544c0a6-03a6-49cd-8761-44e53d4c99e8)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqorbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXYkQAC2K17ITtfpsUTpwuRA3oDw1\nmBavB8E+B65CJ4kyp6XvAVJjQgl7gm8Dd