, since an\nempty primary email is stored as '''' and additionalEmails as [], and a\ncleared email was sent as an empty handle. Both listeners now only queue\na job when there are emails to match.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26058?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"339cf8737feaab195191e43e1ae647d13e975b01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/339cf8737feaab195191e43e1ae647d13e975b01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/ac91b55ad3616f4a87d96b04cb6afad07f9720bc","verification":{"payload":"tree 339cf8737feaab195191e43e1ae647d13e975b01\nparent 4862252f55454c831ff7c072685594edae00c5fd\nauthor neo773 <62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com> 1789560743 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789560743 +0000\n\nSkip participant matching jobs when no person email is involved (#26058)\n\nPerson listeners queued a participant match job for every create, update\nand destroy batch, even when no email was involved. An API integration\nrewriting non-email person fields in a loop filled the messaging queue\nwith empty jobs and starved email sync.\n\nThe create and destroy filters also let every person through, since an\nempty primary email is stored as '''' and additionalEmails as [], and a\ncleared email was sent as an empty handle. Both listeners now only queue\na job when there are emails to match.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description 