other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Dewin","id":1488979,"login":"Dewin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODg5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dewin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/9a8a193d62103c3aeca76d0e53dfa8f6fe67c0fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:40:36Z","email":"simon.enerstrand@winvoice.se","name":"Simon Enerstrand"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:40:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(messaging): enforce CRLF line endings on raw outbound messages and surface IMAP append error responseText (#26011) (#26017)\n\n## What does this PR do?\n\nResolves #26011 where creating an email draft (or sending messages)\ncontaining two or more paragraphs fails against strict RFC 5322 IMAP\nservers (such as Cyrus/Fastmail) with `NO Message contains bare\nnewlines`. Additionally, surfaces the IMAP server''s rejection reason\n(`error.responseText`) when draft appending fails instead of dropping it\nto an ambiguous `Command failed`.\n\n- Fixes #26011\n\n### Root Cause\n1. When `compileRawMessage` in `ImapSmtpMessageOutboundService` builds\nthe raw MIME email buffer using nodemailer''s `MailComposer`, pure-ASCII\nmulti-paragraph emails (HTML or text) rendered by\n`compileOutboundEmailContent` contain bare line feeds (`\\n`). Because\npure-ASCII short content is emitted as `Content-Transfer-Encoding:\n7bit`, `MailComposer` does not normalize line endings, producing a\nbuffer with bare `\\n`.\n2. When `ImapSmtpMessageOutboundService.createDraft` executes\n`imapClient.append(draftsFolder.path, messageBuffer, [''\\\\Draft''])`,\nstrict IMAP servers enforcing RFC 5322 reject the append command because\nRFC 5322 §2.1 strictly requires CRLF (`\\r\\n`) line delimiters.\n3. When `imapClient.append` rejects, ImapFlow sets `error.message =\n''Command failed''` and stores the server''s explanation on\n`error.responseText`. `createDraft` re-threw the error as-is, obscuring\nthe actual failure cause.\n\n### Changes\n- **Enforced RFC 5322 CRLF Normalization**: Added `normalizeCrlf`\nutility in\n`src/modules/messaging/message-outbound-manager/utils/normalize-crlf.util.ts`\nand integrated it in `ImapSmtpMessageOutboundService.compileRawMessage`\nso all compiled outbound raw message buffers are strictly\nCRLF-terminated (`\\r?\\n` -> `\\r\\n`).\n- **Diagnosability & Error Context**: In\n`ImapSmtpMessageOutboundService.createDraft`, caught append failures and\nsurfaced `error.responseText` (e.g. `Failed to create draft: Message\ncontains bare newlines`) if present.\n- **Unit Tests**:\n- `normalize-crlf.util.spec.ts`: Unit tests verifying bare LF\nconversion, mixed line endings, preservation of existing CRLF, and\nelimination of bare LF in MailComposer multi-paragraph output.\n- `imap-smtp-message-outbound.service.spec.ts`: Unit tests verifying\nthat `createDraft` produces strictly CRLF-delimited buffers, properly\nreleases the IMAP client, and formats errors with `responseText`.\n\n## Verification\n- Local Jest unit tests passed: `node\n../../node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js\n\"normalize-crlf|imap-smtp-message-outbound\" --config jest.config.mjs`\n(9/9 passed).\n\n/closes #26011\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26017?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: neo773 <62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"17abf612565485b77b5663f9199f6524da270b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/17abf612565485b77b5663f9199f6524da270b45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/9a8a193d62103c3aeca76d0e53dfa8f6fe67c0fa","verification":{"payload":"tree 17abf612565485b77b5663f9199f6524da270b45\nparent 2b1f7eeb28e99846396c14d275f017b3b7e8a6aa\nauthor Simon Enerstrand <simon.enerstrand@winvoice.se> 1789555236 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789555236 +0000\n\nfix(messaging): enforce CRLF line endings on raw outbound messages and surface IMAP append error responseText (#26011) (#26017)\n\n## What does this PR do?\n\nResolves #26011 where creating an email draft (or sending messages)\ncontaining two or more paragraphs fails against strict RFC 5322 IMAP\nservers (such as Cyrus/Fastmail) with `NO Message contains bare\nnewlines`. Additionally, surfaces the IMAP server''s rejection reason\n(`error.responseText`) when draft appending fails instead of dropping it\nto an ambiguous `Command failed`.\n\n- Fixes #26011\n\n### Root Cause\n1. When `compileRawMessage` in `ImapSmtpMessageOutboundService` builds\nthe raw MIME email buffer using nodemailer''s `MailComposer`, pure-ASCII\nmulti-paragraph emails (HTML or text) rendered by\n`compileOutboundEmailContent` contain bare line feeds (`\\n`). Because\npure-ASCII short content is emitted as `Content-Transfer-Encoding:\n7bit`, `MailComposer` does not normalize line endings, producing a\nbuffer with bare `\\n`.\n2. When `ImapSmtpMessageOutboundService.createDraft` executes\n`imapClient.append(draftsFolder.path, messageBuffer, [''\\\\Draft''])`,\nstrict IMAP servers enforcing RFC 5322 reject the append command because\nRFC 5322 §2.1 strictly requires CRLF (`\\r\\n`) line delimiters.\n3. When `imapClient.append` rejects, ImapFlow sets `error.message =\n''Command failed''` and stores the server''s explanation on\n`error.responseText`. `createDraft` re-threw the error as-is, obscuring\nthe actual failure cause.\n\n### Changes\n- **Enforced RFC 5322 CRLF Normalization**: Added `normalizeCrlf`\nutility in\n`src/modules/messaging/message-outbound-manager/utils/normalize-crlf.util.ts`\nand integrated it in `ImapSmtpMessageOutboundService.compileRawMessage`\nso all compiled outbound raw message buffers are strictly\nCRLF-terminated (`\\r?\\n` -> `\\r\\n`).\n- **Diagnosability & Error Context**: In\n`ImapSmtpMessageOutboundService.createDraft`, caught append failures and\nsurfaced `error.responseText` (e.g. `Failed to create draft: Message\ncontains bare newlines`) if present.\n- **Unit Tests**:\n- `normalize-crlf.util.spec.ts`: Unit tests verifying bare LF\nconversion, mixed line endings, preservation of existing CRLF, and\nelimination of bare LF in MailComposer multi-paragraph output.\n- `imap-smtp-message-outbound.service.spec.ts`: Unit tests verifying\nthat `createDraft` produces strictly CRLF-delimited buffers, properly\nreleases the IMAP client, and formats errors with `responseText`.\n\n## Verification\n- Local Jest unit tests passed: `node\n../../node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js\n\"normalize-crlf|imap-smtp-message-outbound\" --config jest.config.mjs`\n(9/9 passed).\n\n/closes #26011\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26017?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: neo773 <62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqnI0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnNwQAHHWl07i/Fw5jqYFJkHHb++z\nuXeWjMUj6kEcUg7SNHr+4jiN1X8qExv9sOmylhABS/J5Q8s99u/eW4WvVfg6jXGy\nITztucvS0dPh9NRwYhLg1fqd7D6myd+rpRsMmaLwZ2a3FAAB75n41aLwB/qmrgFA\nQHTx3zbnd151t9jQAJCWqeCc42CUCtQ7NYlI9jsvUVzK1/toEBjIePoEh7QEWC12\nqlgbKun97a+CSraA26LOgYPmIHd7xhx5aPA4SeosRxFzRArzSHnzcHM/4ljFews6\ni9ICbHiFlpoyTq8+XTKjPAEm4l6vpDQnaiNeKVz9f0olYJHKhlXpg701fzRtkujI\nWE9gCw8t7Nyn3eeWsrypj1j5MyqvCatdKdQIkok+zgupdAJbIcQiFX2TrfbwroYd\nDuwV2VVr6rTLW3twLT4rK5tm37mt8Jz01DvWDQXrAXNyM0NhRppB8UHyhFcdVg+j\n5stwBAd07Wi0UnmWorONTtDBMLeOJI3pX3VU6gxW5/5L1r1Fnbo5UIdZnUeyJzLH\nD6YahK4xjMcXzaL10D43K2IHt6xEOvVKPz7dsc3+3/iMxZN5W9j0djVyPL77mtDL\n3lID2/hT4bLKBq2gAMHjH9UGp8yXOU5FytjKTm44+n7hbcuRv1a3Wc73yOuD+vNa\nbmbPnbj8In7/tcbY/Qrl\n=rIZ5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T22:58:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/9a8a193d62103c3aeca76d0e53dfa8f6fe67c0fa","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZXItoAKDlhOGExOTNkNjIxMDNjM2FlY2E3NmQwZTUzZGZhOGY2ZmU2N2MwZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commit/2b1f7eeb28e99846396c14d275f017b3b7e8a6aa","sha":"2b1f7eeb28e99846396c14d275f017b3b7e8a6aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/2b1f7eeb28e99846396c14d275f017b3b7e8a6aa"}],"sha":"9a8a193d62103c3aeca76d0e53dfa8f6fe67c0fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/9a8a193d62103c3aeca76d0e53dfa8f6fe67c0fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19412894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bonapara","id":19412894,"login":"Bonapara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDEyODk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/commits/2b1f7eeb28e99846396c14d275f017b3b7e8a6aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:57:52Z","email":"tdesfrancs@gmail.com","name":"Thomas des Francs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:57:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix custom domain settings spacing (#26007)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe Domain Setup section sat only 8px below the custom-domain input.\nRender it as a sibling section in `SettingsPageContainer`, matching\nGeneral and other settings pages and using their shared 32px section\ngap. Remove the redundant spacing wrapper. Separate the Reload and\ndelete buttons with the standard 8px gap and remove the grouped-button\nborder override.\n\n## Before/After\n\nBefore: 8px between the domain form and Domain Setup.\n\n<img width=\"941\" height=\"448\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11f2cdf8-d98c-4271-9924-3d9747cb1f5d\"\n/>\n\nAfter: the standard 32px settings-section gap and 8px between Reload and\ndelete.","tree":{"sha":"4b066af3e4ab19fbd0a2893e5ece1d6cfe526c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/4b066af3e4ab19fbd0a2893e5ece1d6cfe526c74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/2b1f7eeb28e99846396c14d275f017b3b7e8a6aa","verification":{"payload":"tree 4b066af3e4ab19fbd0a2893e5ece1d6cfe526c74\nparent 712d1c11848a30b9d43775d65d6a060522c8669c\nauthor Thomas des Francs <tdesfrancs@gmail.com> 1789552672 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789552672 +0000\n\nFix custom domain settings spacing (#26007)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe Domain Setup section sat only 8px below the custom-domain input.\nRender it as a sibling section in `SettingsPageContainer`, matching\nGeneral and other settings pages and using their shared 32px section\ngap. Remove the redundant spacing wrapper. Separate the Reload and\ndelete buttons with the standard 8px gap and remove the grouped-button\nborder override.\n\n## Before/After\n\nBefore: 8px between the domain form and Domain Setup.\n\n<img width=\"941\" height=\"448\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11f2cdf8-d98c-4271-9924-3d9747cb1f5d\"\n/>\n\nAfter: the standard 32px settings-section gap and 8px between Reload and\ndelete.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqmgwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0TQQAGEE3cOPR86xsO4VZzuKgCRE\n00M9NcL8I4uw9h2N4EEY9vdQMUPxNyAFoG3sgRT2tj56MpI5vcktbBKKxx8K8LOv\nwPvgKg7avxiE95T+NMqjKT/0VlhoXlLCarYqeSl6A0BxQgbGY11L1w9o3CB0neYu\nPDSOw4RSfscydf/EbKpYe7iOi5syOALVBDhG6QolaJQ9/zO8yMxtjC1xXULD8a0l\n1+5xaw1pvdhvklB6cU++otWpDVmTfLA5nCHmrhGFyi93r6LujsjJ/41J1oj1QYNc\ngiJiLqNyXwF/18nW4KBJTN0sOdvWDxcB9i6enMRGMRifyF+AbArMqOgvs+jqks1A\nkDrXxJocL5wsDLbZCy2CXg8BAHqL21/JxUcaY9C1K950eEkRkEz74PehrxPMFFcy\nfRXITAUAnQGkM6wOwxZSo3880DftI/54QELUarMw+6q/KXfsJi/PTocaAdzuuhFA\nkNcxwBFvFzkTb5TWS5nPqgX/11vZIMQHPYyO76pm4AqE+I8rt/QjMMashKBopsU2\nltdquwAa/QOzJZ31qdTFn4BrHF5i12sqDxAQk8wXxafkfp4zSlwhdrDAOLIAAufb\nNDrejwCO1FxK4fHNs3t1fgzO7vcekI7Rwy0vb+WfvuhvtYsO1x5TxU2RPz+gfwL2\nlYX4mEStp+Csx2Omfg97\n=KSrY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T22:58:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://