rkflows (#26040)\n\nAdds an optional Minimum likelihood field to the Enrich People, Enrich\nCompanies, Enrich Person, and Enrich Company workflow actions so users\ncan choose a stricter match threshold. Leaving it blank keeps the\nexisting defaults.\n\nRejects thresholds outside the integer range 1 to 10 before calling PDL.\n\nAddresses the first request in\nhttps://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/discussions/24889.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/26040?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"06b743178e1984b62e732af443ed5ff81ea19aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/trees/06b743178e1984b62e732af443ed5ff81ea19aaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Desync-ai/twenty-desync/git/commits/712d1c11848a30b9d43775d65d6a060522c8669c","verification":{"payload":"tree 06b743178e1984b62e732af443ed5ff81ea19aaa\nparent 330cf9c39d149e4945cd142d6519bcef56e85628\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1789551011 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789551011 +0000\n\nExpose minimum likelihood in enrichment workflows (#26040)\n\nAdds an optional Minimum likelihood field to the Enrich People, Enrich\nCompanies, Enrich Person, and Enrich Company workflow actions so users\ncan choose a stricter match threshold. Leaving it blank keeps the\nexisting defaults.\n\nRejects thresholds outside the integer range 1 to 10 before calling PDL.\n\nAddresses the first request in\nhttps://