":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:35:53Z","email":"rodrigop_23@outlook.es","name":"Rodrigo Pérez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:35:53Z","email":"rodrigop_23@outlook.es","name":"Rodrigo Pérez"},"message":"feat(catalog): extrae Catalog y Media detrás de Kong\n\nTraslada el CRUD, el pipeline local de imágenes y las migraciones históricas al servicio Catalog/Media en el puerto 3007. Conserva los contratos de stock y configura Inventory con el nuevo origen interno.\n\nRetira los módulos de dominio y el cliente HTTP Identity de API. Actualiza Kong, Compose, OpenAPI, documentación y CI; verifica autenticación, uploads y los escenarios de saga y compensación.","tree":{"sha":"cc61ac78c46736c13bc315b3dcb978bcbd037291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodrigop23/mercadoya-curso-asd/git/trees/cc61ac78c46736c13bc315b3dcb978bcbd037291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodrigop23/mercadoya-curso-asd/git/commits/66cf537aa9f2674848096bebc758ceb56b423b8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112273950?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodrigop23","id":112273950,"login":"rodrigop23","node_id":"U_kgDOBrEqHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/u