"Rodrigo Pérez"},"message":"feat(identity): separa Identity e incorpora Kong con sesión y JWT\n\nExtrae Better Auth a un servicio propio y publica JWT RS256 y JWKS. Kong OSS valida sesiones y credenciales mediante Identity; Orders e Inventory verifican firma y claims por JWKS.\n\nConserva los tokens S2S y Catalog/Media en API. Actualiza Compose, contratos, OpenAPI, CI y documentación, con migraciones que preservan usuarios y sesiones existentes.\n\nVerificación: typecheck, lint, build, tests, OpenAPI y smoke aislado de login, creación y confirmación de pedidos, CORS, logout y Notifications.","tree":{"sha":"5d0cf530d7f72e5cae8156d603b080078087b02b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodrigop23/mercadoya-curso-asd/git/trees/5d0cf530d7f72e5cae8156d603b080078087b02b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodrigop23/mercadoya-curso-asd/git/commits/d7653a4db3ecb3c9677a041e7719bd2a9857aac3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112273950?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodrigop23","id":112273950,"login":"rodrigop23","node_id":"U_kgDOBrEqHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ro