ón por defecto\n\nDirige el alias del BFF y el consumo de reserva y compensación NATS a v2. Conserva el despliegue, health y rutas explícitas v1 con deprecación y sucesor v2.\n\nRegenera OpenAPI, actualiza contracts a 2.0.0 y adapta documentación y demos. Añade pruebas del cutover y verifica la saga, los duplicados y los checks locales de CI.","tree":{"sha":"fbbf6ea9c3444324ff75f212f8976358697eb5d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodrigop23/mercadoya-curso-asd/git/trees/fbbf6ea9c3444324ff75f212f8976358697eb5d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rodrigop23/mercadoya-curso-asd/git/commits/757900cd13a7e0d2f791ce0fc90a111dd589d636","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112273950?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rodrigop23","id":112273950,"login":"rodrigop23","node_id":"U_kgDOBrEqHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodrigop23","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rodrigop23/mercadoya-curso-asd/commit/757900cd13a7e0d2f791ce0fc90a111dd589d636","node_id":"C_kwDOUmZf8doAKDc1NzkwMGNkMTNhN2UwZDJmNzkxY2UwZmM5MGExMTFkZDU4OWQ2MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rodrigop23/mercadoya-curso-asd/commit/715069ce09a7