N tags out of domain events (1a), split cmd/netfulfil/main.go (2a) (#49)\n\n* refactor(events): move JSON wire shape out of domain events into adapter DTOs (tier2 1a)\n\nDomain events in internal/domain/shared carry no struct tags any more. The wire shape (field names/order/encoding) lives in internal/adapters/outbound/eventwire and is applied by the Kafka encoder (both streams) and the log publisher. Wire format unchanged: byte-exact goldens (CloudEvents bytes on events+analytics streams, plus log output) were captured before the change and pass after it. New sensor TestDomainHasNoSerialisationTags (with bad/good fixture test) bans json/db tags under internal/domain/**.\n\n* refactor(cmd/netfulfil): split the 976-line composition root into cohesive files (tier2 2a)\n\nmain.go 976 -> 159 lines; same package main, no new importable package. New files: config.go (env knobs), wiring.go, database.go, publishing.go, capability.go, workers.go, shutdown.go, retry.go. main/serve/wireOrders/startCapabilityOfferCaches broken into named builders; longest function is now 55 lines (was serve 123, main 104). Startup order, shutdown order, env semantics and log messages unchanged; existing cmd tests pass unmodified.","tree":{"sha":"ed2b1cd56186f9df3141b71c6ed15e7d22d05e20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/trees/ed2b1cd56186f9df3141b71c6ed15e7d22d05e20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/commits/bb8dc827ab541f9c18b483a322b21a1591bd3980","verification":{"payload":"tree ed2b1cd56186f9df3141b71c6ed15e7d22d05e20\nparent 8ac9c2de9f187f627e145b84a4de94037c472516\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791291051 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791291051 -0300\n\nrefactor: tier-2 — JSON tags out of domain events (1a), split cmd/netfulfil/main.go (2a) (#49)\n\n* refactor(events): move JSON wire shape out of domain events into adapter DTOs (tier2 1a)\n\nDomain events in internal/domain/shared carry no struct tags any more. The wire shape (field names/order/encoding) lives in internal/adapters/outbound/eventwire and is applied by the Kafka encoder (both streams) and the log publisher. Wire format unchanged: byte-exact goldens (CloudEvents bytes on events+analytics streams, plus log output) were captured before the change and pass after it. New sensor TestDomainHasNoSerialisationTags (with bad/good fixture test) bans json/db tags under internal/domain/**.\n\n* refactor(cmd/netfulfil): split the 976-line composition root into cohesive files (tier2 2a)\n\nmain.go 976 -> 159 lines; same package main, no new importable package. New files: config.go (env knobs), wiring.go, database.go, publishing.go, capability.go, workers.go, shutdown.go, retry.go. main/serve/wireOrders/startCapabilityOfferCaches broken into named builders; longest function is now 55 lines (was serve 123, main 104). Startup order, shutdown order, env semantics and log messages unchanged; existing cmd tests pass unmodified.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxO6rCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYUwQAFi6Id8K0aEpRL2x3Jj5XR15\nc5s0ZdDnOsahmH+gbA5ZQM5SeGX9PA0yrBVpA4LtoNAdbBf1jNDum+6zXaeWggCa\nMjkasJtOkJfVJbDN4hkkxvmcuzDicYJFk61JnIPKxGGtFRHXOl6GZ7nFe62LrgJJ\nFmv9OamfyQCjt4J4v1mm/tl3sd9WRR83t9fvElw7JeYQV65uNrUc2m8/bUR/lkr4\nPh6pJfay/TSq1rr97m2jQcs1GX8NzqU519RkYgN20y/HBhDDH3YgNDwuDYWqN42k\nG3zxJygLQfz3K9QcaFwc3v+zYPPwBqHXDTFCiX3zpRB4z86MtwOqNJ4IweKqV00m\nT6UC5Qnsr7W8SKyr4P5SDZcpJ+rnBCjOb1ABUuIo9WU+dCtWBAj80tcTG6sBOMFx\nEq8FXkbNSWiZ/3d+AzROQbLHwQXFyO1W+pjf5sJpZfUWymjpLFK989euzny+66RY\n1aMg+LutCb66uLePHX8UxgtdbbkwRaVP/Skgi2tB5Y+X6Fs3yPqpzQUCzWYoKzo0\nLCJFfOyukAZl/8+Cih6MlZw9FazjM5m0ghvsTANIqbHBA+mk+MNISx6iaciNpcWw\nNdbmXHLBJ8IruB7RS6krWKvx/pk+LLXcAStkaaeKHa742hU1OrgznmoFdrM643bI\nzVX5I9x3dIwvdHQ8hG4m\n=C9sS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T12:50:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4