a@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"message":"feat(events)!: CloudEvents 1.0 mandatory envelope, remove flat envelope\n\nEvery Kafka message on warehouse.network-fulfillment.events and\nwarehouse.network-fulfillment.analytics is now a CloudEvents 1.0\nstructured-mode event built with sdk-go v2.16.2''s event package via the\nnew internal/adapters/kafka/cloudevents helper, carrying the\ncontent-type: application/cloudevents+json; charset=UTF-8 header.\n\n- Publishers (direct + outbox Encode path) emit only CloudEvents: id minted\n  once at encode time and persisted in the outbox row, subject=networkRef,\n  type=com.warehouse.wes.network-fulfillment.networkorder.<Event>,\n  dataschema=urn:warehouse:network-fulfillment:<events|analytics>:<Event>:v1.\n  Payload unchanged; analytics schema_version removed. Key + Hash\n  balancer unchanged.\n- Analytics consumer decodes with cloudevents.Decode, dispatches on the\n  full type, dedupes on id, reads time from attributes, payload via DataAs;\n  non-CloudEvents (incl. legacy flat) messages are dead-lettered at once.\n- Delete Envelope/AnalyticsEnvelope/analyticsEnvelope and short-name\n  dispatch.\n- Golden exact-JSON tests per type on both streams, legacy-rejection unit +\n  testcontainers tests, integration tests updated to the CE wire format.\n- apis/asyncapi.yaml (new), ADR 0008, ADR 0003/0004 notes, README,\n  AGENTS.md, .claude rules/skills.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: wire format changed; must deploy together with the fleet\ncutover (see warehouse-infra docs/cloudevents-cutover.md).","tree":{"sha":"826ea9b7017f22b96225bf40c2fbf61dc42c4d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/trees/826ea9b7017f22b96225bf40c2fbf61dc42c4d46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/commits/28ce0b6f05b17f6c0da7059ec705cf1a0b252079","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co