cy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/commits/6437e13675407cb8b54fd4909b3c727a397a5865/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:40:39Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:40:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(complexity): enforce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations (#22)\n\n* ci(complexity): enforce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations\n\nEnable the five complexity linters in .golangci.yml (gocyclo 15, gocognit 20,\ncyclop 15 / package-average 10, funlen 80 lines/50 statements, nestif 5;\n_test.go exempt from funlen/gocyclo, web/ exempt from all five) and add a\ndedicated `complexity` CI job (golangci-lint --enable-only + gocyclo report\nin the step summary, gated into docker-publish). Refactor every\npre-existing violation with zero behavior change: table-driven problem\ncatalogs, split wiring/relay/policy functions, named test helpers instead\nof t.Run closures. golangci-lint, go build/vet, go test ./... all green.\n\n* ci(complexity): gocyclo report needs filesystem paths (go list -f {{.Dir}}), dedup + web filter on output","tree":{"sha":"702fe8239e7575ee49ee8cd58b1606052ce2ef01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/trees/702fe8239e7575ee49ee8cd58b1606052ce2ef01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/commits/6437e13675407cb8b54fd4909b3c727a397a5865","verification":{"payload":"tree 702fe8239e7575ee49ee8cd58b1606052ce2ef01\nparent c32e5ecafe0f74db1594648393536ae9f5370b42\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790559639 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790559639 -0300\n\nci(complexity): enforce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations (#22)\n\n* ci(complexity): enforce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations\n\nEnable the five complexity linters in .golangci.yml (gocyclo 15, gocognit 20,\ncyclop 15 / package-average 10, funlen 80 lines/50 statements, nestif 5;\n_test.go exempt from funlen/gocyclo, web/ exempt from all five) and add a\ndedicated `complexity` CI job (golangci-lint --enable-only + gocyclo report\nin the step summary, gated into docker-publish). Refactor every\npre-existing violation with zero behavior change: table-driven problem\ncatalogs, split wiring/relay/policy functions, named test helpers instead\nof t.Run closures. golangci-lint, go build/vet, go test ./... all green.\n\n* ci(complexity): gocyclo report needs filesystem paths (go list -f {{.Dir}}), dedup + web filter on output","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqucWXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAe0AQAJ8dM1aTQumW8k3GGyFf6dc0\nPTNV7qZ30Kd+9CBscL4XbCCfNmY1veeNAaRuzCSCPVGbFdoKE70N4yDudoIq3DrO\n1pmO+fkQXedjUHVkNNN8qkaD8eOnI2DXNtIJDvwGzx5FmeLjM/yDFsI1pBHIR4tB\n/Ax5Sq1PSLFGB+elKa+t3bJfSFIfqeVM2cW0sWykOma1k4IyzR78IgA6PMCIHxgF\n8/144rBF4r/XpCKFqedSo7ZSgpfjfKCi8j59ZUkLRv951YQf8PwPGRi2hxR71sDF\noNEILz9PmGwLGNC6ryfT/6leOTIMAQveusQ644VmOO3wCkXmUsIqzmRZgZLnTfvq\nemzF25