o de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T12:15:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: add trivy-scan, docker-publish, release jobs (order-management parity) (#9)\n\nAdds the packaging/publish trio that order-management already has:\n- trivy-scan: build-only image scan, blocks CRITICAL/HIGH w/ fix, PR->main only\n- docker-publish: push to ghcr.io/claudioed/network-fulfillment, cosign sign,\n  SBOM generation + attestation, push-to-main only\n- release: auto-bump semver from latest vX.Y.Z tag, re-tag image, package+push\n  Helm chart to oci://ghcr.io/claudioed, git tag, GitHub Release w/ chart .tgz\n\nRuns needs: [docker-publish] and only on push to main, matching the fleet\nconvention. main branch does not exist yet in this repo; these jobs will\nstart actually running once main is cut and DOCKERHUB_* secrets aren''t\nneeded since publish target is GHCR (built-in GITHUB_TOKEN).","tree":{"sha":"b6213eaacb4f68fd8b720ce098a246fd3a423c9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/trees/b6213eaacb4f68fd8b720ce098a246fd3a423c9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/commits/36bfc33f99ff29a577c53210e39b84ab5e579f6f","verification":{"payload":"tree b6213eaacb4f68fd8b720ce098a246fd3a423c9e\nparent 09fd8e98e52ef9d2baa3ef4abf97e1b6822cb064\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790424944 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790424944 -0300\n\nci: add trivy-scan, docker-publish, release jobs (order-management parity) (#9)\n\nAdds the packaging/publish trio that order-management already has:\n- trivy-scan: build-only image scan, blocks CRITICAL/HIGH w/ fix, PR->main only\n- docker-publish: push to ghcr.io/claudioed/network-fulfillment, cosign sign,\n  SBOM generation + attestation, push-to-main only\n- release: auto-bump semver from latest vX.Y.Z tag, re-tag image, package+push\n  Helm chart to oci://ghcr.io/claudioed, git tag, GitHub Release w/ chart .tgz\n\nRuns needs: [docker-publish] and only on push to main, matching the fleet\nconvention. main branch does not exist yet in this repo; these jobs will\nstart actually running once main is cut and DOCKERHUB_* secrets aren''t\nneeded since publish target is GHCR (built-in GITHUB_TOKEN).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt7dwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1DIQAGojskd3/hmSjL32hS6SibHK\nO6OP+s80zFIk6QfenJNItF3BPZN8uHBX7rKp2PkgqazR5ac/osqSGeWmZTc5isNs\nov0CVWe5gdVliLrX1DuJvSUgt1neoCjLLE44XiVoyDxt0mUDQ+ZyX9QCu9XZmEOI\nS4YTBFs4xjXR8VjC0xafO0OeDY3zPq30rTH3uq3lXe/SeCQcW+ToYJLEDd3P0H3t\nI1yTtQHaIO/OG3mqLMoIr+es/n+KUQfniDyBc454iF13PRAd3MlMNLEPZw7kbMRB\nDAl926saJbJ1O8zXk6JlbZMB4ZMvMiSgC75PdqsLlkYrQ3n+0fjpI6L++xrCW8M9\nSTu/0vjUEV2hWq6hCqQG8UfwLBvW5K4b0yZ3N7/yApL4PjfytgMqHhKkvtjPfCdk\nialwi8XOjN8ghtAvrXLhWoKUupAxRA7klX+IxfJvJPIIXGUT3sMJzYa3DZsSyP7l\ny7S/FVoH0SA3EagMNQPXWCkOzdZsELCMoEBIHYh7VjN2OljJb+Mn+2DlkMhZurT/\n1OB1A66ZZD4aYrAFia/js9K0ZhUDOeNY0Bh2UmqsVNeWRRLkH7zVo3/lhMUHaAiC\nkNxJvw2Ddy4/ueWo26UxaBg1z7iAVLnQAgTyUimnffbKpiK15RoV4/FoSWi7Sv/U\nZweYlCkjAlPQF8goeWch\n=AID4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T12:15:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscri