ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T02:25:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: refresh project documentation against develop (#8)\n\n* docs: refresh project documentation against develop\n\nThe README still described a design-stage repo with one Proposed ADR and\nno implementation. develop has shipped the NetworkOrder skeleton and ACL\nboundary (#2), the requiredShipBy planner (#3), the Dockerfile and Helm\nchart with a fail-closed credential guard (#4), Postgres persistence (#5),\nthe inbound leg (#6) and first-dial reset survival (#7).\n\n- README: Status rewritten (what exists / what is not built yet), ADR\n  0001 shown as Accepted (it already is, with OM ADR 0020), structure\n  tree, env var table, local quality gate, CI jobs, no-main note.\n- .claude/rules/*.md: replace the unfilled template skeletons with the\n  real domain model, the four read-only REST routes, and the fact that\n  there is no Kafka yet.\n- .claude/skills/*.md: add a repo-specific preamble to each template\n  skill naming what does and does not exist here (no web/, no Kafka,\n  no docs site, no features/, ADRs in docs/adr/).\n- .claude/commands/architecture-review.md: ADR path docs/adr/.\n\n* docs(agents): refresh AGENTS.md against develop; add CLAUDE.md symlink\n\nAGENTS.md described a pre-implementation skeleton (planned tree, dropped CI\njobs, skeleton rules). It now matches origin/develop: real package tree,\nCI jobs, env vars, and deployment via warehouse-infra/terraform/network-fulfillment.tf.\nCLAUDE.md is added as a symlink to AGENTS.md so Claude Code and Codex read\nidentical context.","tree":{"sha":"f1dee6528c6a7391c2ca3a5779434bb7ea44647f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/trees/f1dee6528c6a7391c2ca3a5779434bb7ea44647f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/network-fulfillment/git/commits/09fd8e98e52ef9d2baa3ef4abf97e1b6822cb064","verification":{"payload":"tree f1dee6528c6a7391c2ca3a5779434bb7ea44647f\nparent 6cf8812f15295e41b75c1197456cd0e24e0ff402\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790389536 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790389536 -0300\n\ndocs: refresh project documentation against develop (#8)\n\n* docs: refresh project documentation against develop\n\nThe README still described a design-stage repo with one Proposed ADR and\nno implementation. develop has shipped the NetworkOrder skeleton and ACL\nboundary (#2), the requiredShipBy planner (#3), the Dockerfile and Helm\nchart with a fail-closed credential guard (#4), Postgres persistence (#5),\nthe inbound leg (#6) and first-dial reset survival (#7).\n\n- README: Status rewritten (what exists / what is not built yet), ADR\n  0001 shown as Accepted (it already is, with OM ADR 0020), structure\n  tree, env var table, local quality gate, CI jobs, no-main note.\n- .claude/rules/*.md: replace the unfilled template skeletons with the\n  real domain model, the four read-only REST routes, and the fact that\n  there is no Kafka yet.\n- .claude/skills/*.md: add a repo-specific preamble to each template\n  skill naming what does and does not exist here (no web/, no Kafka,\n  no docs site, no features/, ADRs in docs/adr/).\n- .claude/commands/architecture-review.md: ADR path docs/adr/.\n\n* docs(agents): refresh AGENTS.md against develop; add CLAUDE.md symlink\n\nAGENTS.md described a pre-implementation skeleton (planned tree, dropped CI\njobs, skeleton rules). It now matches origin/develop: real package tree,\nCI jobs, env vars, and deployment via warehouse-infra/terraform/network-fulfillment.tf.\nCLAUDE.md is added as a symlink to AGENTS.md so Claude Code and Codex read\nidentical context.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqty0gCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPOoQAIZTItpZsTHmAe6OdQDAN1Ew\nnnFMzFXI6X7rmPlHIsyBSUHXCzViqizsdH95/9wwduvytEKggWSMJosL3wgojOiD\n0E2OWCdkRy8SaOAKtSPWDjx3blU35VbjF1PqdsuMu+h4jshV8dkcwR3ia5/LrtDY\n3hOvVDXW5XSSE3yZ7O9gxzaXt5eBlY52bijl