h/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test-ai/commits/4684aa7be6c18b70484f32642fa777807cabd051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T05:36:47Z","email":"olt_hemmerich@gmx.de","name":"Thomas Hemmerich"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T05:36:47Z","email":"olt_hemmerich@gmx.de","name":"Thomas Hemmerich"},"message":"Nx-Workspace mit Anwendungsrahmen, Fachmodulen und UI-Libs anlegen\n\n- App anwendungsrahmen setzt Shell und Fachmodule zusammen (ein Deployment)\n- Shell-Lib anwendungsrahmen mit Navigation und Startseite\n- Fachmodule bestandsdaten, provisionsdatenerfassung, auswertung mit je einer Beispielseite\n- UI-Libs wuf und wub, Lib shared\n- Modulgrenzen per ESLint, Fachmodule lazy geladen (vorbereitet für Module Federation)\n- CI-Workflow mit format:check, lint, test, build\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"302a283a18f7ac6a5a0df416d30fb1b0fe315b27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test-ai/git/trees/302a283a18f7ac6a5a0df416d30fb1b0fe315b27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test-ai/git/commits/4684aa7be6c18b70484f32642fa777807cabd051","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3725151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/themmerich","id":3725151,"login":"themmerich","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjUxNTE=","organizat