aa9cd3fee85cd16f3634e67747fa6f36e7bc973/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:40:49Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:40:49Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"fix: compare internal service secret as bytes, not str\n\nhmac.compare_digest raises TypeError on a non-ASCII str, so a raw\nnon-ASCII header 500''d instead of 401''ing. Same defect already fixed on\nthe webhook secret check; here a non-ASCII INTERNAL_SERVICE_SECRET would\nhave 500''d every internal call forever. Encode both sides to utf-8 first,\nmirroring app/api/webhook.py._authorised. Add the matching regression test.","tree":{"sha":"25ec6bc7511056eeb90d52ab3b94d9f3ad414d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/git/trees/25ec6bc7511056eeb90d52ab3b94d9f3ad414d60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/git/commits/5aa9cd3fee85cd16f3634e67747fa6f36e7bc973","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commit/5aa9cd3fee85cd16f3634e67747fa6f36e7bc973","node_id":"C_kwDOUmw9T9oAKDVhYTljZDNmZWU4NWNkMTZmMzYzNGU2Nzc0N2ZhNmYzNmU3YmM5NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commit/3c191dc8e6dbfb3cdfaabccade3136661b6e6026","sha":"3c191dc8e6dbfb3cdfaabccade3136661b6e6026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/3c191dc8e6dbfb3cdfaabccade3136661b6e6026"}],"sha":"5aa9cd3fee85cd16f3634e67747fa6f36e7bc973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/5aa9cd3fee85cd16f3634e67747fa6f36e7bc973"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/3c191dc8e6dbfb3cdfaabccade3136661b6e6026/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:40:43Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:40:43Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"fix: deliver replies to the conversation, not the sender\n\nInboundMessage had no conversation field, so the webhook rendered replies\nto msg.channel_user_id — correct for identity, wrong for delivery. In a\ngroup the sender and the chat differ, so the bot answered somewhere other\nthan where it was asked, or failed outright if it couldn''t open a DM.\n\nAdd InboundMessage.conversation_id, populate it from Telegram''s chat.id,\nand deliver there while identity keeps resolving from the sender.\n\nTest fixtures previously gave sender and chat the same id, which cannot\ncatch this; they now default to different values.","tree":{"sha":"f2c0f2137b0514e49bd4850aa81f016082d2b4a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/git/trees/f2c0f2137b0514e49bd4850aa81f016082d2b4a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/git/commits/3c191dc8e6dbfb3cdfaabccade3136661b6e6026","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commit/3c191dc8e6dbfb3cdfaabccade3136661b6e6026","node_id":"C_kwDOUmw9T9oAKDNjMTkxZGM4ZTZkYmZiM2NkZmFhYmNjYWRlMzEzNjY2MWI2ZTYwMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commit/529694a19902f010072f5de6b3ccf046818316e5","sha":"529694a19902f010072f5de6b3ccf046818316e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/529694a19902f010072f5de6b3ccf046818316e5"}],"sha":"3c191dc8e6dbfb3cdfaabccade3136661b6e6026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/3c191dc8e6dbfb3cdfaabccade3136661b6e6026"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/529694a19902f010072f5de6b3ccf046818316e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:40:31Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:40:31Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"fix: wire required env vars into k8s/compose/env.example; fail fast on missing POSTGRES_URL\n\nenv.example, docker-compose.yml and k8s/backend-deployment.yaml omitted\nPOSTGRES_URL and all three TELEGRAM_* vars, so the reference deployment\ncould not run this module and env.example no longer documented every\nvariable as the README claims. All values stay placeholders/empty; secrets\ngo through secretKeyRef, matching nkz-module-soil/cue.\n\nMove require_postgres_url() from lazy first-use (inside db.py, reached only\nfrom a background task where the failure was swallowed) into app startup,\nso a misconfigured deployment refuses to start instead of reporting healthy\nand dropping every turn.","tree":{"sha":"ddfd4307fb1931c6ff7b173130d167fdae80330b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/git/trees/ddfd4307fb1931c6ff7b173130d167fdae80330b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/git/commits/529694a19902f010072f5de6b3ccf046818316e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commit/529694a19902f010072f5de6b3ccf046818316e5","node_id":"C_kwDOUmw9T9oAKDUyOTY5NGExOTkwMmYwMTAwNzJmNWRlNmIzY2NmMDQ2ODE4MzE2ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commit/ff570de3121a0d739457f1ee36e23f0fb484d3e7","sha":"ff570de3121a0d739457f1ee36e23f0fb484d3e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/ff570de3121a0d739457f1ee36e23f0fb484d3e7"}],"sha":"529694a19902f010072f5de6b3ccf046818316e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/529694a19902f010072f5de6b3ccf046818316e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commits/ff570de3121a0d739457f1ee36e23f0fb484d3e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:40:19Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:40:19Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"ci: run backend tests against real Postgres, fix broken image build\n\nTest job had no database, so every DB-backed test (partial unique index,\nsingle-use token atomicity, dedupe, cross-tenant revoke) silently skipped.\nAdd a postgres:15 service and POSTGRES_URL for the test step.\n\nbuild-push-action ran with no with: block (no context/file/push/tags), so\nthe backend image job could not build or push. Wire it to backend/Dockerfile\nand use the meta step''s tags. SHA tag now uses format=long (40 chars).\n\nSplit requirements-dev.txt out for pytest/black/ruff so they stop shipping\ninto the production image; CI installs from it instead.","tree":{"sha":"ce35cc0a15fe35ffd2abdb738b589dcff8f4d992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/git/trees/ce35cc0a15fe35ffd2abdb738b589dcff8f4d992"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/git/commits/ff570de3121a0d739457f1ee36e23f0fb484d3e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agent/commit/ff570de3121a0d739457f1ee36e23f0fb484d3e7","node_id":"C_kwDOUmw9T9oAKGZmNTcwZGUzMTIxYTBkNzM5NDU3ZjFlZTM2ZTIzZjB