","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/6c94dcc896ca9cdd30414826917a558ce750ab63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:05:43Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:05:43Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"feat(docs): add comprehensive documentation for ArcProof SDK, including layout, overview, quickstart, and package-specific guides\n\n- Introduced DocsLayout component for consistent documentation layout.\n- Created DocsOverviewPage for an overview of the ArcProof SDK.\n- Added QuickstartPage to guide users through installation and initial setup.\n- Developed detailed pages for @arcproof/sdk, @arcproof/sdk-langchain, and @arcproof/sdk-elizaos, outlining installation, usage, and examples.\n- Implemented DocsSidebar for easy navigation across documentation sections.\n- Added DocsTypography components for consistent styling of headings, paragraphs, and code blocks.","tree":{"sha":"4a815797d34ceb1d319d4c2f90207e86f9d7eb3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/4a815797d34ceb1d319d4c2f90207e86f9d7eb3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/6c94dcc896ca9cdd30414826917a558ce750ab63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_i