:"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/def01ecf929e5e427bbc14fc9b42fbee3ccb6b79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T17:28:11Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T17:28:11Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"docs: rewrite the root README as a complete, structured project reference\n\nThe previous README predates almost everything built this round -- it\nstill said the frontend wasn''t connected to a backend yet. Replaced with a\nfull rewrite covering: the actual problem statement with sourced 2026\nmarket context (AI agent economy size, agentic commerce, x402/Circle/Arc\nadoption numbers, and real trading losses from AI hallucinations), a\ncompetitive comparison against x402 alone / ERC-8004 alone / generic\nescrow, the current system architecture end to end, a per-feature\nbreakdown of how Circle Wallets / x402 / Arc are actually used (with real\ncode), a full job-flow sequence diagram, the exact claim verification\nrules per claim type, the deployed VeriFiEscrow address, the published SDK\npackages, complete repo structure, tech stack, local setup, a numbered\nend-to-end test flow, and the real bugs found and fixed along the way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"342919a6f57cf889cfa0b1b97a0e0ea2215abdbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/342919a6f57cf889cfa0b1b97a0e0ea2215abdbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/def01ecf929e5e427bbc14fc9b42fbee3ccb6b79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/def01ecf929e5e427bbc14fc9b42fbee3ccb6b79","node_id":"C_kwDOUm0-8NoAKGRlZjAxZWNmOTI5ZTVlNDI3YmJjMTRmYzliNDJmYmVlM2NjYjZiNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/cf58d6163945e913f7e60132be9613c6e3be1789","sha":"cf58d6163945e913f7e60132be9613c6e3be1789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/cf58d6163945e913f7e60132be9613c6e3be1789"}],"sha":"def01ecf929e5e427bbc14fc9b42fbee3ccb6b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/def01ecf929e5e427bbc14fc9b42fbee3ccb6b79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/cf58d6163945e913f7e60132be9613c6e3be1789/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T17:27:34Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T17:27:34Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"frontend: distinct per-role icons, bloom glow, and idle motion in the 3D scene\n\nThe agent-network view worked but looked flat -- every booth was the same\nbox+cone shape in a different color. Replaced with a genuinely distinct\nsilhouette per role (a stacked-block \"chain\" for the on-chain specialist, a\nhub gem+ring for the orchestrator, a vault+lock for escrow, a tilted\npaper+broadcast node for news, a shield gem for compliance, a magnifying-\nglass shape for the evaluator, a person totem for the requester) so each\nagent reads at a glance, not just by color.\n\nAlso adds: gentle per-booth idle bob/rotation (phase-offset per role so\nnothing looks synchronized) so the scene never sits static between events;\nreal bloom post-processing (@react-three/postprocessing) on the emissive\nmaterials; ambient Sparkles for atmosphere; permanent faint hub-and-spoke\nconnector lines so the topology reads as a real network even at rest; and\nricher packet effects -- a colored point light trailing each traveling\npacket plus a brief expanding \"impact\" ring where it lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb21929cf1d5db2d31bdb78ce3757a89bd0780e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/fb21929cf1d5db2d31bdb78ce3757a89bd0780e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/cf58d6163945e913f7e60132be9613c6e3be1789","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/cf58d6163945e913f7e60132be9613c6e3be1789","node_id":"C_kwDOUm0-8NoAKGNmNThkNjE2Mzk0NWU5MTNmN2U2MDEzMmJlOTYxM2M2ZTNiZTE3ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/5e47687d4f86b2b575b6574b918e3825faac2206","sha":"5e47687d4f86b2b575b6574b918e3825faac2206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/5e47687d4f86b2b575b6574b918e3825faac2206"}],"sha":"cf58d6163945e913f7e60132be9613c6e3be1789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/cf58d6163945e913f7e60132be9613c6e3be1789"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/5e47687d4f86b2b575b6574b918e3825faac2206/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T17:26:59Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T17:26:59Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"agent-ts: robust boolean parsing + retry on transient tool-calling failure\n\ntoBool() required an exact \"true\"/\"false\" string match -- the compliance\nagent''s LLM returned \"flagged=true\" instead of the bare literal the schema\nasks for, which used to fail this check and get marked unverifiable even\nthough the value was perfectly legible. Now falls back to an unambiguous\nwhole-word search (exactly one of true/false present) when the exact\nmatch fails.\n\nAlso adds one automatic retry inside each specialist''s LLM call for a\ntransient Groq tool-calling failure mode observed live across three\ndifferent specialists -- each time, the rejected request''s own\nfailed_generation already contained the correct answer, it just failed to\nsubmit in the expected format once. A single retry resolves this far more\noften than not, instead of failing the whole job and refunding over what\namounts to a one-off formatting blip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f88957650e4e2272554d0b1bf147a231a00cabea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/f88957650e4e2272554d0b1bf147a231a00cabea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/5e47687d4f86b2b575b6574b918e3825faac2206","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/5e47687d4f86b2b575b6574b918e3825faac2206","node_id":"C_kwDOUm0-8NoAKDVlNDc2ODdkNGY4NmIyYjU3NWI2NTc0YjkxOGUzODI1ZmFhYzIyMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/42089b019ba434135aa8d367500aa5a5d698d764","sha":"42089b019ba434135aa8d367500aa5a5d698d764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/42089b019ba434135aa8d367500aa5a5d698d764"}],"sha":"5e47687d4f86b2b575b6574b918e3825faac2206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/5e47687d4f86b2b575b6574b918e3825faac2206"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/42089b019ba434135aa8d367500aa5a5d698d764/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T16:21:12Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T16:21:12Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"frontend: real page nav everywhere, new /dashboard, page background art\n\nNavigation used to link to on-page anchor sections (#network,\n#how-it-works, ...) and only rendered on the home page -- replaced with\nreal page links (Home, App, Dashboard, Reputation) and moved into the\nroot layout so it''s consistent on every page instead of each page\ncarrying its own bespoke back-link header.\n\nNew /dashboard page: a network-wide overview pulling from the backend''s\nactual job store (GET /jobs -- every job this orchestrator has ever\nprocessed, not just the current browser''s localStorage history), plus\nlive wallet balances and per-agent reputation, alongside computed\nnetwork stats (total jobs, total USDC settled, accept rate, refund count).\n\nAppBackground now optionally takes an image or looping video and applies\nthe same darkened-scrim treatment the landing page uses over its own art,\nreused across /app (hero video), /dashboard (tree art), and /reputation\n(the Orchestrator card''s art) instead of the plain gradient-blob default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a6ba0d08085be4b6507b87ebf9f15c1a733de92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/1a6ba0d08085be4b6507b87ebf9f15c1a733de92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/42089b019ba434135aa8d367500aa5a5d698d764","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/42089b019ba434135aa8d367500aa5a5d698d764","node_id":"C_kwDOUm0-8NoAKDQyMDg5YjAxOWJhNDM0MTM1YWE4ZDM2NzUwMGFhNWE1ZDY5OGQ3NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/eb9a2014e41629b363b49d75e69ee5f76a3f0c74","sha":"eb9a2014e41629b363b49d75e69ee5f76a3f0c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/eb9a2014e41629b363b49d75e69ee5f76a3f0c74"}],"sha":"42089b019ba434135aa8d367500aa5a5d698d764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/42089b019ba434135aa8d367500aa5a5d698d764"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/eb9a2014e41629b363b49d75e69ee5f76a3f0c74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T16:20:23Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T16:20:23Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"frontend: real-time activity feed, transaction ledger, and a live 3D agent-network view\n\nNew display primitives, all driven by real backend data (agent-ts''s new\nper-job log + tx-hash fields), not simulated:\n\n- ActivityLog: polls the orchestrator''s live per-job log while a job is\n  processing and replaces the old fake time-based progress bar -- every\n  line is a real event (specialist call, real x402 nanopayment, evaluator\n  verdict, settlement release) with a clickable Arc explorer link when a\n  tx hash is attached.\n- TransactionLedger: a permanent post-completion table of every on-chain\n  call a job touched (lock, per-specialist nanopayment, per-specialist\n  release, finalize/refund), each linking straight to the explorer.\n- AgentScene3D: a real Three.js (react-three-fiber) scene -- every role\n  (requester, orchestrator, escrow, 3 specialists, evaluator) as a booth\n  on a grid, with a glowing packet animating between two booths for every\n  real from/to log event, colored by what kind of event it is.\n- AgentBadge: small colored role-dot, applied consistently across the\n  claims table, settlement cards, and reputation cards.\n\nLoadingTimeline is trimmed down to just the wallet-signature wait -- its\nold fake per-second progress simulation is now redundant with the real\nActivityLog.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"490c887b0e4a4e9fa8e2d2d30ff7e8638591fa92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/490c887b0e4a4e9fa8e2d2d30ff7e8638591fa92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/eb9a2014e41629b363b49d75e69ee5f76a3f0c74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/eb9a2014e41629b363b49d75e69ee5f76a3f0c74","node_id":"C_kwDOUm0-8NoAKGViOWEyMDE0ZTQxNjI5YjM2M2I0OWQ3NWU2OWVlNWY3NmEzZjBjNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/f2923448a8d7b87c7370c7e8b08a17d58db4870f","sha":"f2923448a8d7b87c7370c7e8b08a17d58db4870f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/f2923448a8d7b87c7370c7e8b08a17d58db4870f"}],"sha":"eb9a2014e41629b363b49d75e69ee5f76a3f0c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/eb9a2014e41629b363b49d75e69ee5f76a3f0c74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/f2923448a8d7b87c7370c7e8b08a17d58db4870f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T16:19:39Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T16:19:39Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"agent-ts: real per-job transaction log + fix two live correctness bugs\n\nEvery real on-chain call the orchestrator makes (budget lock, per-specialist\nnanopayment, per-specialist settlement release, finalize/refund) used to\nonly exist as a console.log line -- now captured as structured fields on\nJobRecord/ProviderPayout and as a live, in-memory per-job event log\n(jobLog.ts) with who-talked-to-whom metadata, exposed via a new\nGET /jobs/:id/logs endpoint a frontend can poll while a job is still\nprocessing.\n\nAlso fixes two real bugs this surfaced during live testing, not just\nplumbing:\n- The evaluator''s governance-claim check only knew how to compare a\n  claim against a proposal''s title/winner text, so a bare end-date claim\n  (e.g. \"2026-06-22\") could never match and got wrongly flagged as a\n  mismatch even when true. It also accepted a fabricated winner like\n  \"FABRICATED-For\" as a false match, since a loose substring check means\n  a fabricated value can still contain the real one. Both fixed with\n  shape-aware comparison instead of one blanket substring test.\n- A specialist''s LLM could emit a claim_type outside what its own tools\n  produce (news-agent-v1 once invented a \"tvl\" claim when asked about\n  governance) -- now filtered out in code after the LLM responds, rather\n  than trusting the model''s own claim_type choice. (Tried constraining\n  the LLM''s output schema directly first; reverted after it traded one\n  Groq tool-calling failure mode for a different one on narrow enums.)\n\nAlso fixes wallet_flow silently falling back to simulated data: the code\nwas calling Etherscan''s retired v1 API, which now returns HTTP 200 with\nan error string instead of failing loudly -- migrated to v2 (chainid=1).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dc90dc4918262672658270bf0fce0b8c9bbc343","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/4dc90dc4918262672658270bf0fce0b8c9bbc343"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/f2923448a8d7b87c7370c7e8b08a17d58db4870f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/f2923448a8d7b87c7370c7e8b08a17d58db4870f","node_id":"C_kwDOUm0-8NoAKGYyOTIzNDQ4YThkN2I4N2M3MzcwYzdlOGIwOGExN2Q1OGRiNDg3MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/58610b7dc80951c7c9c5cd2ac09064e20d207c33","sha":"58610b7dc80951c7c9c5cd2ac09064e20d207c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/58610b7dc80951c7c9c5cd2ac09064e20d207c33"}],"sha":"f2923448a8d7b87c7370c7e8b08a17d58db4870f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/f2923448a8d7b87c7370c7e8b08a17d58db4870f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/58610b7dc80951c7c9c5cd2ac09064e20d207c33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T11:44:11Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T11:44:11Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"Match /app dashboard styling to the landing page + persist wallet connection\n\nThe dashboard (/app, /reputation, /jobs/[id]) used violet as its accent\ncolor and a plain sans-serif for headings, while the rest of the site\n(hero, verification badges, metrics) uses teal (#5eead4) and the\nInstrument Serif display font -- looked like a different product.\nReplaced every violet/purple accent (buttons, links, focus rings, loading\nindicators, progress bars, background blobs) with the site''s actual teal\naccent, applied font-display to headings, restyled the primary submit\nbutton to match the site''s real CTA convention (rounded-full\nbg-foreground/text-background, not a solid color fill), and added\nHome/Reputation nav links so the dashboard pages aren''t a dead end.\n\nAlso fixes wallet connection resetting on every page refresh: the wallet\nstore had no restore-on-mount logic, so it always started at\n\"disconnected\" even though MetaMask remembers per-origin authorization.\nAdded getAuthorizedAccounts() (a non-prompting eth_accounts check) and a\nrestoreConnection() store action, wired to run once on app mount --\nrefreshing now silently restores the connected state instead of asking\nthe user to reconnect every time.\n\nVerified with a real headless-browser screenshot pass (no console errors)\ncomparing / and /app side by side, and `npm run build` is clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25f15bae32a478cc6a6916c0a7908d41829ed09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/25f15bae32a478cc6a6916c0a7908d41829ed09c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/58610b7dc80951c7c9c5cd2ac09064e20d207c33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/58610b7dc80951c7c9c5cd2ac09064e20d207c33","node_id":"C_kwDOUm0-8NoAKDU4NjEwYjdkYzgwOTUxYzdjOWM1Y2QyYWMwOTA2NGUyMGQyMDdjMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/3de77e90540c31f06504de06120606fcc0815b09","sha":"3de77e90540c31f06504de06120606fcc0815b09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/3de77e90540c31f06504de06120606fcc0815b09"}],"sha":"58610b7dc80951c7c9c5cd2ac09064e20d207c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/58610b7dc80951c7c9c5cd2ac09064e20d207c33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/3de77e90540c31f06504de06120606fcc0815b09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T10:17:16Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T10:17:16Z","email":"rohitamalraj.27csb@licet.ac.in","name":"GitHubRohitamalraj"},"message":"Fix stale SDK dist builds and a gitignore rule blocking new build output\n\n@arcproof/sdk, sdk-langchain, and sdk-elizaos ship compiled dist/ output\n(consumers import the built package, not src/), but the committed dist/\npredated later src/ changes -- most notably sdk-elizaos''s native\ncreateElizaOrchestrator/createElizaClaimGatherer exports, which broke\nexamples/defi-diligence-agent''s typecheck with \"no exported member\" errors.\nRebuilt all three packages from current src/.\n\nAlso fixes the root cause of why this could happen silently again:\nagent-ts/.gitignore''s blanket `dist/` rule was quietly swallowing any *new*\nfile inside these packages'' dist/ (git only tracked the files that already\nexisted before that gitignore rule existed) -- unignored dist/ specifically\nfor the three published SDK packages, since they need it committed;\neverything else (core/services/contracts/examples) still runs off src/ via\ntsx and has no reason to commit build output.\n\nVerified: `npm run typecheck` is clean across every agent-ts workspace\nincluding both examples, and the frontend still builds clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"824afc358d866feabe3c51d918976853f1202c38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/trees/824afc358d866feabe3c51d918976853f1202c38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/git/commits/3de77e90540c31f06504de06120606fcc0815b09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149103520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rohitamalraj","id":149103520,"login":"Rohitamalraj","node_id":"U_kgDOCOMjoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rohitamalraj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/3de77e90540c31f06504de06120606fcc0815b09","node_id":"C_kwDOUm0-8NoAKDNkZTc3ZTkwNTQwYzMxZjA2NTA0ZGUwNjEyMDYwNmZjYzA4MTViMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theyuvan/ArcProof/commit/797a269770962416cedc0605bd4ab77526471a46","sha":"797a269770962416cedc0605bd4ab77526471a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/797a269770962416cedc0605bd4ab77526471a46"}],"sha":"3de77e90540c31f06504de06120606fcc0815b09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theyuvan/ArcProof/commits/3de77e90540c31f06504de06120606fcc0815b09"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144896876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theyuvan/events{/pr