pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/affiliate-AI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/affiliate-AI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/affiliate-AI/subscriptions","type":"Organization","url":"https://api.github.com/users/affiliate-AI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rachmadiantyy/market/commits/61124f893f1f638a39e0ae2a2eb63e54212f46bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:34:40Z","email":"affiliate-ai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"affiliate-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:34:40Z","email":"affiliate-ai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"affiliate-ai"},"message":"Affiliate AI Platform: Telegram bot, AI text pipeline, dashboard\n\nFoundation: FastAPI + PostgreSQL + Redis backend, Next.js dashboard,\nDocker Compose orchestration.\n\nAI text generation: provider abstraction, Redis queue, background worker,\nbounded retries, prompt templates, generation records in PostgreSQL.\n\nTelegram bot: authorized /add conversation (name, affiliate URL, price,\ncommission, category, audience, description, photo/video), media stored\nwith generated filenames via the shared storage layer, product actions\nthat drive the existing AI pipeline, Redis-backed conversation state,\nworker-to-bot completion notifications, heartbeat healthcheck.\n\nDashboard: product list with media, AI generator, content queue,\nanalytics counters. Server-side rendering uses the internal API address\nwhile browser fetches use the public one.\n\nTests: 179 backend tests plus a live end-to-end script that drives the\nreal handlers against PostgreSQL, Redis, the worker and the AI provider.","tree":{"sha":"f0ca0e083429d9bdfe99d082392ebc8d0f1490e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rachmadiantyy/market/git/trees/f0ca0e083429d9bdfe99d082392ebc8d0f1490e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rachmadiantyy/market/git/commits/61124f893f1f638a39e0ae2a2eb63e54212f