rs/bobdeployos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobdeployos/plugin-ecommerce/commits/f347bc2564cc225f3e8f3029ff4267a2d1684967/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:37:44Z","email":"bleast.pro@gmail.com","name":"bobdeployos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:37:44Z","email":"bleast.pro@gmail.com","name":"bobdeployos"},"message":"Add the Sneakers Storefront Toolkit plugin\n\nA Claude Code plugin packaging the conventions of the APEX ATELIER\nstorefront as skills, agents, commands, hooks and scripts.\n\nSkills carry the know-how: ReUI premium block discovery and adaptation,\nthe Next.js 16 breaking changes that actually bite, the storefront\narchitecture, and the product catalog contract.\n\nAgents cover the four jobs worth delegating — block-scout picks the\nright premium block for a new surface, ui-reviewer audits a diff against\nthe frontend contract, catalog-writer adds products in voice with every\nphoto verified, and checkout-auditor walks the purchase path looking for\nnumbers that quietly disagree.\n\nCommands: /storefront:status, :audit-ui, :new-page and :product.\n\nThe hooks exist because every mistake they catch typechecks and builds\ncleanly, so nothing else finds them. PostToolUse checks each written file\nfor asChild in a Base UI project, raw <img>, imports from the pristine\nblock copies, responsive prefixes in a desktop-only layout, palette\nclasses instead of tokens, hardcoded money, and params read without\nawait. It reports rather than blocks, so the model can correct itself in\nthe same turn. SessionStart states the two easy-to-forget facts up front\nand warns on a missing licence key, staying silent outside a matching\nproject.\n\nScripts run standalone and exit non-zero on failure, so they work in CI\nas well as in a conversation: storefront-status.mjs inventories routes,\nblocks and the catalog then scans for violations; verify-photos.mjs\nchecks every catalog photograph still resolves, which is the only cheap\nway to catch a dead Unsplash ID before a customer does.\n\nVerified: manifests and hook config parse, all frontmatter blocks are\nwell formed, every script passes node --check, both hooks were exercised\nagainst real and deliberately broken input, and the status scan reports\nthe storefront clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36add0e16667debe8ccae0753be661896bd267b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobdeployos/plugin-ecommerce/git/trees/36add0e16667debe8ccae0753be661896bd267b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobdeployos/plugin-ecommerce/git/commits/f347bc2564cc225f3e8f3029ff4267a2d1684967","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213333691?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bobdeployos","id":213333691,"login":"bobdeployos","node_id":"U_kgDODLc2uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobdeployos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bobdeployos/plugin-ecommerce/commit/f347bc2564cc225f3e8f3029ff4267a2d1684967","node_id":"C_kwDOUnBAMdoAKGYzNDdiYzI1NjRjYzIyNWYzZThmMzAyOWZmNDI2N2EyZDE2ODQ5Njc","parents":[],"sha":"f347bc2564cc225f3e8f3029ff4267a2d1684967","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobdeployos/plugin-ecommerce/commits/f347bc2564cc225f3e8f3029ff4267a2d1684967"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobdeployos/plugin-ecommerce/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=dee375b87004dcc2f5af85080d0eb863194140cd&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A22%3A50.679Z"}');
