s://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commits/f27d655de67d46f3af4e127a2914ef0a93b26444/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:50:23Z","email":"97637511+gavinsan33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:02:19Z","email":"97637511+gavinsan33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"message":"Add Telemetry tab to the Detail view\n\nAIBOMTelemetryTab renders one QueryBrowser chart per metric (hardware:\nGPU/CPU/memory/network/storage; vLLM: TTFT/ITL/queue depth/KV-cache/\nthroughput), scoped to the AIBOM''s own pod(s) via promql.ts and windowed\nfrom earliestPodStart to collectedAt (cold start included -- the whole\npoint of this tab is showing shape detail the trimmed summary stats\nhide). Gates hardware charts on gpu_count > 0 and inference charts on\nserving_engine === ''vllm'', matching the existing tables'' own gating,\nwith an explanatory message instead of a blank/broken chart grid when\ngated off or when there''s no pod data at all.\n\nAIBOMDetailPage now wraps its content in Tabs: existing sections under\n\"Overview\" (unchanged), new AIBOMTelemetryTab under \"Telemetry\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"709c42d25250de709bdd5761a31b21957e02fd2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/git/trees/709c42d25250de709bdd5761a31b21957e02fd2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/git/commits/f27d655de67d46f3af4e127a2914ef0a93b26444","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committ