l_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33","id":97637511,"login":"gavinsan33","node_id":"U_kgDOBdHUhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commits/96515b27455c8f73189b2e3bf96a0de9ff0a6b4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:50:14Z","email":"97637511+gavinsan33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:02:19Z","email":"97637511+gavinsan33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"message":"Add PromQL builders for live telemetry, extend hardware metric set\n\nbuildHardwareQuery/buildVllmQuery (promql.ts) mirror aibom-webhook-\nservice''s postprocess.py TELEMETRY_QUERIES/VLLM_TELEMETRY_QUERIES\nverbatim (exported_pod vs pod label distinction, rate()/avg_over_time()\nwindows, the storage-throughput queries'' container=\"\" fallback), so a\nlive chart reads the same underlying series as the AIBOM''s own\nrecorded stats. Multi-pod (JobSet) support is a pod=~\"a|b|c\" regex\nalternation rather than one query per pod.\n\nExtends HARDWARE_METRIC_ORDER/LABELS with storage_read_throughput/\nstorage_write_throughput -- present in postprocess.py''s query set but\nnot previously surfaced in the plugin''s own metric list.\n\nAdds a QueryBrowser stub to the SDK mock (renders queries/namespace as\nvisible text) since it only exists as module-federation runtime code,\nsame reason the existing ListPageHeader/DocumentTitle stubs exist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"