ithubusercontent.com/u/97637511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33","id":97637511,"login":"gavinsan33","node_id":"U_kgDOBdHUhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commits/02ae7372953bca8b3e37c156fecf08649288db1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:45:51Z","email":"97637511+gavinsan33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:45:51Z","email":"97637511+gavinsan33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"message":"Add sample AIBOM CRs for testing without a real training run\n\nThree fake aibom.io/v1alpha1 AIBOM CRs: two runs of the same LoRA\nfine-tune job with deliberately different config/dataset-drift/pod\nstatus (for exercising List filtering and Compare''s divergent-field\nhighlighting), and one vLLM serving workload (for the Detail view''s\nInference section and the Telemetry tab''s vLLM gating). Validated\nagainst the real CRD via `oc apply --dry-run=server`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a83a6f7de7e9e99005906a33de5c51041f086a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/git/trees/a83a6f7de7e9e99005906a33de5c51041f086a22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/git/commits/02ae7372953bca8b3e37c156fecf08649288db1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97637511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33","id":97637511,"login":"gavinsan33","node_id":"U_kgDOBdHUhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commit/02ae7372953bca8b3e37c156fecf08649288db1e","node_id":"C_kwDOUnmi19oAKDAyYWU3MzcyOTUzYmNhOGIzZTM3YzE1NmZlY2YwODY0OTI4OGRiMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commit/69e38eee2d6ec53cfdacb84ba9e29b14f8235766","sha":"69e38eee2d6ec53cfdacb84ba9e29b14f8235766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commits/69e38eee2d6ec53cfdacb84ba9e29b14f8235766"}],"sha":"02ae7372953bca8b3e37c156fecf08649288db1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commits/02ae7372953bca8b3e37c156fecf08649288db1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97637511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33","id":97637511,"login":"gavinsan33","node_id":"U_kgDOBdHUhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commits/44ee39e81bd688f490713d943b01bcc62a6f6244/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:43:14Z","email":"97637511+gavinsan33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:43:14Z","email":"97637511+gavinsan33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"message":"Target OpenShift 4.22 instead of the 4.23 prerelease SDK\n\nThe plugin declared \"@console/pluginAPI\": \">=5.0.0-0 || >=4.23.0-0\"\n(inherited from the scaffold''s default, built against\n@openshift-console/dynamic-plugin-sdk@4.23-latest, itself a\nprerelease). Deployed against a real 4.22.13 test cluster, the\nConsolePlugin CR registered fine and the backend served its manifest\ncorrectly, but the console silently refused to activate any of the\nplugin''s extensions -- no nav item, no routes -- because the console''s\nown pluginAPI version didn''t satisfy that declared range. Confirmed via\nopenshift/console-plugin-template''s own release-4.22 branch, which\ndeclares \">=4.22.0-0\" and pins the SDK to \"4.22-latest\".\n\n@openshift-console/dynamic-plugin-sdk-webpack@4.22.0 predates rspack\nsupport entirely (it still expects real webpack hooks), so this also\nswaps the whole build toolchain: rspack -> webpack + webpack-cli +\nwebpack-dev-server + fork-ts-checker-webpack-plugin + copy-webpack-\nplugin + swc-loader/style-loader/css-loader, mirroring release-4.22''s\nown webpack.config.ts exactly rather than improvising. Also drops\n\"type\": \"module\" from package.json (release-4.22''s template doesn''t\nset it either, and webpack-cli''s config loader -- unlike rspack''s --\ndoesn''t handle an ESM-flagged .ts config file the same way).\n\nReact (18) and react-router (~7.13.1, already matching) are unaffected\n-- this is a build-tool/SDK-version fix only, not a framework\ndowngrade. A genuinely 4.21-targeting deploy would additionally need\nReact 17 + react-router v5, which is a separate, much larger effort\ndeliberately out of scope here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"858493d1db6891830d509e2f53bcae5ab75f4216","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/git/trees/858493d1db6891830d509e2f53bcae5ab75f4216"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/git/commits/44ee39e81bd688f490713d943b01bcc62a6f6244","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97637511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33","id":97637511,"login":"gavinsan33","node_id":"U_kgDOBdHUhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ga