noreply.github.com","name":"Gavin Sanders"},"message":"Scaffold aibom-console-plugin from openshift/console-plugin-template\n\nRenamed plugin metadata (package.json, Helm chart, i18n namespace) and\ndropped the upstream template''s openshift/release Prow-CI-only files\n(.ci-operator.yaml, OWNERS, ct.yaml, install_helm.sh,\ntest-prow-e2e.sh), which don''t apply to a standalone repo outside that\norg''s CI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77376c859ee5c904c763224410408086f2e472f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/git/trees/77376c859ee5c904c763224410408086f2e472f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/git/commits/1ce48a28dabc638b0f05c1355c9e73b902f2fcb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97637511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33","id":97637511,"login":"gavinsan33","node_id":"U_kgDOBdHUhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gavinsan33","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gavinsan33/aibom-console-plugin/commit/1ce48a28dabc638b0f05c1355c9e73b902f2fcb7","node_id":"C_kwDOUnmi19oAKDFjZTQ4YTI4ZGFiYzYzOGIwZj