tps://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/62715760f2543e35fa6ed5a3d156999a3d76f1ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:40:46Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:40:46Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Capture the page, and compare it with designs pixel by pixel\n\nA menu at the toolbar''s end keeps captures of the page with the\nworkspace: what it shows, all of it, or one element picked in it (in any\nframe, cross-site ones too, placed through each frame''s owner). Each\nopens as a tab to zoom into, with the colour of the pixel under the\npointer. Designs come in from files, or dropped or pasted on the menu,\ntheir scale read from their name or width. Compare with… lays the page\nout at a design''s width and captures it, then shows the two side by\nside, swiped, faded over each other, or as their difference: how much\ndiffers, and each area that does.","tree":{"sha":"055fee55723c16483e8294da6e4639423ccb0aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/055fee55723c16483e8294da6e4639423ccb0aa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/62715760f2543e35fa6ed5a3d156999a3d76f1ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehw