ged) and, when it differs, becomes the\nserved content. The renderer then updates the open tab (as saved, or\nkeeping unsaved edits behind a banner), says so and reloads the page as\na save does.\n\nOpen in VS Code (tab header, Explorer row menu, palette) opens the file\nthrough VS Code''s vscode://file URL, never the system''s handler for its\ntype; Show in folder finds it for any other editor.","tree":{"sha":"d7815596dc3b467faf5876b74fb3b1b852b0240d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/d7815596dc3b467faf5876b74fb3b1b852b0240d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/ab40fd76b57f8d0628b62da781dc469ecd1636f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/ab40fd76b57f8d0628b62da781dc469ecd1636f4","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKGFiNDBmZDc2YjU3ZjhkMDYyOGI2MmRhNzgxZGM0NjllY2QxNjM2ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehw