0308e07eb47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T01:56:02Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T01:56:02Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Remove the .deb before the Release workflow tests the AppImage\n\nThe Linux test job installs the .deb, then updates the AppImage on the\nsame runner. Since the app leaves the desktop to a package''s entry, the\nAppImage saw the .deb''s /usr/share/applications/console-editor.desktop,\ninstalled none of its own, and the update test timed out waiting for it\non Linux x64 and arm64. The .deb step now removes the package once its\nown test passes, and checks its desktop entry went with it.","tree":{"sha":"e838daf24d161cca2f03ad115f0189725e919690","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/e838daf24d161cca2f03ad115f0189725e919690"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/9deba18d6d68b40b13f9222ae50540308e07eb47","verification":{"payload":"tree e838daf24d161cca2f03ad115f0189725e919690\nparent fc599211cd0bd08122d2424ec8dbeddb71f8ec32\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790387762 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790387762 +0000\n\nRemove the .deb before the Release workflow tests the AppImage\n\nThe Linux test job installs the .deb, then updates the AppImage on the\nsame runner. Since the app leaves the desktop to a package''s entry, the\nAppImage saw the .deb''s /usr/share/applications/console-editor.desktop,\ninstalled none of its own, and the update test timed out waiting for it\non Linux x64 and arm64. The .deb step now removes the package once its\nown test passes, and checks its desktop entry went with it.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKHg7DgI\nZjADZ2yjLOppHvk4J