 1790386514 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790386514 +0000\n\nGive the rule form''s helpers names no component shares\n\nActionFields.tsx sat beside actionFields.ts, and RuleNotes.tsx beside\nruleNotes.ts. On macOS and Windows, whose file systems ignore case,\n`./ActionFields` found actionFields.ts first, which exports no component,\nso the Release workflow''s build failed there while Linux (and CI) passed.\n\nactionFields.ts becomes ruleActionFields.ts, after RULE_ACTION_FIELDS, and\nruleNotes.ts becomes ruleNotesFor.ts, its function ruleNotesFor.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQH8pluVU\ndj3/FVVbAF3r5TTyVzPZMAEQdHLAyo/buUGTIpQpNcrIonULjgbRHcpYUJgpiPmvw5YSI3IzOx+1\nCwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/fc599211cd0bd08