5d74bccfd783a41210d12b7a3f29a4928ebfcdf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/a8cae15c787f0bb01ce59b4d5d4c47e014288920/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:08:35Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:09:04Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Keep Angular''s view registry on the page once found\n\nA production Angular page''s view registry was found by walking the heap\n(Runtime.queryObjects over every Map) on every Component page read and\ntree level. It is now found once per document and kept on the page''s\nwindow as a non-enumerable global, where each later read takes it with\none call: on a heap of 300,000 Maps, the first read takes about 1.1 s,\nthe next ones 7 ms. A kept registry that no longer holds views is found\nagain; it goes with the document.","tree":{"sha":"0203bccbfeea8df83d8da6815b1ef0fcac25a764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/0203bccbfeea8df83d8da6815b1ef0fcac25a764"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/a8cae15c787f0bb01ce59b4d5d4c47e014288920","verification":{"payload":"tree 0203bccbfeea8df83d8da6815b1ef0fcac25a764\nparent 4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790381315 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790381344 +0000\n\nKeep Angular''s view registry on the page once found\n\nA production Angular page''s view registry was found by walking the heap\n(Runtime.queryObjects over every Map) on every Component page read and\ntree level. It is now found once per document and kept on the page''s\nwindow as a non-enumerable global, where each later read takes it with\none call: on a heap of 300,000 Maps, the first read takes about 1.1 s,\nthe next ones 7 ms. A kept registry that no longer holds views is found\nagain; it goes with the document.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPK/dDv6\nni0RG+Joy9DOYlK3CLH1HL3xakVtflTwKV9wleyaIQfht9vOQthvL87VlsFTHQy1ljVP+VZVb5Yb\nuAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/a8cae15c787f0bb01ce59b4d5d4c47e014288920","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKGE4Y2FlMTVjNzg3ZjBiYjAxY2U1OWI0ZDVkNGM0N2UwMTQyODg5MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7","sha":"4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7"}],"sha":"a8cae15c787f0bb01ce59b4d5d4c47e014288920","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/a8cae15c787f0bb01ce59b4d5d4c47e014288920"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:58:54Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:09:04Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Hear Pinia again after a stuck action, read tree levels faster, bound lookups\n\n- Pinia: an action whose promise never settles stops counting as running\n  after ACTION_SETTLE_MS (10 s), so the store''s direct changes are heard\n  again.\n- Components tree and picking: the adapter names each function once, so a\n  level of 500 rows of one component is placed with one call, not 500 (a\n  2,000-row Vue level: ~150-230 ms to ~30 ms); a path''s first index reads\n  the frameworks'' tops only as far as it; a production Vue pick walks the\n  vnode tree only down the elements that hold the element. The benchmark\n  now follows the widest node, so React''s 2,000-row level is measured too.\n- Leaving a workspace forgets the originals and hook names with the maps,\n  and a lookup finishing after drops its answer.\n- Main: script records keep only live scripts, whether each names a map\n  (not an inline map''s whole data URL) and URLs of at most 2,048\n  characters; at most 1,000 functions are placed a read, one gone leaving\n  the others; initiator calls keep bounded URLs and names.","tree":{"sha":"39568d31ba3f58d323ba5aa25b317507834bea9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/39568d31ba3f58d323ba5aa25b317507834bea9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 39568d31ba3f58d323ba5aa25b317507834bea9a\nparent 968334063f4e97096b93d38a969af8bc17e1f9f3\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790380734 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790381344 +0000\n\nHear Pinia again after a stuck action, read tree levels faster, bound lookups\n\n- Pinia: an action whose promise never settles stops counting as running\n  after ACTION_SETTLE_MS (10 s), so the store''s direct changes are heard\n  again.\n- Components tree and picking: the adapter names each function once, so a\n  level of 500 rows of one component is placed with one call, not 500 (a\n  2,000-row Vue level: ~150-230 ms to ~30 ms); a path''s first index reads\n  the frameworks'' tops only as far as it; a production Vue pick walks the\n  vnode tree only down the elements that hold the element. The benchmark\n  now follows the widest node, so React''s 2,000-row level is measured too.\n- Leaving a workspace forgets the originals and hook names with the maps,\n  and a lookup finishing after drops its answer.\n- Main: script records keep only live scripts, whether each names a map\n  (not an inline map''s whole data URL) and URLs of at most 2,048\n  characters; at most 1,000 functions are placed a read, one gone leaving\n  the others; initiator calls keep bounded URLs and names.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAgAkSRf\nVkcWaPV0LmgjAxNEqYZlCTGVNnpXoiQcjHenVf9RxLiqZpkYC81kQJCxHw4GiXHT1VKM3xFe9ucW\nvgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDQyNjI4NjJkMjE1MzI4ZDdlMDlkZDlhYmZmYTY1OWQ1MDY2ZWY3Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/968334063f4e97096b93d38a969af8bc17e1f9f3","sha":"968334063f4e97096b93d38a969af8bc17e1f9f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/968334063f4e97096b93d38a969af8bc17e1f9f3"}],"sha":"4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/4262862d215328d7e09dd9abffa659d5066ef7c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/fd856d7c668ed227466059512e8176bfdbc8b0c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:06:04Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:06:04Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Merge origin/main into feature/forms-and-quality-checks\n\nmain added the component inspector (#23). Rule pages keep this branch''s dirty flag, not main''s drafts,\nfor main''s new page kinds too (the Page stack and Component pages hold no edits), and SPEC.md takes\nboth sides'' additions with this branch''s words for rule pages. package.json takes both sides''\ndependencies; the lockfile is regenerated.\n\nThe inspector''s code also has to pass this branch''s checks, which the pre-commit hook runs on the\nmerge itself, so the merge fixes what they found in it:\n- lint:fsd: shared/lib had 16 modules; clamp and clampPosition are one clamp/ module now.\n- lint (oxlint): an async map instead of undefined in Promise.all (BindingRecording), try/finally\n  instead of a promise returned to finally() (ComponentReader, as its siblings release their object\n  group), Array map instead of new Array(n); the control-character pattern, Pinia''s useX() in Vue''s\n  setup() and a test compiling a script with new Function are meant, and say why.\n- lint:unused (knip): the fixture apps test/helpers/bundleApp.ts bundles by path are entry points;\n  unused exports go (a map file size limit pickMapFile already enforces with its own, an icon, a\n  constant, three index entries).\n- lint:duplicates (jscpd): what the inspector copied is shared: dropSessions (the console and the\n  inspector services), BindingRecorder (the renders and store recorders), readComponentAt (in the pick\n  feature, followed up as a pick is: followUp, wired by startBridge to the app''s followComponent),\n  useFrameOf (the Renders and Stores logs) and RecordingToolbar (their headers).","tree":{"sha":"864d2fd80f3dcf709294d52c2c70a866b64add2a","url":"https://api.github.co