43740206a9d47add0c4734f823913b9e1b97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/bab043740206a9d47add0c4734f823913b9e1b97"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/770c42bc4014b9e7f95ef3745cc2645b9a19f2ef","sha":"770c42bc4014b9e7f95ef3745cc2645b9a19f2ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/770c42bc4014b9e7f95ef3745cc2645b9a19f2ef"}],"sha":"a0cd311dc0bdc0b994922404372dd6fdacba77d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/a0cd311dc0bdc0b994922404372dd6fdacba77d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/125c444a40eb1e2c8b71b2ecd55368a1110378b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:09:12Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:09:12Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Record store actions, show who sent a request, keep state as an action\n\nThe component inspector''s fifth phase: the data flow between a page''s\ncomponents, its stores and its server.\n\n- Stores: a stand-in for the Redux DevTools extension''s globals, in the\n  framework hooks'' script, hears Redux and Redux Toolkit (the enhancer it\n  composes in), NgRx''s StoreDevtools and Zustand''s devtools (connect()),\n  and Pinia''s and Vuex''s stores once found in the Vue app. While store\n  actions are recorded, each is summed up with what it changed and the\n  stack that dispatched it, and listed in the new Stores tab, linked to\n  the app''s own line through the source map. A React commit right after\n  an action names it; the page stack names Redux.\n- Requests: a request a script sent keeps its initiator stack, shown as\n  Sent by in the Network panel, and the Component page lists the requests\n  sent from its component''s file.\n- Save as action: after setting a value on the Component page, it can be\n  kept as an action of its frame: readable code that finds the element by\n  selectors (through open shadow roots) and sets the value again, for\n  React, Vue 3 and 2, Angular''s development builds and web components.\n- Renders by component: the Renders tab''s profiler view, with each\n  component''s own render time where React measures it.\n\nRenders and store actions share a binding''s lifecycle (BindingRecording),\nand the Renders notice becomes the settings feature''s HooksNotice.","tree":{"sha":"33c3b0b62513ff821074c7f70b5fff0a3aa1c9e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/33c3b0b62513ff821074c7f70b5fff0a3aa1c9e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/125c444a40eb1e2c8b71b2ecd55368a1110378b7","verification":{"payload":"tree 33c3b0b62513ff821074c7f70b5fff0a3aa1c9e0\nparent 03047285e74454e50366d7d7d2c4ea7eab619466\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790374152 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790374152 +0000\n\nRecord store actions, show who sent a request, keep state as an action\n\nThe component inspector''s fifth phase: the data flow between a page''s\ncomponents, its stores and its server.\n\n- Stores: a stand-in for the Redux DevTools extension''s globals, in the\n  framework hooks'' script, hears Redux and Redux Toolkit (the enhancer it\n  composes in), NgRx''s StoreDevtools and Zustand''s devtools (connect()),\n  and Pinia''s and Vuex''s stores once found in the Vue app. While store\n  actions are recorded, each is summed up with what it changed and the\n  stack that dispatched it, and listed in the new Stores tab, linked to\n  the app''s own line through the source map. A React commit right after\n  an action names it; the page stack names Redux.\n- Requests: a request a script sent keeps its initiator stack, shown as\n  Sent by in the Network panel, and the Component page lists the requests\n  sent from its component''s file.\n- Save as action: after setting a value on the Component page, it can be\n  kept as an action of its frame: readable code that finds the element by\n  selectors (through open shadow roots) and sets the value again, for\n  React, Vue 3 and 2, Angular''s development builds and web components.\n- Renders by component: the Renders tab''s profiler view, with each\n  component''s own render time where React measures it.\n\nRenders and store actions share a binding''s lifecycle (BindingRecording),\nand the Renders notice becomes the settings feature''s HooksNotice.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOMQwWyj\naluXSMh4/nZUP+MSKZDuNsb3xaN9ZS1p2Kw5ziPrGkPqgSMONJZdxg2kd1xjz2WHCnUkPW4jS9ha\nRA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt