i.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/e4341ec57f1dac8bcf516c6bf3afb806dfe0d73b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:37:20Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:37:20Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Give the rules e2e''s reload-dependent polls the reload timeout\n\nAfter blocking a script, the file row''s blocked mark and the rule''s hit\ncount reach the renderer once the page has reloaded without the script.\nTheir polls used vitest''s default 1 s timeout and could time out on a\nbusy machine; they now wait as long as the test''s other reload checks.","tree":{"sha":"00fcf4354df101451919c4852e47e28cacff657c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/00fcf4354df101451919c4852e47e28cacff657c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/e4341ec57f1dac8bcf516c6bf3afb806dfe0d73b","verification":{"payload":"tree 00fcf4354df101451919c4852e47e28cacff657c\nparent 0bf4cc5f78e766e3e78ce69707bf861f0bd1f14e\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790372240 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790372240 +0000\n\nGive the rules e2e''s reload-dependent polls the reload timeout\n\nAfter blocking a script, the file row''s blocked mark and the rule''s hit\ncount reach the renderer once the page has reloaded without the script.\nTheir polls used vitest''s default 1 s timeout and could time out on a\nbusy machine; they now wait as long as the test''s other reload checks.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLeZM5Yl\nR/g9VmF0kOKSnGEDACdPeysqYCYlTgWFAXKzDhkA83KetffZ/Y3Oth2muha4jgwT/TgYt/BicYTp\nxgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu