hwebdev/console-editor/commits/770c42bc4014b9e7f95ef3745cc2645b9a19f2ef"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/4ce77ccd83169c93334c16fc085689d5c574a1e1","sha":"4ce77ccd83169c93334c16fc085689d5c574a1e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/4ce77ccd83169c93334c16fc085689d5c574a1e1"}],"sha":"0bf4cc5f78e766e3e78ce69707bf861f0bd1f14e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/0bf4cc5f78e766e3e78ce69707bf861f0bd1f14e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/b5bedd0f2f9b32f9af4d602d8f904316669e673f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:20:31Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:21:08Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Check more before each commit and push, and as Claude Code works\n\n- Before each commit, oxlint lints the staged files and secretlint scans them for keys and tokens.\n  `npm run lint:secrets` scans the whole tree, and CI runs it.\n- A commit-msg hook refuses a commit whose message credits a coding agent (a co-author trailer naming\n  one, a session link or trailer, a \"Generated with\" line) or whose author or committer is one, as\n  CLAUDE.md asks. It goes by the agents'' addresses, GitHub accounts and exact names, so a person\n  whose name only starts like one (Claude Monet) isn''t refused.\n- Before each push, the typecheck, lint:fsd, lint:structure, lint and the unit tests run side by side\n  (about 30 s). The end-to-end tests stay in CI.\n- Claude Code''s project hooks (.claude/settings.json) lint each file the agent edits and hand what\n  oxlint finds back to it. When it stops with changes in the tree, the fast checks run, and one that\n  fails sends it back to fix it; the next time it stops, it may, and the person is told what fails.","tree":{"sha":"d0da64d3120758e0ce511912af288bf82478606d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/d0da64d3120758e0ce511912af288bf82478606d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/b5bedd0f2f9b32f9af4d602d8f904316669e673f","verification":{"payload":"tree d0da64d3120758e0ce511912af288bf82478606d\nparent 07ff1fdc2e9f63da68482529094e26f8468c959c\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790371231 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790371268 +0000\n\nCheck more before each commit and push, and as Claude Code works\n\n- Before each commit, oxlint lints the staged files and secretlint scans them for keys and tokens.\n  `npm run lint:secrets` scans the whole tree, and CI runs it.\n- A commit-msg hook refuses a commit whose message credits a coding agent (a co-author trailer naming\n  one, a session link or trailer, a \"Generated with\" line) or whose author or committer is one, as\n  CLAUDE.md asks. It goes by the agents'' addresses, GitHub accounts and exact names, so a person\n  whose name only starts like one (Claude Monet) isn''t refused.\n- Before each push, the typecheck, lint:fsd, lint:structure, lint and the unit tests run side by side\n  (about 30 s). The end-to-end tests stay in CI.\n- Claude Code''s project hooks (.claude/settings.json) lint each file the agent edits and hand what\n  oxlint finds back to it. When it stops with changes in the tree, the fast checks run, and one that\n  fails sends it back to fix it; the next time it stops, it may, and the person is told what fails.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFGh4Cx3\n5eNEHRI5NPrNGMy7vC4ob+Z/jcw50vMBBhERfB2892Eiu7Z7A5tTr2El9m3luSGvVNsGbsvQJyFB\n3wI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/b5bedd0f2f9b32f9af4d602d8f904316669e673f","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKGI1YmVkZDBmMmY5YjMyZjlhZjRkNjAyZDhmOTA0MzE2NjY5Z