"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T20:05:38Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Don''t fail the page window test when putting the website back closes its window\n\nClicking \"Put back in the editor window\" makes main destroy the website''s\nwindow as the click lands. Playwright''s click was still waiting on that\npage, so about one run in four it rejected with \"Target page, context or\nbrowser has been closed\" although the website had gone back into the\neditor. The click''s rejection now counts only while the window is still\nopen; the assertions after it check where the website went.","tree":{"sha":"7724e1f00a2ac5f04151e8f7027515493330bfd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/7724e1f00a2ac5f04151e8f7027515493330bfd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/ade4eacaeb02722745cb2a07486526ffe56123e8","verification":{"payload":"tree 7724e1f00a2ac5f04151e8f7027515493330bfd0\nparent d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790366738 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790366738 +0000\n\nDon''t fail the page window test when putting the website back closes its window\n\nClicking \"Put back in the editor window\" makes main destroy the website''s\nwindow as the click lands. Playwright''s click was still waiting on that\npage, so about one run in four it rejected with \"Target page, context or\nbrowser has been closed\" although the website had gone back into the\neditor. The click''s rejection now counts only while the window is still\nopen; the assertions after it check where the website went.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ7fqYbo\nv3q4ZHHXVnuFiIcwW/IqonrCYxDz8rCg0HIv6Y0f4USHSzpjD2S9HrOC28bVpUUm6VqLcu+BUIcP\nbQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/ade4eacaeb02722745cb2a07486526ffe56123e8","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKGFkZTRlYWNhZWIwMjcyMjc0NWNiMmEwNzQ4NjUyNmZmZTU2MTIzZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b","sha":"d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b"}],"sha":"ade4eacaeb02722745cb2a07486526ffe56123e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/ade4eacaeb02722745cb2a07486526ffe56123e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/a681a7a5d762a50f9e50bd66f673fd866851ba92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T20:00:46Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T20:00:46Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Add Renders, the Components tree and state editing to the inspector\n\nRecord renders and see, commit by commit in every frame, what triggered each\nReact commit and why each component rendered: its props, its own state, a\nstore, a context or its parent, or that it was skipped (memo, same props).\nThe Inspect view gets a Components tree per frame with React or Vue, the\nComponent page sets state values and names React hooks after their variables,\nand the Page stack says which scripts have source maps.\n\n- main: the hook stand-in keeps fiber roots (getFiberRoots) and sums up each\n  commit while the renders binding is in the document; RenderRecorder adds and\n  removes the binding, checks each batch, locates component functions once per\n  document and tells frames by context; TreeReader reads a frame''s tree a level\n  at a time and opens a node as a pick; the adapter gains tree, locate and set\n  modes, and finds the fiber copy on screen (React DevTools'' slow path), so a\n  component reads as it is after updates; script coverage from scriptParsed\n- renderer: the Renders tab beside the console, the Components tree, state\n  editing, a component''s renders on its page, the render log in the inspector\n  entity, features inspect/tree and inspect/renders, and a palette entry\n- source-map worker: hook names read off the original with @babel/parser,\n  laid out as React 19 keeps hooks (now a runtime dependency)\n- tests: unit, renderer, integration in real Chromium, and e2e\n- docs: SPEC 6.10 to 6.12, CHANGELOG, README, research doc, design system","tree":{"sha":"b2ee888f76f5abf3c3d172000024449a77a50359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/b2ee888f76f5abf3c3d172000024449a77a50359"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/a681a7a5d762a50f9e50bd66f673fd866851ba92","verification":{"payload":"tree b2ee888f76f5abf3c3d172000024449a77a50359\nparent 93cd268e0348236cce75da344e855128c4f7f493\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790366446 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790366446 +0000\n\nAdd Renders, the Components tree and state editing to the inspector\n\nRecord renders and see, commit by commit in every frame, what triggered each\nReact commit and why each component rendered: its props, its own state, a\nstore, a context or its parent, or that it was skipped (memo, same props).\nThe Inspect view gets a Components tree per frame with React or Vue, the\nComponent page sets state values and names React hooks after their variables,\nand the Page stack says which scripts have source maps.\n\n- main: the hook stand-in keeps fiber roots (getFiberRoots) and sums up each\n  commit while the renders binding is in the document; RenderRecorder adds and\n  removes the binding, checks each batch, locates component functions once per\n  document and tells frames by context; TreeReader reads a frame''s tree a level\n  at a time and opens a node as a pick; the adapter gains tree, locate and set\n  modes, and finds the fiber copy on screen (React DevTools'' slow path), so a\n  component reads as it is after updates; script coverage from scriptParsed\n- renderer: the Renders tab beside the console, the Components tree, state\n  editing, a component''s renders on its page, the render log in the inspector\n  entity, features inspect/tree and inspect/renders, and a palette entry\n- source-map worker: hook names read off the original with @babel/parser,\n  laid out as React 19 keeps hooks (now a runtime dependency)\n- tests: unit, renderer, integration in real Chromium, and e2e\n- docs: SPEC 6.10 to 6.12, CHANGELOG, README, research doc, design system\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJZwc7y3\niZJ3O2ZkpCzcRQJWSfE1mN4+BsQ4KHdT6g7LyQxkqsZqS1ms1y65xT+eEeKyJA9f0xaoX90/eBmd\nhAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","use