omises as not awaited, and export only what rules'' users need\n\nThe action and frame-name forms hand handleSubmit''s promise to onSubmit through\n`void`, as the rest of the code does with promises nothing awaits (oxlint''s\nno-misused-promises on the lint branch). shared/rules no longer re-exports the\nheader constants only its own schemas use (knip on the unused-code branch).","tree":{"sha":"92c677c88f2a7fe53f554caa827c194dc7453ce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/92c677c88f2a7fe53f554caa827c194dc7453ce5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/67eac572bd5a786ec96463cdf0412dcd9b94ed91","verification":{"payload":"tree 92c677c88f2a7fe53f554caa827c194dc7453ce5\nparent 8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790365355 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790365355 +0000\n\nMark the forms'' submit promises as not awaited, and export only what rules'' users need\n\nThe action and frame-name forms hand handleSubmit''s promise to onSubmit through\n`void`, as the rest of the code does with promises nothing awaits (oxlint''s\nno-misused-promises on the lint branch). shared/rules no longer re-exports the\nheader constants only its own schemas use (knip on the unused-code branch).\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPGB96hL\ndW7llFQagAdFjUgpuEvbbVUKzz5w6JT1jCYg9xbhy2NeAtEci2ijA57GIWgKtk51Q0fbobe0f0cc\nbA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/67eac572bd5a786ec96463cdf0412dcd9b94ed91","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDY3ZWFjNTcyYmQ1YTc4NmVjOTY0NjNjZGYwNDEyZGNkOWI5NGVkOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc","sha":"8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc"}],"sha":"67eac572bd5a786ec96463cdf0412dcd9b94ed91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/67eac572bd5a786ec96463cdf0412dcd9b94ed91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/9d52c60d6fdf2ab373f94516540745b654829257/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:30:07Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:30:07Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Lint with oxlint: React''s rules and misused promises, type-aware\n\n`npm run lint` (run in CI after lint:structure) runs oxlint with type\ninformation from typescript-go, which keeps up with TypeScript 7 where\ntypescript-eslint doesn''t yet. .oxlintrc.json turns on the correctness rules\nof the typescript, unicorn, oxc and react plugins: the rules of hooks, honest\neffect dependencies, React Compiler''s rules (natively; the official plugin\nthrough oxlint''s JS plugins fails to load, as it requires\nzod-validation-error/v4 that its own range doesn''t guarantee), floating and\nmisused promises. Three rules are off, each with why: unbound-method (the\ncallbacks it flags are declared as methods but never use `this`),\nno-useless-spread (the spreads snapshot collections their loops change) and\nincompatible-library (only relevant with the React Compiler).\n\nFixed what it found:\n- abortableTransport passes its base transport''s `on` bound, not as a method\n  taken off an object any transport could implement with `this`;\n- the menu''s blur handler reads its refs as the event fires, not in a factory\n  called while rendering; refs a hook returns or a prop passes on are named\n  `…Ref`, which is how React''s rules tell them from frozen values;\n- the gallery''s async click handlers go through `void promise.then`, a frame\n  name read from FormData is checked to be a string, and a snapshot''s type\n  no longer lists a string literal next to string;\n- typeahead compares UTF-16 units with UTF-16 units; flushing the session\n  settles its writes without copying them first;\n- tests say which promises they leave running (`void`), and use split('''')\n  and endsWith where they meant them.\n\nCLAUDE.md asks for `…Ref` names; CONTRIBUTING.md, the PR template and CLAUDE.md\nlist the new check.","tree":{"sha":"34734e1f0d2d90a7f4c0a1de787a643066895667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/34734e1f0d2d90a7f4c0a1de787a643066895667"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/9d52c60d6fdf2ab373f94516540745b654829257","verification":{"payload":"tree 34734e1f0d2d90a7f4c0a1de787a643066895667\nparent d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790364607 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790364607 +0000\n\nLint with oxlint: React''s rules and misused promises, type-aware\n\n`npm run lint` (run in CI after lint:structure) runs oxlint with type\ninformation from typescript-go, which keeps up with TypeScript 7 where\ntypescript-eslint doesn''t yet. .oxlintrc.json turns on the correctness rules\nof the typescript, unicorn, oxc and react plugins: the rules of hooks, honest\neffect dependencies, React Compiler''s rules (natively; the official plugin\nthrough oxlint''s JS plugins fails to load, as it requires\nzod-validation-error/v4 that its own range doesn''t guarantee), floating and\nmisused promises. Three rules are off, each with why: unbound-method (the\ncallbacks it flags are declared as methods but never use `this`),\nno-useless-spread (the spreads snapshot collections their loops change) and\nincompatible-library (only relevant with the React Compiler).\n\nFixed what it found:\n- abortableTransport passes its base transport''s `on` bound, not as a method\n  taken off an object any transport could implement with `this`;\n- the menu''s blur handler reads its refs as the event fires, not in a factory\n  called while rendering; refs a hook returns or a prop passes on are named\n  `…Ref`, which is how React''s rules tell them from frozen values;\n- the gallery''s async click handlers go through `void promise.then`, a frame\n  name read from FormData is checked to be a string, and a snapshot''s type\n  no longer lists a string literal next to string;\n- typeahead compares UTF-16 units with UTF-16 units; flushing the session\n  settles its writes without copying them first;\n- tests say which promises they leave running (`void`), and use split('''')\n  and endsWith where they meant them.\n\nCLAUDE.md asks for `…Ref` names; CONTRIBUTING.md, the PR template and CLAUDE.md\nlist the new check.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHM6C/X3\ncSdQ9CqtodiSB2aoGGxRl/RdzMFQL54mVdHp1rZ6pn1zFJInNCeJKPW7pLp0RWNkPfaf+3yQqBPX\nfQc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/9d52c60d6fdf2ab373f94516540745b654829257","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDlkNTJjNjBkNmZkZjJhYjM3M2Y5NDUxNjU0MDc0NWI2NTQ4MjkyNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b","sha":"d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b"}],"sha":"9d52c60d6fdf2ab373f94516540745b654829257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/9d52c60d6fdf2ab373f94516540745b654829257"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/9ac58f70ce5b5e85d27469b5fdfb221db9655529/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:17:22Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:17:22Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Find unused code with knip, and remove what it found\n\nknip (`npm run lint:unused`, run in CI after lint:structure) reports files,\ndependencies and exports nothing uses. knip.jsonc says what counts: the\nelectron-builder and steiger configs are entry points, `hdiutil` is a macOS\nbinary the update smoke test runs, and a module''s index.ts keeps its types\nexported, as they are its public API (DESIGN_SYSTEM.md: \"Props below are the\ncontract\"). Values have no such pass.\n\nRemoved, after checking each by hand (tests import some internals directly):\n- react-use-measure, a dependency nothing imports;\n- selectTabById, selectHasDirtyTabs, selectWorkspaceById, matchesUrl, the\n  renderer''s originOf and useConfirmOpen, which nothing called;\n- the shared/ui barrel nobody imported, and the Collapsible alias of Section\n  (DESIGN_SYSTEM.md now names Section alone);\n- the unused motion presets FADE_UP and EASE_IN_OUT (and FADE_UP''s row in\n  DESIGN_SYSTEM.md), JS_LITE and CommandIcon;\n- re-exports from index.ts files that only their own module uses, and the\n  export keyword of fixtures and helpers only their own file uses.","tree":{"sha":"5855be34bdcc2a2635c858b70e6dce702beaba5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/5855be34bdcc2a2635c858b70e6dce702beaba5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/9ac58f70ce5b5e85d27469b5fdfb221db9655529","verification":{"payload":"tree 5855be34bdcc2a2635c858b70e6dce702beaba5c\nparent d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790363842 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790363842 +0000\n\nFind unused code with knip, and remove what it found\n\nknip (`npm run lint:unused`, run in CI after lint:structure) reports files,\ndependencies and exports nothing uses. knip.jsonc says what counts: the\nelectron-builder and steiger configs are entry points, `hdiutil` is a macOS\nbinary the update smoke test runs, and a module''s index.ts keeps its types\nexported, as they are its public API (DESIGN_SYSTEM.md: \"Props below are the\ncontract\"). Values have no such pass.\n\nRemoved, after checking each by hand (tests import some internals directly):\n- react-use-measure, a dependency nothing imports;\n- selectTabById, selectHasDirtyTabs, selectWorkspaceById, matchesUrl, the\n  renderer''s originOf and useConfirmOpen, which nothing called;\n- the shared/ui barrel nobody imported, and the Collapsible alias of Section\n  (DESIGN_SYSTEM.md now names Section alone);\n- the unused motion presets FADE_UP and EASE_IN_OUT (and FADE_UP''s row in\n  DESIGN_SYSTEM.md), JS_LITE and CommandIcon;\n- re-exports from index.ts files that only their own module uses, and the\n  export keyword of fixtures and helpers only their own file uses.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEumRRvC\nw+jsIp20Z/CHBidvsOper1sFETFhaZe6QK3EpaI5riDqwYD/QhgPwjKilrXrfvQWmI+okWLgY5Pw\nwwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starr