09-25T19:04:42Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:04:42Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Ask the page again until a new network speed or a saved override reaches it\n\nThe status bar shows the network speed picked at once, and the page''s\nsession gets it a moment later; the offline test fetched once right away,\nso on a slower runner the fetch could still go out offline. The quick-edit\nand tree tests started their call right after saving, which reloads the\npage, so it could land mid-reload. Each now polls the call itself until\nthe page gets the expected answer.","tree":{"sha":"c89d670fa9b7c6cb50ee550c987ac0ba1926db68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/c89d670fa9b7c6cb50ee550c987ac0ba1926db68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/6c40e9f0e6dd783b580a09182fefe9a8fa542d85","verification":{"payload":"tree c89d670fa9b7c6cb50ee550c987ac0ba1926db68\nparent a48283024dd4b0262c9d430509073d034cdc2be8\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790363082 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790363082 +0000\n\nAsk the page again until a new network speed or a saved override reaches it\n\nThe status bar shows the network speed picked at once, and the page''s\nsession gets it a moment later; the offline test fetched once right away,\nso on a slower runner the fetch could still go out offline. The quick-edit\nand tree tests started their call right after saving, which reloads the\npage, so it could land mid-reload. Each now polls the call itself until\nthe page gets the expected answer.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL4n7XW4\nXYdO2vJfg9gJrhf0xNHvD2eRGIdz7cLmtewpPSuls0MjtRLLsdYsfbULIAFaM0r6ILl9Xz+W