/api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/93cd268e0348236cce75da344e855128c4f7f493/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:54:32Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:54:32Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Add the component picker: the React or Vue component behind an element\n\nPick an element in the page, in any frame, cross-site iframes included, and a\nComponent page shows the component that rendered it: its file and line (a\nminified production build''s too, through its source map), props, state, the\ncontexts it reads and who provides them, the element''s handlers and the chain\nof components above it. Open original and Go to bundle code land on its\ndefinition. The Inspect view on the rail shows what is under the pointer while\npicking, and the picked element becomes the console''s $0.\n\n- main: inspect mode in every session (Picker), the page-side adapter for\n  React fibers and Vue 3 instances (a production build''s vnode tree), each\n  function''s [[FunctionLocation]] with script URLs from a brief Debugger\n  replay (pauses skipped), the frame a node is in, and the page''s answer\n  checked like any input (ComponentReader, toInspectedComponent)\n- renderer: the inspector entity, features/inspect/pick, the Component page\n  tab, the Inspect rail view, a pick button in the page toolbar, the palette\n  entry and View > Pick an Element (Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+C)\n- source-map worker: toOriginalRaw, with the function''s name from the map or,\n  when the map has none (Vite''s minifier), read off the original''s text\n- tests: unit (fake CDP), renderer, integration in real Chromium on React and\n  Vue carts bundled by the test, and e2e in the built app\n- docs: SPEC 6.11, CHANGELOG, README, research doc and design system","tree":{"sha":"4de609727ad8b36e2e5ce1248d62a94e2179cf77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/4de609727ad8b36e2e5ce1248d62a94e2179cf77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/93cd268e0348236cce75da344e855128c4f7f493","verification":{"payload":"tree 4de609727ad8b36e2e5ce1248d62a94e2179cf77\nparent 1d2c64d3fc10b11afc57668a2533740c95dd4ca4\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790362472 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790362472 +0000\n\nAdd the component picker: the React or Vue component behind an element\n\nPick an element in the page, in any frame, cross-site iframes included, and a\nComponent page shows the component that rendered it: its file and line (a\nminified production build''s too, through its source map), props, state, the\ncontexts it reads and who provides them, the element''s handlers and the chain\nof components above it. Open original and Go to bundle code land on its\ndefinition. The Inspect view on the rail shows what is under the pointer while\npicking, and the picked element becomes the console''s $0.\n\n- main: inspect mode in every session (Picker), the page-side adapter for\n  React fibers and Vue 3 instances (a production build''s vnode tree), each\n  function''s [[FunctionLocation]] with script URLs from a brief Debugger\n  replay (pauses skipped), the frame a node is in, and the page''s answer\n  checked like any input (ComponentReader, toInspectedComponent)\n- renderer: the inspector entity, features/inspect/pick, the Component page\n  tab, the Inspect rail view, a pick button in the page toolbar, the palette\n  entry and View > Pick an Element (Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+C)\n- source-map worker: toOriginalRaw, with the function''s name from the map or,\n  when the map has none (Vite''s minifier), read off the original''s text\n- tests: unit (fake CDP), renderer, integration in real Chromium on React and\n  Vue carts bundled by the test, and e2e in the built app\n- docs: SPEC 6.11, CHANGELOG, README, research doc and design system\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL9qSMx8\nNCSarTurb3SOOd08kO3JOf6V2MG4aDf/x6HZ06dz8ABu5uhsjm147aAk3DBWBzwB/gmpqw3uadla\nHAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebde