\nThe test that stops interception while a fetch is held dropped the page''s\nevaluate promise. Letting go sends the fetch on, but when the page closed\nafter the test before it settled, the promise rejected with nobody to\ncatch it, and Vitest failed the run on the unhandled rejection.","tree":{"sha":"347494d95753e32e2ccf7f5f120750c522a2f31d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/347494d95753e32e2ccf7f5f120750c522a2f31d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/a48283024dd4b0262c9d430509073d034cdc2be8","verification":{"payload":"tree 347494d95753e32e2ccf7f5f120750c522a2f31d\nparent ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790362197 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790362197 +0000\n\nDon''t leave the page''s answer unhandled when the held-requests test closes it\n\nThe test that stops interception while a fetch is held dropped the page''s\nevaluate promise. Letting go sends the fetch on, but when the page closed\nafter the test before it settled, the promise rejected with nobody to\ncatch it, and Vitest failed the run on the unhandled rejection.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBCK1KOl\nm9DfWzuaH66oICJ0DOKrs1pUGvqqTJkKVoPuvKbKcVJl4dZhJvJFnu7WwpuBjGa7XD3E3xs/ZG5l\nmgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/a48283024dd4b0262c9d430509073d034cdc2be8","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKGE0ODI4MzAyNGRkNGIwMjYyYzlkNDMwNTA5MDczZDAzNGNkYzJiZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a","sha":"ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a"}],"sha":"a48283024dd4b0262c9d430509073d034cdc2be8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/a48283024dd4b0262c9d430509073d034cdc2be8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:42:32Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:42:32Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Show a response''s JSON as a tree to browse and edit in place\n\nThe tree button above a response (or a held request) swaps its text for\na tree: each value on a row with its key or index, objects and arrays with\ntheir size, opened and closed, what is open kept per tab. A value is\nretyped as JSON (so it can change kind), a key renamed, and a row can add\na member or item, empty it, set it to null or remove it; arrows, Enter, F2\nand Delete work as in a tree view. Every change is one undoable edit of\nthe tab''s text that changes only what it must (a removed member takes its\ncomma, an added one is written as the last one is), so undo, the dirty\nmark, drafts and saving work as for typed edits. The tree takes focus as\nit appears, and the hidden text editor doesn''t take it back.","tree":{"sha":"79e36ac74716e531363c1bab75ae5cdd05306aa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/79e36ac74716e531363c1bab75ae5cdd05306aa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a","verification":{"payload":"tree 79e36ac74716e531363c1bab75ae5cdd05306aa3\nparent 2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790361752 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790361752 +0000\n\nShow a response''s JSON as a tree to browse and edit in place\n\nThe tree button above a response (or a held request) swaps its text for\na tree: each value on a row with its key or index, objects and arrays with\ntheir size, opened and closed, what is open kept per tab. A value is\nretyped as JSON (so it can change kind), a key renamed, and a row can add\na member or item, empty it, set it to null or remove it; arrows, Enter, F2\nand Delete work as in a tree view. Every change is one undoable edit of\nthe tab''s text that changes only what it must (a removed member takes its\ncomma, an added one is written as the last one is), so undo, the dirty\nmark, drafts and saving work as for typed edits. The tree takes focus as\nit appears, and the hidden text editor doesn''t take it back.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQG2ngOdF\nvXN0RSEgngpC05DFNEkDo+PnlqCXMTPLLAH/8pRsFA9Pt1FFuiHG2+vE7U2m1ypQ0tsdkxy8uVBt\n9gI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKGFjNjc1NmRkMTdlNWE2YmQ1MWY4YjE0ZjU1MWIwMmY0YzAxYjUwOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17","sha":"2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17"}],"sha":"ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/ac6756dd17e5a6bd51f8b14f551b02f4c01b508a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:39:16Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:39:16Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Validate with shared Zod schemas, and move forms to react-hook-form\n\nRules, rule edits, URL matchers and actions are each described by one Zod\nschema in src/shared, bound to its type with z.toZod. The main process reads\nIPC input and files with them (parseInput), replacing the hand-written\nsanitizers and checks, and the forms check with the same schemas through\nzodResolver: one definition of what is valid, with the same messages.\n\n- Rule pages keep their edits in a react-hook-form control made outside React\n  (createFormControl), kept by page id as Monaco models are; the tab holds only\n  a dirty flag, kept in step by the form''s subscribe. Header rows use\n  useFieldArray, replacing the row-key bookkeeping. Apply, Enter and\n  Ctrl/Cmd+S go through handleSubmit, and an Apply landing rebases what was\n  typed meanwhile (reset with keepValues, so rows keep their keys and focus).\n- Each invalid field says why under it (FieldError, aria-invalid,\n  aria-describedby), and submitting focuses the first one.\n- The action form and the frame-name form use useForm; the action form checks\n  with the store''s own schema.\n- The renderer runs Zod jitless: its probe for new Function breaks the CSP.\n\nCLAUDE.md gains the rules for forms and validation.","tree":{"sha":"e8c11b02fcc85d4f7fbcc32db1277d8cce8e3ed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/e8c11b02fcc85d4f7fbcc32db1277d8cce8e3ed7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc","verification":{"payload":"tree e8c11b02fcc85d4f7fbcc32db1277d8cce8e3ed7\nparent d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790361556 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790361556 +0000\n\nValidate with shared Zod schemas, and move forms to react-hook-form\n\nRules, rule edits, URL matchers and actions are each described by one Zod\nschema in src/shared, bound to its type with z.toZod. The main process reads\nIPC input and files with them (parseInput), replacing the hand-written\nsanitizers and checks, and the forms check with the same schemas through\nzodResolver: one definition of what is valid, with the same messages.\n\n- Rule pages keep their edits in a react-hook-form control made outside React\n  (createFormControl), kept by page id as Monaco models are; the tab holds only\n  a dirty flag, kept in step by the form''s subscribe. Header rows use\n  useFieldArray, replacing the row-key bookkeeping. Apply, Enter and\n  Ctrl/Cmd+S go through handleSubmit, and an Apply landing rebases what was\n  typed meanwhile (reset with keepValues, so rows keep their keys and focus).\n- Each invalid field says why under it (FieldError, aria-invalid,\n  aria-describedby), and submitting focuses the first one.\n- The action form and the frame-name form use useForm; the action form checks\n  with the store''s own schema.\n- The renderer runs Zod jitless: its probe for new Function breaks the CSP.\n\nCLAUDE.md gains the rules for forms and validation.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQICIkmGp\nKHdg0yzpkumzdRuQdhChcMtKwB1gyv74H7V+ZnMNtRew1Ih2j0Ljs0EAFU6TYK1KOklhU0eOsXX5\nBwc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDhkMDkzOGUwZGMwYmI1ZGRmMGMzMmJhY2FjMzhmNWI4OGRhNmQ5YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b","sha":"d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/d1eea364ffa0bca60f53fe43266b1a586aecec8b"}],"sha":"8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/8d0938e0dc0bb5ddf0c32bacac38f5b88da6d9bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:17:09Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:17:09Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Wait for a closing menu before opening the next in the Network e2e test\n\nOn CI the network speed menu was opened again while the one just used was\nstill leaving, so two \"No throttling\" items matched and the page stayed\noffline, which then kept the WebSocket test from opening its socket. The\ntest now waits for any menu to be gone before opening one, and opens the\nsocket without relying on a half-second read.","tree":{"sha":"18c82aa2fcbe29c2c379be49c9c3ffe7e7969c2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/18c82aa2fcbe29c2c379be49c9c3ffe7e7969c2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17","verification":{"payload":"tree 18c82aa2fcbe29c2c379be49c9c3ffe7e7969c2b\nparent 46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790360229 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790360229 +0000\n\nWait for a closing menu before opening the next in the Network e2e test\n\nOn CI the network speed menu was opened again while the one just used was\nstill leaving, so two \"No throttling\" items matched and the page stayed\noffline, which then kept the WebSocket test from opening its socket. The\ntest now waits for any menu to be gone before opening one, and opens the\nsocket without relying on a half-second read.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQF1iqPkB\nkIlKcCy7piDG6GgGgnDPeNsKsxeRxZQB7fDXaW/sMv5ri54lUNu9FM/FkgaMB2GEPKsWyKexGz9R\n+gc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDJlODdhMTUwYzY1N2Q5NjBlNjI2YmNmZTQ5MjNkMTc1NGNjOTZjMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc","sha":"46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc"}],"sha":"2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/2e87a150c657d960e626bcfe4923d1754cc96c17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:11:37Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:11:37Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Pin phase 3 end to end, and document it\n\nThe end-to-end test patches the live response from the response row, saves\na quick edit, takes the page offline and back, reads a WebSocket''s messages\nand exports the requests as HAR and imports them back. The response row''s\nanswer controls wrap in a narrow editor, and the Network toolbar''s filter\ngives way sooner so its buttons fit. SPEC, NETWORK_PANEL (phase 3 as\nbuilt), DESIGN_SYSTEM, CHANGELOG and README describe phase 3.","tree":{"sha":"9827e6b8b6e57ffbac72d3d40ce80969018adbee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/9827e6b8b6e57ffbac72d3d40ce80969018adbee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc","verification":{"payload":"tree 9827e6b8b6e57ffbac72d3d40ce80969018adbee\nparent b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790359897 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790359897 +0000\n\nPin phase 3 end to end, and document it\n\nThe end-to-end test patches the live response from the response row, saves\na quick edit, takes the page offline and back, reads a WebSocket''s messages\nand exports the requests as HAR and imports them back. The response row''s\nanswer controls wrap in a narrow editor, and the Network toolbar''s filter\ngives way sooner so its buttons fit. SPEC, NETWORK_PANEL (phase 3 as\nbuilt), DESIGN_SYSTEM, CHANGELOG and README describe phase 3.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLR8ZznL\nHo2VoYCGPtkP4R+k/7h0Z8Giuqx+djcIyShKNWgMAYhMZBh2cwhpxvdB1EOIVExf9TqL9lJ9zvgO\nzAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDQ2YTNkOThjYjQwZWRiY2M3ZDA1ZDgyYmQ1YWVlYzYxZjkyMGQ4ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406","sha":"b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406"}],"sha":"46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/46a3d98cb40edbcc7d05d82bd5aeec61f920d8dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/1d2c64d3fc10b11afc57668a2533740c95dd4ca4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:57:34Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:57:34Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"Oleh H"},"message":"Add the page stack: which UI library, framework and bundler each frame runs\n\nThe first phase of the component inspector (docs/INSPECTOR_RESEARCH.md).\nA second after each frame loads, an InspectorService runs a detector in\nthe frame''s main world, silently and by value, on the sessions\ninterception already has: React, Vue 2 and 3, Angular, Svelte, Lit,\njQuery, Next.js, Nuxt, Remix, React Router, Gatsby, Astro, Pinia, Vuex,\nMobX, Apollo Client, webpack, Vite''s dev server, Parcel and Turbopack,\nwith versions and production or development builds. The page''s answer\nis checked against a shared table of known libraries and signals, so\nonly a version comes from the page.\n\nSo React can say which version it is, a minimal stand-in for the React\nDevTools hook goes in every new document before the page''s scripts\n(Framework hooks setting, on by default). FrameServices hands each\nsession to the console and the inspector as one observer.\n\nThe status bar names the page''s UI libraries and opens the Page stack,\na page tab listing every frame''s findings with their evidence; the\npalette opens it too.\n\nTested with a fake CDP transport, in real Chromium on a React app\nbundled from the repo''s own react-dom (production, development, hooks\noff) and across a cross-site iframe, and end to end in the app.","tree":{"sha":"16f3669cc93c847b5bbb56596b5a9257bf25af67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/16f3669cc93c847b5bbb56596b5a9257bf25af67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/1d2c64d3fc10b11afc57668a2533740c95dd4ca4","verification":{"payload":"tree 16f3669cc93c847b5bbb56596b5a9257bf25af67\nparent db0290604dc1b104f135f3dcbf6cf082644eb053\nauthor Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790359054 +0000\ncommitter Oleh H <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790359054 +0000\n\nAdd the page stack: which UI library, framework and bundler each frame runs\n\nThe first phase of the component inspector (docs/INSPECTOR_RESEARCH.md).\nA second after each frame loads, an InspectorService runs a detector in\nthe frame''s main world, silently and by value, on the sessions\ninterception already has: React, Vue 2 and 3, Angular, Svelte, Lit,\njQuery, Next.js, Nuxt, Remix, React Router, Gatsby, Astro, Pinia, Vuex,\nMobX, Apollo Client, webpack, Vite''s dev server, Parcel and Turbopack,\nwith versions and production or development builds. The page''s answer\nis checked against a shared table of known libraries and signals, so\nonly a version comes from the page.\n\nSo React can say which version it is, a minimal stand-in for the React\nDevTools hook goes in every new document before the page''s scripts\n(Framework hooks setting, on by default). FrameServices hands each\nsession to the console and the inspector as one observer.\n\nThe status bar names the page''s UI libraries and opens the Page stack,\na page tab listing every frame''s findings with their evidence; the\npalette opens it too.\n\nTested with a fake CDP transport, in real Chromium on a React app\nbundled from the repo''s own react-dom (production, development, hooks\noff) and across a cross-site iframe, and end to end in the app.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC/gw0ya\niNBY2NhcH06AGaUOXBciamLrWikTIImg4G7SJdQlaEbruYcKms2vi/Ruf32lZApIf9CeditHEuPv\nQA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/1d2c64d3fc10b11afc57668a2533740c95dd4ca4","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDFkMmM2NGQzZmMxMGIxMWFmYzU3NjY4YTI1MzM3NDBjOTVkZDRjYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/db0290604dc1b104f135f3dcbf6cf082644eb053","sha":"db0290604dc1b104f135f3dcbf6cf082644eb053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/db0290604dc1b104f135f3dcbf6cf082644eb053"}],"sha":"1d2c64d3fc10b11afc57668a2533740c95dd4ca4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/1d2c64d3fc10b11afc57668a2533740c95dd4ca4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:57:09Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:57:09Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Export the Network panel''s requests as HAR, and import a HAR as overrides\n\nThe toolbar''s HAR menu saves the requests the list shows as a HAR 1.2 file\n(the wire headers, the query, the bodies Chromium still holds, a socket''s\nmessages as Chrome writes them), through a save dialog. Importing a HAR\nturns each fetch() or XHR response with a text body into a response\noverride that answers its request without sending it (its URL with its\nquery, method, GraphQL operation, status and body; the last response to\na request wins, at most 200), so a teammate''s requests reproduce a bug\nwithout the backend. The Network panel''s API moves to its own interface.","tree":{"sha":"39019393eb18e9935c8175330641ac56bf92214c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/39019393eb18e9935c8175330641ac56bf92214c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406","verification":{"payload":"tree 39019393eb18e9935c8175330641ac56bf92214c\nparent 265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790359029 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790359029 +0000\n\nExport the Network panel''s requests as HAR, and import a HAR as overrides\n\nThe toolbar''s HAR menu saves the requests the list shows as a HAR 1.2 file\n(the wire headers, the query, the bodies Chromium still holds, a socket''s\nmessages as Chrome writes them), through a save dialog. Importing a HAR\nturns each fetch() or XHR response with a text body into a response\noverride that answers its request without sending it (its URL with its\nquery, method, GraphQL operation, status and body; the last response to\na request wins, at most 200), so a teammate''s requests reproduce a bug\nwithout the backend. The Network panel''s API moves to its own interface.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBcszXA5\nkeS1n0T1wdlTtaNMsCp/6/pNrUOAvdNhX1coWKboJOdGMnlKC0XrzYqj7KzpgNtodOm9qAAnF7Cl\nIwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKGIxYTE5ZDdkNmVjZGFkNWNmMzcyZGY3NjkzOWQ4YTJhZDY1Yzk0MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a","sha":"265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a"}],"sha":"b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/b1a19d7d6ecdad5cf372df76939d8a2ad65c9406"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:52:04Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:52:04Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"List WebSockets and their messages in the Network panel\n\nThe log adds a row for each WebSocket (its handshake''s headers, status\n101, open until it closes or breaks) and keeps its latest 1,000 messages,\ntext cut at 64 K characters, binary ones as base64. A WS chip filters\nthem, and a socket''s details show Headers and Messages: which way each\nwent, its text, size and time, opening to all of it. The panel reads only\nthe messages that came since its last read. Messages are read-only:\nChromium reports them but can''t hold or change them.\n\nThe fixture site gets a WebSocket endpoint that greets and echoes.","tree":{"sha":"ba73b158a5f178538d2c5eaecf77e836a3414ed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/ba73b158a5f178538d2c5eaecf77e836a3414ed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a","verification":{"payload":"tree ba73b158a5f178538d2c5eaecf77e836a3414ed2\nparent 682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790358724 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790358724 +0000\n\nList WebSockets and their messages in the Network panel\n\nThe log adds a row for each WebSocket (its handshake''s headers, status\n101, open until it closes or breaks) and keeps its latest 1,000 messages,\ntext cut at 64 K characters, binary ones as base64. A WS chip filters\nthem, and a socket''s details show Headers and Messages: which way each\nwent, its text, size and time, opening to all of it. The panel reads only\nthe messages that came since its last read. Messages are read-only:\nChromium reports them but can''t hold or change them.\n\nThe fixture site gets a WebSocket endpoint that greets and echoes.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP9sO+PL\n7VQDAAWHWKy1pu79gQ0GsP+E1QrTApfAlu+n7vts5RrMdPwHdPke3V1hfEKUO2v/cgoGiyr21dMB\n8AQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDI2NWFkMjAzYzA0M2YwNzdmYWY1NzIzOTQ1OGZiMmJhMTNiZTgwNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2","sha":"682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2"}],"sha":"265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/265ad203c043f077faf57239458fb2ba13be804a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:46:57Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:46:57Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Throttle the page''s network from the Network panel\n\nA network speed setting (No throttling, Fast 4G, Slow 4G, 3G, Offline)\napplies Network.emulateNetworkConditions to the page and to every iframe\nand worker session, as the cache setting does. The Network toolbar has its\nmenu, and the status bar says when the page is slowed down or offline.\nSettings are now checked key by key, so a setting can hold something other\nthan on or off.","tree":{"sha":"5ffab45f907be8f9820fe287b73a8ad6c18b4fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/5ffab45f907be8f9820fe287b73a8ad6c18b4fc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ffab45f907be8f9820fe287b73a8ad6c18b4fc3\nparent bcc8ea3425c43fc2a8563c82d11ecc9afc98f774\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790358417 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790358417 +0000\n\nThrottle the page''s network from the Network panel\n\nA network speed setting (No throttling, Fast 4G, Slow 4G, 3G, Offline)\napplies Network.emulateNetworkConditions to the page and to every iframe\nand worker session, as the cache setting does. The Network toolbar has its\nmenu, and the status bar says when the page is slowed down or offline.\nSettings are now checked key by key, so a setting can hold something other\nthan on or off.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP33VMTy\nY44FrSS7iNIzvAdhmojuvlK/d2NhjpMsdwmugiy9df/Z87Svez3CXR96bbUxyyMZOt8Ao4W/k5bE\nKgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2","node_id":"C_kwDOUoGmVtoAKDY4MmU3NGE0MTA0MDhjOTRhZDUyZWU5MDlmMzAwMjk4ZTJmNjQ3YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev/console-editor/commit/bcc8ea3425c43fc2a8563c82d11ecc9afc98f774","sha":"bcc8ea3425c43fc2a8563c82d11ecc9afc98f774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/bcc8ea3425c43fc2a8563c82d11ecc9afc98f774"}],"sha":"682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/682e74a410408c94ad52ee909f300298e2f647b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/commits/bcc8ea3425c43fc2a8563c82d11ecc9afc98f774/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:41:51Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:41:51Z","email":"bigbooooooom@gmail.com","name":"olehwebdev"},"message":"Add quick edits for UI states to response tabs\n\nThe response row''s Quick edits menu empties every list, lengthens every\ntext (links, ids and dates keep their length), nulls the value at the\ncursor, or sets a 500 or a 3 s delay. Text edits are one undoable edit\nthat changes only what it must, so spacing, numbers and key order stay as\ntyped; the response row shows Patch live beside Send request, and the\nExplorer marks patching overrides.","tree":{"sha":"e99b1eb9c7afc16c06859579df232a8ce043e04f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/trees/e99b1eb9c7afc16c06859579df232a8ce043e04f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/olehwebdev/console-editor/git/commits/bcc8ea3425c43fc2a8563c82d11ecc9afc98f774","verification":{"payload":"tree e99b1eb9c7afc16c06859579df232a8ce043e04f\nparent e1aabae9b0a472bb1761a4a444ac38cbf5200bfb\nauthor olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790358111 +0000\ncommitter olehwebdev <bigbooooooom@gmail.com> 1790358111 +0000\n\nAdd quick edits for UI states to response tabs\n\nThe response row''s Quick edits menu empties every list, lengthens every\ntext (links, ids and dates keep their length), nulls the value at the\ncursor, or sets a 500 or a 3 s delay. Text edits are one undoable edit\nthat changes only what it must, so spacing, numbers and key order stay as\ntyped; the response row shows Patch live beside Send request, and the\nExplorer marks patching overrides.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAuHPBmG\n0OQg02HRcpVh2dXMU7pC1P1lPG0Nbf4YBa3CQeiRJWda4Qh7AUNoKekcPnF8LsVnCA09UUyiDbOD\niQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/olehwebdev","id":10379680,"login":"olehwebdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5Njgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olehwebdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use