launch plan: andredavcev.com first, moving to\n  theorynetwork.com once that domain is recovered.\n- Lists the stack as planned in the Linear Portfolio project: Nx monorepo,\n  portfolio-web React host (Rspack, React Router), Angular remote for the\n  Firefly page, shadcn via @aws/nx-plugin, prerendered static HTML, S3 +\n  CloudFront deployed with Terraform, Plausible analytics.\n- License section: code is MIT; written content, the Theory Network logo\n  and licensed stock images are not covered and all rights are reserved.\n\nDeliberate gap: no install/run commands. There is no Nx workspace yet\n(1.2 scaffolds it), so the README has a \"Status\" section saying nothing\ncan be installed or run yet rather than inventing commands. Real\ninstructions should be added as part of 1.2.\n\nVerification: docs-only change, nothing to build or test. The stack list\nwas checked against the Portfolio project''s description in Linear, and\nthe license wording matches the issue''s requirement.\n\nStill open on 1.1: this needs to be merged through a PR (branch\nprotection on main now blocks direct pushes).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"127ff30da31f7b02dd291f62bfa261ef3deb61bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theory-network/portfolio/git/trees/127ff30da31f7b02dd291f62bfa261ef3deb61bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theory-network/portfolio/git/commits/439d4935d75a8774e34aee48435718a7d623ba44","verification":{"payload":"tree 127ff30da31f7b02dd291f62bfa261ef3deb61bb\nparent c0176075e37c66fea662df19cfefc883b7b85be3\nauthor Andre Davcev <andre.davcev@gmail.com> 1790310966 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790310966 -0400\n\nWrite the README and add the license scope note (THE-494) (#2)\n\nWhy: the repo''s README was a one-line \"# portfolio\" placeholder. Issue\n1.1 (Repo housekeeping) asks for a real README covering what the site is,\nthe stack, and how to run it, plus a note that the MIT license doesn''t\ncover the site''s content, logo or licensed stock images.\n\nWhat changed (README.md only):\n- Describes the site (Home, Portfolio with Nexus and Firefly, Services,\n  About) and the launch plan: andredavcev.com first, moving to\n  theorynetwork.com once that domain is recovered.\n- Lists the stack as planned in the Linear Portfolio project: Nx monorepo,\n  portfolio-web React host (Rspack, React Router), Angular remote for the\n  Firefly page, shadcn via @aws/nx-plugin, prerendered static HTML, S3 +\n  CloudFront deployed with Terraform, Plausible analytics.\n- License section: code is MIT; written content, the Theory Network logo\n  and licensed stock images are not covered and all rights are reserved.\n\nDeliberate gap: no install/run commands. There is no Nx workspace yet\n(1.2 scaffolds it), so the README has a \"Status\" section saying nothing\ncan be installed or run yet rather than inventing commands. Real\ninstructions should be added as part of 1.2.\n\nVerification: docs-only change, nothing to build or test. The stack list\nwas checked against the Portfolio project''s description in Linear, and\nthe license wording matches the issue''s requirement.\n\nStill open on 1.1: this needs to be merged through a PR (branch\nprotection on main now blocks direct pushes).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtfo2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtEkQACIH7CjMWnPZTkwZ2ob04ikC\n8yj4DYMr587HmA0ZgonzCMBFfYV+DNoSlpwryayvALdmRFyJ5/oTHEVcGLhMijKK\nuYf2NnpbHtbNnGuBKmsmNNdGh/kh94Ian5IFquhv3OX4dtrf+4+1smPAu8fttWxP\nOZ47t0Ij9pcXXmhBwHBiCk9loJM9LW0AvPXvtYPm1Phx7B6KGjB58PKcPjvhaTL6\ng8GT4OjHHwVautZnXUJ4CUIKfpTlOi2ZjzHd1bw384E2yKmsKShXVCjPgIq1SWeD\nxuJ8LniGsSp9koJjvj8+L7kgwrYlgaOzmYJ+Usbs7nZAx2dsQbM3Uon7z0wfa+le\nnvDwdQ9Jk37orFTYgwoIOqP8Q9dyQJ2ey1nBgTM6aLv/eIhFkluapw933J52meD1\n4li7VdlkKJH9yYpv/VnTSo95KBbBvVRTXBRN66FyWwu52sBAmdN7MgMMjJuXPBMo\n1payq5GTxGJtkjYYnUUI9uAn6avR2r8TukpKL+G/TOYhv98u1ahKW8YN2uigAC+I\nmiN