ir contents (blank banner, overlapping name).\nThey are now div role=\"link\" with Enter/Space support.\n\n- Discover card: banner (photo or category gradient), avatar, category pill, name,\n  two-line bio, subscriber and post counts, \"From $X/month\" and \"View page\".\n- Storefront header: avatar overlaps the banner; name, facts row and bio sit below it.\n- Post card: cover (photo or lock/video/audio tile), title, access, date, views, teaser.\n- CreatorCardDto carries the bio and published post count.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8576369470a98c32368377eea53adc6b172672ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/8576369470a98c32368377eea53adc6b172672ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/4434d8982374be67df95f834d37ef9a91b312c52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/4434d8982374be67df95f834d37ef9a91b312