eceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/49ca501765db09e51ba15da0524b00b6c4cd4a85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:57:34Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:57:34Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Add the Creator Module: subscriptions, gated posts, payouts and a creator studio\n\nFrom NDEIPI-SRS-CREATOR-001.\n\n- Creators (anyone whose identity is checked by Bridge KYC) set up a page with\n  up to five ranked tiers, monthly or annual, and post text, photos, audio and\n  video, public, for a tier and up, or pay-per-view, now or scheduled.\n- Subscribers pay from their Ndeipi wallet; access starts at once and is taken\n  back if the payment fails. Renewals run on a timer: a failed one gives three\n  days'' grace with daily retries, then access ends. Cancelling ends at the\n  period''s end.\n- Each payment is one Bridge transfer with the platform''s 5% kept as Bridge''s\n  developer fee; payments are recorded with their fee and rate (the ledger).\n- Locked media is only served through links that expire (30 minutes) and are\n  only handed to people with access.\n- The studio: earnings (gross, fee, net, MRR, balance and what''s on hold),\n  posts, tiers, the page, subscribers (anonymous unless they share),\n  broadcasts to subscribers'' chats, analytics (visits, conversion, views,\n  plays, unlocks), and withdrawals to a US bank (ACH/wire) or IBAN through\n  Bridge external accounts, or to a USDC address, after a 7-day hold.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8213df325daac97d0c6bd0f51823d5d8a117e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/f8213df325daac97d0c6bd0f51823d5d8a117e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/49ca501765db09e51ba15da0524b00b6c4cd4a85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/49ca501765db09e51ba15da0524b00b6c4cd4a85","node_id":"C_kwDOUoWZvtoAKDQ5Y2E1MDE3NjVkYjA5ZTUxYmExNWRhMDUyNGIwMGI2YzRjZDRhODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/9da93855b8f572fe2b98098185629fc8c91c1d2f","sha":"9da93855b8f572fe2b98098185629fc8c91c1d2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/9da93855b8f572fe2b98098185629fc8c91c1d2f"}],"sha":"49ca501765db09e51ba15da0524b00b6c4cd4a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/49ca501765db09e51ba15da0524b00b6c4cd4a85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuse