api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/8fd8cefde4d35c97a807b82878c9904689cdec02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:15:25Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:15:25Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Add the Trust Score: a 0-100 score everyone sees on profiles\n\nFrom the SRS \"CRM Trust Score Engine\". The score adds up tiers of linked\nidentity (Bridge KYC 50, professional 30, social 20), payment history\n(a point per distinct counterparty this year, up to 15) and work record\n(a point per distinct client who approved gig work, up to 15), capped at 100.\n\n- Accounts linked on the new Trust page (LinkedIn, X, Facebook via OAuth;\n  Telegram via its login widget) and the accounts people sign in with through\n  Clerk (Google, Apple, Microsoft, GitHub, a verified phone) count; each outside\n  account can back only one Ndeipi account.\n- Social accounts decay: full credit for 90 days after last confirmed, half\n  until 180, then none. A daily worker re-checks OAuth links with their\n  encrypted tokens (Trust:TokenKey); sign-in accounts refresh on profile sync.\n- Scores recompute on KYC changes, confirmed transfers and gig approvals/ratings,\n  and broadcast live on trust:{userId}.\n- Badges on profiles, the chat header, the send-money recipient and the Pay page;\n  the phone opens the Trust page in its WebView.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"s