92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/397aa77ef9d1129a568c2641fb0d34e5bb3b736b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:54:49Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:54:49Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Profile: the editor fits a phone; the header doesn''t wait for its photos\n\n- The profile and group editors overflowed a phone: on narrow screens the\n  modal was one 1fr column, which can''t be narrower than its widest content,\n  and the sideways-scrolling section tabs pushed the fields and the Save /\n  Discard buttons off the right. It''s minmax(0, 1fr) now.\n- The profile and group headers looked late because the cover and avatar\n  were blank until their photos downloaded. The cover now shows its colour\n  and the avatar its initials at once, with the photo fading in over them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6252f827020051290962ca670dc8561df9e84059","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/