b.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/8505ab34ccee881c6417489d4104a6df757928f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:13:46Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:13:46Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Build a Windows MSI installer for the desktop app\n\ninstaller/NdeipiChat.Desktop.Installer (WiX v5, MS-RL; v6 would need its EULA\naccepted) packs the self-contained publish of src/NdeipiChat.Desktop into\nNdeipi-<version>-x64.msi: per machine under Program Files, Start menu and\ndesktop shortcuts, an Apps & features entry with the icon, major upgrades by\na fixed UpgradeCode, and \"Open Ndeipi\" at the end. No license page yet.\n\neng/build-desktop-msi.ps1 publishes and builds it; the Desktop apps workflow\nnow builds the MSI (1.0.<run number>) and uploads it.\n\nICE03/ICE60 are suppressed: some Windows App SDK files declare more\nlanguages than the File table''s Language column holds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3ae5ee07e008a1b10ffb93c304de606446cb5d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/a3ae5ee07e008a1b10ffb93c304de606446cb5d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/8505ab34ccee881c6417489d4104a6df757928f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gr