thub.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/a643532f395f04af5be600928e319db86394e18d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:31:27Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:31:27Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Add a micro-app SDK: packages, a dev host and a project template\n\nEngineers can now build a micro-app without the Ndeipi repo, a database or a\nsign-in:\n\n- NdeipiChat.SubApps.Sdk is packable. It keeps its assembly name, so apps\n  built against the package load in the shell unchanged.\n- NdeipiChat.SubApps.DevHost runs an app in a stand-in shell: switchable fake\n  users, a mock API written in Program.cs (API JSON settings and problem\n  titles), in-memory realtime topics, Web Crypto device keys, and a bar for\n  phone/tablet/desktop width, the phone app''s embedded view and theme. Panels\n  show API calls, topics and crashes. The app runs in an iframe so its phone\n  CSS applies; the shell''s app.css is linked in, not copied.\n- NdeipiChat.SubApps.Templates adds `dotnet new ndeipi-subapp`: a working\n  sample app and its dev host, from packages or (--in-repo) this repo''s\n  projects.\n- eng/pack-subapps-sdk.ps1 packs all three into artifacts/packages.\n\ndocs/micro-apps.md gains \"Start with the SDK\"; docs/sub-apps.md uses the\ntemplate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.