eb082515f","sha":"b7ecbfc7c205ac1c5eea8f78663f2b2eb082515f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/b7ecbfc7c205ac1c5eea8f78663f2b2eb082515f"}],"sha":"ab897f26f71f0706c3b8550cf220e2d3f7911973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/ab897f26f71f0706c3b8550cf220e2d3f7911973"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/7254b477a43fcce0fcd640d5c098ee99d60f0b6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:15:54Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:15:54Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Add a Point of Sale sub-app\n\nA POS sub-app from the \"Ndeipi Super App — Point of Sale (POS) Module\" SRS,\nsprint 1 (the P0 requirements), for the web, desktop and phone shells.\n\n- Merchants, stores and staff with the SRS roles: Merchant admin (the\n  owner), Store manager, Cashier and Auditor, added by their Ndeipi email.\n- The till unlocks with a staff PIN (PBKDF2, unique per business, runs and\n  repeats refused), pauses after five wrong PINs, and locks after idling\n  without losing the cart (FR-AUTH-01/02).\n- Shifts with an opening float, drops, pay-ins and no-sale opens, X and Z\n  reports and the counted-cash variance (FR-AUTH-03).\n- Catalogue with categories, barcodes and SKUs, variants and modifiers;\n  scanning by keyboard-wedge scanner or camera (FR-CAT-01/02, FR-HDW-02).\n- Pricing shared by server and till (PosPricing): tax inclusive or added,\n  line and cart discounts, over the limit needing a manager''s PIN\n  (FR-CAT-03/04).\n- Split tenders (cash with change, card by terminal reference only, voucher),\n  idempotent checkout by the till''s sale id (FR-PAY-01/02, NFR-SEC-02).\n- Receipts printed via the print dialog or sent to the customer''s Ndeipi\n  chats (FR-PAY-03).\n- Offline cash sales queued on the device and uploaded in order; stock\n  driven negative is flagged (FR-OFF-01/03).\n- Stock per store, taken by sales, returned by voids and refunds, counted in\n  by scanning, with low-stock warnings (FR-INV).\n- A hash-chained audit trail of voids, refunds, overrides, drawer opens,\n  shifts, stock and staff changes, with a verify check (NFR-SEC-03).\n- Migration PointOfSale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e39fff17b6f769aabbd35825735093fdfb2d635f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/e39fff17b6f769aabbd35825735093fdfb2d635f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/7254b477a43fcce0fcd640d5c098ee99d60f0b6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/7254b477a43fcce0fcd640d5c098ee99d60f0b6d","node_id":"C_kwDOUoWZvtoAKDcyNTRiNDc3YTQzZmNjZTBmY2Q2NDBkNWMwOThlZTk5ZDYwZjBiNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/b567f37e3abab58f9e2888d736a14ed4125f2e51","sha":"b567f37e3abab58f9e2888d736a14ed4125f2e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/b567f37e3abab58f9e2888d736a14ed4125f2e51"}],"sha":"7254b477a43fcce0fcd640d5c098ee99d60f0b6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/7254b477a43fcce0fcd640d5c098ee99d60f0b6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/b7ecbfc7c205ac1c5eea8f78663f2b2eb082515f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:35:57Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:35:57Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Fix Gigs opening a browser chooser and Home''s app icons in the Android app\n\n- The WebView page sent every address off chat.ndeipi.com to the system\n  browser, including the about:blank every WebView starts on: Android then\n  asked which browser should open a blank page. Its own pages (about:,\n  data:, blob:) now stay in the WebView; other schemes (mailto:, tel:) go\n  to the app that handles them; only other websites go to the browser.\n- Home''s app icons, open-app chips and recent chats looked for their\n  commands on an ancestor bound to the launcher or chats view model, which\n  Home doesn''t have, so taps did nothing (apps only opened from All apps).\n  They go through HomeViewModel now.\n- Web: on the sign-in callback, the layout no longer loads with a session\n  saved earlier (possibly someone else''s); the arriving handoff decides.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12443e32acb9202d5c4baa08e9e78e0a1b2cf9e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/12443e32acb9202d5c4baa08e9e78e0a1b2cf9e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/b7ecbfc7c205ac1c5eea8f78663f2b2eb082515f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.c