,"sha":"e344a34bcbc9ca98630f55a693d3940b7d7d4aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/e344a34bcbc9ca98630f55a693d3940b7d7d4aa8"}],"sha":"b567f37e3abab58f9e2888d736a14ed4125f2e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/b567f37e3abab58f9e2888d736a14ed4125f2e51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/e344a34bcbc9ca98630f55a693d3940b7d7d4aa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:07:22Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:07:22Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Android in the web''s glass design, post comments and reposts, and fix Gigs sign-in in the app\n\nAndroid app\n- The web''s frosted-glass theme: brand blue, a soft backdrop, frosted cards,\n  rounded fields and buttons, gradient avatars and app colours, dark mode\n  (following the phone, or chosen on More).\n- A Home tab like the web''s: greeting, wallet card, quick actions, frequent\n  contacts, your apps and recent chats (HomeViewModel, shared).\n- The web''s floating dock (Chats, Social, raised Home, Wallet, More) instead\n  of Android''s tab bar, on every main page.\n- Chats, chat, Social, Shamwaris, All apps, Wallet, Me, sign-in, the\n  transfer forms and compose restyled to match.\n- Fix screens that stopped taking taps: Home''s pull-to-refresh shared the\n  launcher''s flag and nothing cleared it; Cow details never cleared its\n  own; Wallet''s was the busy flag.\n- Navigation and WebView logging to logcat (tag \"ndeipi\"), and WebView\n  debugging in debug builds.\n\nWeb sub-apps in the app (Gigs)\n- The sign-in callback no longer races the layout''s own start, which used\n  a stale session, skipped the handoff and landed on the web Home with its\n  menus.\n- In the app''s WebView the web shell never shows Clerk''s sign-in page (it\n  opened the browser); it asks the app for a fresh handoff (embed/signin).\n\nPosts\n- Comments (add, list, delete by writer or post author), reposts (plain or\n  with your thoughts, once per person, undo; deleting a post deletes its\n  reposts), and Top/Recent sorting and an images filter for the feed.\n- Web: Like, Comment and Repost on each post, comments underneath, Sort by,\n  and Posts, Comments and Images on profiles'' Activity. Text-only posts no\n  longer show an empty photo area.\n- Migration PostCommentsAndReposts (applied to production).\n\nAlso: app colours shared between web and phone, stable across launches;\nthe profile and group editor''s close button no longer cut off.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"097f3b7e26a3737cecc5bb5f481330365ff5bc9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/097f3b7e26a3737cecc5bb5f481330365ff5bc9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/e344a34bcbc9ca98630f55a693d3940b7d7d4aa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified"