 Catalyst) that shows\nchat.ndeipi.com, the full redesigned web app, in a native window.\n\n- Sign-in happens in the system browser; the app then hands its session to the web\n  app with a one-time code (CreateWebHandoffAsync, now with embedded: false for the\n  full layout).\n- Windows returns sign-in to a loopback listener on http://127.0.0.1:47832/auth\n  (added to MobileAuth:RedirectUris); the Mac uses ndeipichat://auth.\n- Links to other sites open in the default browser, and signing out in the web app\n  signs the desktop app out.\n- Windows publishes as a self-contained folder with Ndeipi.exe. The Mac app has to\n  be built on macOS: .github/workflows/desktop.yml builds both on GitHub and\n  attaches them to the run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20291ab89674c5a58627a9b34a7ef3564e081f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/20291ab89674c5a58627a9b34a7ef3564e081f73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/19af8ff987cc6e5d33009c68d2cd349b8c933360","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi