hub.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/9212aeebf335c12ffdbfe3d0e461482b2b8e275d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:44:27Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:44:27Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Serve sub-apps from the bundle this release actually serves\n\nA publish that keeps files from earlier releases (SkipExtraFilesOnServer) leaves\nseveral fingerprinted copies of a sub-app''s .wasm in _framework. The launcher took\nthe first match, which could be a stale copy that MapStaticAssets no longer serves,\nso the shell''s download 404''d (\"Couldn''t download Events\").\n\nSubAppBundles now prefers the copy listed in the static assets endpoints manifest,\nthen a fingerprinted name, then the newest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c45b33b8ccf6a1a4cdce1dd20d42dd7b90ab4c4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/c45b33b8ccf6a1a4cdce1dd20d42dd7b90ab4c4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/9212aeebf335c12ffdbfe3d0e461482b2b8e275d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","re