lowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/399d84ff356aa7429da076ef8deb1fe105341e37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T18:50:41Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T18:50:41Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Social section, gig board, all-apps page, and fixes for the error bar and chat scrolling\n\nFixes\n- The apps drawer listed an app under both Pinned and All apps while editing, as\n  siblings with the same @key; Blazor stopped rendering (\"Something went wrong\") and\n  Edit appeared to do nothing. Each list now has its own container.\n- Leaving Gigs disposed the map''s JS module before the map pages used it to tear\n  down; teardown errors are now caught and the module isn''t disposed early.\n- Chat on phones: the conversation fills the visible screen (dvh, no dock padding),\n  so only the messages scroll and the header and composer stay put.\n- Home redraws when chats and Shamwaris arrive after it first renders.\n\nSocial (was Feed)\n- Profiles with a cover, hexagon avatar, stats, bio/city/website, and tabs for\n  timeline, about, groups, photos, followers and following.\n- One-way follows and a Following feed; public and private groups with posts,\n  rules and members; text-only posts; posts in groups.\n- Links to the other apps: message, send money or tokens, add Shamwari (new\n  POST /api/shamwaris/users/{id}), and hire through Gigs.\n\nGigs\n- A board: categories with open counts, latest open gigs by category, and the map.\n  Workers with the skill can take a gig from the board.\n\nAlso an All apps page, and LocalPreview, which serves the app locally against the\nfake Clerk for clicking through without a real account.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a07bf4666c721649730363eafeb5c6b256eafa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/8a07bf4666c721649730363eafeb5c6b256eafa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/399d84ff356aa7429da076ef8deb1fe105341e37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/399d84ff356aa7429da076ef8deb1fe105341e37","node_id":"C_kwDOUoWZvtoAKDM5OWQ4NGZmMzU2YWE3NDI5ZGEwNzZlZjhkZWIxZmUxMDUzNDFlMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/816a5ae908c7339c08d8c9209b15cc674ba64cea","sha":"816a5ae908c7339c08d8c9209b15cc674ba64cea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/816a5ae908c7339c08d8c9209b15cc674ba64cea"}],"sha":"399d84ff356aa7429da076ef8deb1fe105341e37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/399d84ff356aa7429da076ef8deb1fe105341e37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/816a5ae908c7339c08d8c9209b15cc674ba64cea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:16:27Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:16:27Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Redesign the web app with a frosted-glass theme\n\n- Theme: translucent, blurred surfaces over a soft colour backdrop, blue brand\n  colour, and light/dark modes (follows the device until chosen; remembered in the\n  browser and applied before Blazor starts). Existing class names are kept, so every\n  page and sub-app picks up the look.\n- Shell: an icon rail on wide screens, and a floating dock with a raised Home on\n  phones. More opens a frosted apps drawer: pinned and all apps, pin editing, dark\n  mode and account links.\n- Home: greeting, wallet card with tap-for-balance, quick actions, frequent contacts,\n  your apps and recent activity.\n- Chats: a three-pane messenger (chat list, conversation, Exchange panel). The\n  Exchange panel sends money or tokens without leaving the chat and lists the chat''s\n  transfers; on phones it slides over the conversation.\n- Transfer forms can stay open beside the chat (StaysOpen): they clear after each\n  send and get a new client message id, instead of navigating back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d08b935ce3ba445382da74e2f9c71eae8899c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/4d08b935ce3ba445382da74e2f9c71eae8899c06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/816a5ae908c7339c08d8c9209b15cc674ba64cea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ty