/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/ba631bb3f4402dcfbb6edd4ebb849c5adbc39d04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:36:26Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:36:26Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Add Gigs sub-app: worker map, proximity dispatch, gig workspace, NdeipiCoin payment\n\nImplements the Gigs SRS as a runtime-loaded sub-app, except escrow and profile NFTs.\n\n- Worker profiles with skills, a place and an available/offline switch; available\n  workers show on a live map at a rough area only.\n- Gigs posted from the map, for a chosen worker, or from a chat (\"Start a gig\" in\n  the chat''s \"+\" panel; a direct chat''s gig goes to the other person).\n- Dispatch to the 5 nearest available workers with the skill within 50 km, with live\n  alerts; workers coming online are offered open gigs nearby; declines move on.\n- First worker to accept wins (conditional update) and gets a direct chat with the\n  client; the gig page shows the gig and that chat side by side.\n- Approving pays the budget from client to worker in NdeipiCoin through the existing\n  token-transfer queue, with no fee; a fixed client message id stops double payment.\n- Ratings on both sides. SubAppContext gains the query string the app was opened with.\n\nEscrow waits on an escrow contract; payment happens on approval until then.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"828441a5331b4f804444019100e243ddcb250ab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/828441a5331b4f804444019100e243ddcb250ab3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/ba631bb3f4402dcfbb6edd4ebb849c5adbc39d04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/ba631bb3f4402dcfbb6edd4ebb849c5adbc39d04","node_id":"C_kwDOUoWZvtoAKGJhNjMxYmIzZjQ0MDJkY2ZiYjZlZGQ0ZWJiODQ5YzVhZGJjMzlkMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/17dc3947070b04f5418ab3e5699fd73eb5c3d9eb","sha":"17dc3947070b04f5418ab3e5699fd73eb5c3d9eb","url":"https://api.github.com