20c39fe2415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/e79efdada7529c332279bc521405a20c39fe2415"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/75b16eb499cca3303ac5ad38cca722b2834bc2e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:22:58Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:22:58Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Open sub-apps on the phone as web micro-frontends\n\nStep 4 of the Super App SRS. The phone app opens runtime-loaded sub-apps\n(Inventory) in an in-app WebView showing the web shell''s apps/{id} page.\nDownloading native code isn''t allowed by Google Play (Device and Network\nAbuse) or on iOS, so sub-apps stay web content on every phone.\n\n- WebSubAppViewModel (Client.Core): the app downloads the bundle and checks\n  its hash and publisher signature with SubAppVerifier and the keys compiled\n  into the store-signed app, and refuses to open it if the check fails.\n  Release builds require a signature; debug builds, which may use a local\n  API, don''t. PublisherKeys moves to Client.Core, so the web and phone\n  shells compile in the same keys, and Client.Core registers SubAppTrust and\n  SubAppVerifier by default.\n- AuthService.CreateWebHandoffAsync: a one-time code for the phone''s own\n  Clerk session via the existing PKCE code flow (/api/auth/mobile/complete),\n  opened as signin/callback?code&state&next=apps/{id}&embedded=1, with the\n  verifier in the URL fragment. The web shell redeems it into a WebView\n  session of its own, with refresh tokens separate from the phone''s.\n- Web: the callback accepts a verifier from the fragment only when the user\n  agent has NdeipiApp/1, which the app''s WebView sets, so a crafted link\n  can''t sign an ordinary browser into someone else''s account. Embedded mode\n  (WebEmbedding) hides navigation and sign-out, and back navigates to\n  embed/close.\n- Phone: WebSubAppPage (WebView). It closes on embed/close or the site root\n  and sends other origins to the system browser. The navigator opens apps/*\n  routes there.\n\nChecked: a crafted callback link in a normal browser shows \"Sign-in was\ninterrupted\", without signing in or entering embedded mode.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0152cd73e85db4e5651816f26c4bef343dde760e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/0152cd73e85db4e5651816f26c4bef343dde760e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/75b16eb499cca3303ac5ad38cca722b2834bc2e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}"