,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/3be5034814afc908b1664124d6715744d96bd7cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T15:21:43Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T15:21:43Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Add the feed, minting posts as NFTs, and NdeipiCoin\n\nFeed: public posts of one to four photos with a caption, and likes, on\nthe phone app and the web app. Photos are re-encoded on the server into\nthree JPEG sizes, which drops EXIF including GPS, and served publicly and\nimmutably from /media/posts/{id}/{size} so an NFT''s image loads anywhere.\n\nMinting: an author can mint a post (when posting, or later). It''s a row\non the existing Ndeipi queue with Operation \"Mint\", minted to the author,\nwith a token id derived from the post (the same on every retry) and the\npost''s public ERC-721 metadata URL (/nft/posts/{id}) as its tokenURI. The\nqueue gains PostId and MetadataUri, ConversationId/MessageId become\nnullable, and usp_ClaimTokenTransfers returns the new columns. The status\nrelay sends a mint''s progress to its author live (PostNftChanged). A\npost with a mint that hasn''t failed can''t be deleted. Minting is off\nuntil Social:Nft names a contract. docs/ndeipi-queue.md specifies the\nMint operation for Ndeipi Enterprise Server.\n\ncontracts/: NdeipiPosts, the ERC-721 for posts on Polygon (OpenZeppelin 5,\nminter role, duplicate mints revert, ERC-4906 metadata updates), with a\nHardhat project, tests and a deploy script. NdeipiCoin at 0xd8d4...ab3b is\nan ERC-20, so it can''t carry one token per post.\n\nNdeipiCoin (NDEIPI on Polygon) joins Tokens:Known, so it''s a one-tap\nchoice for transfers in chats.\n\nIIS''s request limit rises to 42 MB for four-photo posts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc3fc167f0e4d332ddfb59d68de9b0a52c99a705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/dc3fc167f0e4d332ddfb59d68de9b0a52c99a705"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/3be5034814afc908b1664124d6715744d96bd7cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api