nts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/cdcad4e9bc59230496ed193bcc360447f41bd02d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:35:40Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:35:40Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Bring the cattle module to the web app\n\nThe web app gets the Herd tab: registered animals with thumbnails and vet\nflags, captures still waiting to upload (Upload now, Discard), registering\na cow (face photo, side photo, details, analysis), and each cow''s record\nwith its health checks and New health check. Photos come from a file\npicker, which opens the rear camera on a phone.\n\nThe browser can''t run what the phone uses, so Client.Core gains two seams:\n\n- ILivestockCaptureQueue. The phone keeps SQLite and photo files\n  (LivestockCaptureQueue); the web app uses IndexedDB, photos included, so\n  captures made offline survive reloads and upload later. LivestockSync\n  reads photos through the queue instead of from files.\n- IP256Signer, the ECDSA step of OperatorSigner. The phone keeps .NET''s\n  ECDsa (DotNetP256Signer); the web app uses Web Crypto, since ECDsa isn''t\n  available in WebAssembly. Formats match (SPKI, PKCS#8, raw r||s), checked\n  by verifying a browser signature with .NET''s ECDsa as the API does.\n  OperatorSigner''s existing constructor still works.\n\nLocation comes from the browser''s geolocation, settings and the operator\nkey from localStorage. ClientOptions.SupportsLivestock goes, as the web now\nsupports livestock.\n\nAlso: the layout no longer renders the requested page for a signed-out\nvisitor while the redirect to sign-in is under way, which let pages call\nthe API and get 401s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c713417aaf2d238040e7741e04a09ce43cf5963a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/c713417aaf2d238040e7741e04a09ce43cf5963a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/commits/cdcad4e9bc59230496ed193bcc360447f41bd02d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/cdcad4e9bc59230496ed193bcc360447f41bd02d","node_id":"C_kwDOUoWZvtoAKGNkY2FkNGU5YmM1OTIzMDQ5NmVkMTkzYmNjMzYwNDQ3ZjQxYmQwMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/6da5f2ca0b572ad419c063b7a1deaccda0b4c4c8","sha":"6da5f2ca0b572ad419c063b7a1deaccda0b4c4c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/6da5f2ca