/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/3b266d3f32d5e71cc010bb29904f671e3978b743","node_id":"C_kwDOUoWZvtoAKDNiMjY2ZDNmMzJkNWU3MWNjMDEwYmIyOTkwNGY2NzFlMzk3OGI3NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/6b823314140b6bb981a75e0ae0d1f4675fe79c44","sha":"6b823314140b6bb981a75e0ae0d1f4675fe79c44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/6b823314140b6bb981a75e0ae0d1f4675fe79c44"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commit/aa4a48e4e47f2d2bf2d23e98fa665b23acb5db9d","sha":"aa4a48e4e47f2d2bf2d23e98fa665b23acb5db9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/aa4a48e4e47f2d2bf2d23e98fa665b23acb5db9d"}],"sha":"3b266d3f32d5e71cc010bb29904f671e3978b743","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/3b266d3f32d5e71cc010bb29904f671e3978b743"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92172044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tyrone191","id":92172044,"login":"tyrone191","node_id":"U_kgDOBX5vDA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tyrone191","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/commits/aa4a48e4e47f2d2bf2d23e98fa665b23acb5db9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:34:21Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:34:21Z","email":"ty.moodley@outlook.com","name":"Tyrone Moodley"},"message":"Add Shamwaris, Swagger and site4now hosting fixes\n\nShamwaris (friends): add people by email or phone number. They get a live\nrequest over SignalR and become Shamwaris on both sides once they accept.\nAdding someone who has already asked you accepts their request. Anyone not\non Ndeipi yet gets a pending invite, which becomes a request when they sign\nup with that email or number. Only emails and numbers Clerk has verified\ncan be found or claim invites.\n\n- API: Shamwaris table and migration, ShamwariService, /api/shamwaris\n  endpoints and a ShamwarisChanged hub event. Users now also store a\n  verified phone number and whether their email is verified; the migration\n  makes existing users re-sync their Clerk profile.\n- App: the Contacts tab becomes Shamwaris, with an add field, requests\n  (accept/decline), pending requests (cancel) and swipe to remove. Tapping a\n  Shamwari opens the chat, where Send money already lives.\n- Swagger UI at /swagger and the OpenAPI document at /openapi/v1.json, in\n  Development only, with Clerk bearer auth.\n- Publish out-of-process: site4now''s shared IIS app pool refused to mix\n  hosting models (HTTP 500.34).\n- Secrets move to user secrets locally and to a git-ignored\n  appsettings.Production.json on the server. UserSecretsId, a dotnet-ef tool\n  manifest, and the API URL chat.ndeipi.com.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa95d9d62710793c9dd33bde883672b94a933591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi-chat/git/trees/aa95d9d62710793c9dd33bde883672b94a933591"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tmoodley/ndeipi