/api.github.com/users/neerajyernale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neerajyernale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neerajyernale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neerajyernale","id":161309534,"login":"neerajyernale","node_id":"U_kgDOCZ1jXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neerajyernale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neerajyernale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neerajyernale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neerajyernale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neerajyernale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neerajyernale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neerajyernale/project/commits/237ed683596e5e5ea93ed6c2920f8346ff274104/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:42:55Z","email":"yneerajk2003@gmail.com","name":"neerajyernale"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:42:55Z","email":"yneerajk2003@gmail.com","name":"neerajyernale"},"message":"Connect the frontend to the Spring Boot backend; add account, 2FA, audit and cycle-count screens\n\n- Backend mode: `npm run start:backend` serves the shell with useMockApi=false\n  and /api proxied to localhost:8080 (same-origin refresh cookie)\n- Sign-in: one-time-code step for two-factor accounts, forgot-password form;\n  /accept-invite and /reset-password pages for the emailed links\n- Topbar: two-factor setup/disable dialog, banner when the workspace requires it\n- Admin: audit log page; resend invitation and reset 2FA row actions\n- Inventory: cycle counts (plan, count, review variances, post adjustments)\n- Mock API mirrors the new endpoints (schema v8) so `npm start` still works offline\n- e2e/backend-e2e.mjs: 5 browser scenarios against the real API\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <n