26-09-25T04:13:23Z","email":"www.dakshbhavsar3699@gmail.com","name":"DakshBhavsar007"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:13:23Z","email":"www.dakshbhavsar3699@gmail.com","name":"DakshBhavsar007"},"message":"feat(infra): connect k3s workloads to AWS RDS PostgreSQL and add cost management toggle\n\nPhase 7 — AWS RDS PostgreSQL + Kubernetes Secrets + Database Connectivity\n\nInfrastructure:\n- AWS RDS PostgreSQL 15.13 (db.t4g.micro, between-prod-db) provisioned\n- RDS security group restricts ingress to k3s EC2 security group only\n- DB subnet group spans 3 AZs in VPC vpc-0ae6efca7d7bba860\n- Kubernetes secret ''between-secrets'' configured with RDS connection\n- All 41+ Django migrations applied to RDS successfully\n\nFixes:\n- Fix ALLOWED_ORIGINS from wildcard ''*'' to valid URL origins\n- Fix k3s pod DNS resolution via resolv-conf config\n- Add scratch/ to .gitignore for credential safety\n\nCost Management:\n- Add Between-AWS-Toggle.bat/.ps1 for one-click EC2+RDS stop/start\n- Auto-detects state and toggles with safety confirmation\n- Proper ordering: RDS starts before EC2, EC2 stops before RDS\n\nVerified:\n- http://13.201.134.20/healthz -> HTTP 200\n- http://13.201.134.20/ -> HTTP 200\n- Backend connected to RDS (migrations applied, no PostgreSQL pod in k3s)\n- All between-namespace pods 1/1 Running","tree":{"sha":"5613f845a9e1da24c4c52bb7ce81c59d939438c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakshBhavsar007/Between-GitOPS/git/trees/5613f845a9e1da24c4c52bb7ce81c59d939438c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakshBhavsar007/Between-GitOPS/git/commits/3da368a1ac12b2d35a723de8604cab1139ceb9e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186709069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/followers","following_url":"htt