e limiter (15 req/min)\n- Removed all host subprocess.run from round_views.py\n\nIssue C: Admin Control Center with RBAC\n- Added @require_admin_role decorator in decorators.py\n- 5 new admin endpoints: sessions, audit-logs, groq-keys, gemini-projects, agent-config\n- Updated AdminDashboard.jsx with 8 module tabs\n\nIssue D: Encrypted Groq API Key Rotation\n- New: backend/api/utils/security.py (Fernet encryption)\n- Added GroqApiKey and AdminAuditLog models\n- Race-safe atomic usage counter via F(''usage_count'') + 1\n- Migration 0039_adminauditlog_groqapikey applied","tree":{"sha":"6aab0d953bfa9d01bbf1cf5bbd5150aaf3577ee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakshBhavsar007/Between-GitOPS/git/trees/6aab0d953bfa9d01bbf1cf5bbd5150aaf3577ee2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakshBhavsar007/Between-GitOPS/git/commits/440a61fd7f89a8d9f8f0daccaec89770d40ae460","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186709069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DakshBhavsar007","id":186709069,"login":"DakshBhavsar007","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD0TQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakshBhavsar007","user_view_type":"public